hadiths[478]{hadithnumber,text}:
"5742","main aur Sabit Bunani Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein hazir huey. Sabit ne kaha : abu-Hamza! (Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ki kunniyat) meri tabeeat kharaab ho gaee hai. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha phir kyon na main tum par wo dua padh kar dam kar dun jisey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) padha kartey they, Sabit ne kaha ke zaroor keejiye. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne is par ye dua padh kar dam kya اللهم رب Naas مذهب الباس اشف أنت الشافي لا شافي إلا أنت ، Mina padhi. شفاء لا يغادر سقما''aey Allah ! logon ke rab! takleef ko door kar dene waley ! shifa ata farma, to hi shifa dene wala hai terey siwa koi shifa dene wala nahi, aisi shifa ata farma ke bimari bilkul baqi na rahe."
"5743","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne ghar ke kuchh ( beemaaron ( par ye dua padh kar dam kartey aur apna daahinaa hath phertey aur ye dua padhtey اللهم رب Naas أذهب الباس ، Mina padhi. اشفه وأنت الشافي ، Mina padhi. لا شفاء إلا شفاؤك ، Mina padhi. شفاء لا يغادر سقما ''aey Allaah! logon ke paalne waale! takleef ko door kar de, usey shifa dedey to hi shifa dene wala hai. teri shifa ke siwa koi shifa nahi, aisi shifa ( de) ke kisi qism ki bimari baqi na reh jaaey.'' Sufiyan Sory ne bayan kya ke maine ye dua Mansoor bin Motamir ke samney bayan ki to unhon-ne mujh se ye Ibrahim Nakhai se bayan ki, unse Masruq ne aur unse Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne isi tarah bayan ki."
"5744","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) dam kya kartey they aur ye dua padhtey they امسح الباس رب Naas ، Mina ‏‏‏‏بيدك الشفاء ، Mina ‏‏‏‏لا كاشف له إلا أنت‏ ''takleef ko door kar de, aey logon ke paalanhaar! terey hi hath mein shifa hai, terey siwa takleef ko door karne wala koi aur nahi hai.''"
"5745","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mareez ke liye (kalimey ki ungli zameen par laga kar) ye dua padhtey they ( بسم الله , Mina تربة أرضنا‏ . Mina بريقة بعضنا , Mina ‏‏‏‏يشفى سقيمنا بإذن ربنا‏) ''Allaah ke naam ki madad se hamari zameen ki mitti ham mein se kisi ke thook ke sath taake hamara mareez shifa paaey hamarey rab ke hukm se.''"
"5746","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) dam kartey waqt ye dua padha kartey they ( تربة أرضنا , Mina وريقة بعضنا , Mina ‏‏‏‏يشفى سقيمنا , Mina بإذن ربنا‏ Mina .) '' hamari zameen ki mitti aur hamara kuchh thook hamarey rab ke hukm se hamarey mareez ko shifa ho. ''"
"5747","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke beshak achchha khuwab Allah ki taraf se hota hai, aur hilm (buraa khuwab jis mein ghabraahat ho) shaitan ki taraf se hota hai is liye jab tum mein se koi shakhs koi aisa khuwab dekhey jo bura ho to jaagtey hi teen martaba baain taraf thoo-thoo karey aur us khuwab ki burai se Allah ki panah maangey, is tarah khuwab ka usey nuqsan nahi hoga aur abu-Salma ne kaha ke pahley kuchh khuwab mujh par pahaad se bhi zyada bhari hota tha jab se maine ye hadis suni aur is par amal karne laga, ab mujhey koi parwah nahi hoti."
"5748","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab apne bistar par aaraam farmaney ke liye let'tey to apni donon hatheliyon par) قل هو الله أحد (aur ( قل أعوذ برب Naas (aur ( قل أعوذ برب Falaq ( sab padh kar dam kartey phir donon hathon ko apne chehra par aur jism ke jis hissey tak hath pahunch paata phertey. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ke phir jab aap bimar hotey to aap mujhey isi tarah karne ka hukm detey they. Yunus ne bayan kya ke maine ibne-Shahab ko bhi dekha ke wo jab apne bistar par let'tey isi tarah unko padh kar dam kya kartey they."
"5749","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke chand sahaba ( 300 log ( aik safar ke liye rawaana huey jisey unhein tay karna tha rastey mein unhon-ne Arab ke aik qabeele mein padao kya aur chaha ke qabeele waley unki mehmani karein lekin unhon-ne inkar kya, phir us qabeele ke sardaar ko bichho ne kaat liya usey achchha karne ki har tarah ki koshish unhon-ne kar dali lekin kisi se kuchh fayda nahi hua. aakhir unhiin mein se kisi ne kaha ke ye log jinhoney tumharey qabeele mein padao kar rakha hai unke paas bhi chalo, mumkin hai unmein se kisi ke paas koi mantar ho. chunanche wo sahaba ke paas aaey aur kaha logo! hamarey sardaar ko bichho ne kaat liya hai ham ne har tarah ki bahut koshish uske liye kar dali lekin kisi se koi fayda nahi hua kya tum logon mein se kisi ke paas uske liye mantr hai? sahaba mein se aik sahib ( Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu)) ne kaha ke haan, Allah ki qism mein jhaadanaa janta hun lekin ham ne tum se kaha tha ke hamari mehmani karo) ham musaafir hain) to tum ne inkar kar diya tha isliye main bhi us waqt tak nahi jhaadunga jab tak tum mere liye uski mazdoorii na thehra do. chunanche un logon ne kuchh bakriyon ( 30 ( par mamla kar liya. ab ye sahabi rawaana huey. ye zameen par thooktey jatey aur) الحمد لله رب العالمين ( Mina padhtey jatey uski barkat se wo aisa ho gaya jaisey uski rassii khul gaee ho aur wo is tarah chalney laga jaisey usey koi takleef hi na rahi ho. bayan kya ke phir wada ke mutabiq qabila walon ne un sahabi ki mazdoorii ( 30 bakriyan ( ada kar di kuchh logon ne kaha ke unko taqseem kar lo lekin jinhoney jhaada tha unhon-ne kaha ke abhi nahi, pahley ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hun poori sura haal aap ke samney bayan kar dein phir dekhein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamein kya hukm farmatey hain. chunanche sab log Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey to aap se iska zikr kya Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tumhen kaisey malum ho gaya tha ke is se dam kya ja sakta hai? tum ne achchha kya jao unko taqseem kar lo aur mera bhi apne sath aik hissey lagaao ."
"5750","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (apne ghar ke) kuchh logon par dam kartey waqt apna daahinaa hath phertey (aur ye dua padhtey they) أذهب الباس رب Naas ، Mina ‏‏‏‏واشف أنت الشافي ، Mina ‏‏‏‏لا شفاء إلا شفاؤك ، Mina ‏‏‏‏شفاء لا يغادر سقما ''takleef ko door kar de aey logon ke rab! aur shifa de, to hi shifa dene wala hai, shifa wahi hai jo teri taraf se ho aisi shifa ke bimari zara bhi baqi na reh jaaey.'' ( Sufiyan ne kaha ke) phir maine ye Mansoor se bayan kya to unhon-ne mujh se Ibrahim Nakhai se bayan kya, unse Masruq ne aur unse Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne us hi ki tarah bayan kya."
"5751","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne wafat k marz mein muawwizaat padh kar phoonktey they phir jab aap ke liye ye dushwar ho gaya to main aap par dam kya karti thi aur barkat ke liye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka hath aap ke jism par pherti thi. ( Mamar ne bayan kya ke) phir maine ibne-Shahab se sawal kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kis tarah dam kya kartey they? unhon-ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) pahley apne donon hathon par phoonk maartey phir unko chehrey par pher letey."
"5752","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik din hamarey paas bahar tashrif laey aur farmaya ke (khuwaab mein) mujh par tamam ummatein pesh ki gaiin. kuchh Nabi guzartey aur unke sath (unki ittaba (pairvi) karne wala) sirf aik hota. kuchh guzartey aur unke sath 2 hotey kuchh ke sath poori jamat hoti aur kuchh ke sath koi bhi na hota phir maine aik badi jamat dekhi jis se aasman ka kinara dhak gaya tha mein samjha ke ye meri hi ummat hogi lekin mujh se kaha gaya ke ye Musa (Alaihissalam) aur unki ummat ke log hain phir mujh se kaha ke dekho maine aik bahut badi jamat dekhi jisne aasmanon ka kinara dhanp liya hai. phir mujh se kaha gaya ke idhar dekho, idhar dekho, maine dekha ke bahut si jamatein hain jo tamam ufuq par muheet thin. kaha gaya ke ye aap ke ummat hai aur is mein se 70 hazaar wo log hongey jo be-hisaab jannat mein dakhil kiye jaeinge phir sahaba mukhtalif jaghon mein uth kar chaley gaey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uski wazaahat nahi ki ke ye 70 hazaar kon log hongey. sahaba kiram (Raziallahu anhu) ne aapas mein iske mutaalliq muzaakre kya aur kaha ke hamari paidaaish to shirk mein hui thi albatta baad mein ham Allah aur uske rasool par eman ley aaey lekin ye 70 hazaar hamarey betey hongey jo paidaaish hi se musalman hain. jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye baat pahunchi to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye 70 hazaar wo log hongey jo badfaalii nahi kartey, na mantr se jhaad-phoonk karatey hain aur na dagh lagaatey hain balke apne rab par bharosa kartey hain. ye sun kar Ukaasha-bin-Mohsin (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! kya main bhi unmein se hon? farmaya ke haan. aik doosrey sahib Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) ne khadey ho kar arz kya main bhi unmein se hoon? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Ukasha tum se bazi le gaey ke tum se pahley Ukasha ke liye jo hona tha ho chukaa."
"5753","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''beemaarii mein chhoot-chhaat ki aur badshigoonii ki koi asl nahi aur agar nahoosat hoti to ye sirf teen chizon mein hoti aurat mein, ghar main aur ghodey mein.''"
"5754","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''badshigoonii ki koi asl nahi albatta nek faal lena kuchh bura nahi hai.''sahaaba kiram (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : nek faal kya cheez hai? farmaya ''koii aisi baat sunnaa.''"
"5755","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''badshigoonii ki koi asl nahi aur is mein behtar faal nek hai.'' logon ne puchha ke nek faal kya hai ya rasoolullaah? farmaya ''nek baat jo tum mein se koi suney.''"
"5756","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''chhoot lag janey ki koi asl nahi aur na badshigoonii ki koi asl hai aur mujhey achi faal pasand hai.'' yani koi kalima khair aur nek baat jo kisi ke munh se suni jaey (jaisaa ke uper bayan hua)."
"5757","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' chhoot lag jana badshigoonii ya ullu ya safar ki nahoosat ye koi cheez nahi hai.''"
"5758","qabila huzail ki 2 aurton ke barey mein jinhoney jhagdaa kya tha yahan tak ke unmein se aik aurat ne dusri ko patthar phenk kar maara (jiska naam Muleka binte- Uwemir tha) wo patthar aurat ke pet mein ja kar laga. ye aurat haamla thi isliye iske pet ka bachcha (patthar ki chot se) mar gaya. ye mamla donon fareeq Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas le gaey to aap ne faisla kya ke aurat ke pet ke bachcha ki diyat aik ghulam ya baandi aazad karna hai jis aurat par taawaan wajib hua tha uske wali (hamal bin Malik bin naabgha ( ne kaha ya Rasulullah! main aisi cheez ki diyat kaisey de dun jisne na khaya na piyaa na bola aur na wilaadat ke waqt uski awaz hi sunai dii? aisi sura main to kuchh bhi diyat nahi ho sakti . Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke ye shakhs to kaahinon ka bhai malum hota hai."
"5759","2 auratein thin, aik ne dusri ko patthar de maara jis se uske pet ka hamal gir gaya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us maamle mein aik ghulam ya baandi ka diyat mein diye janey ka faisla kya."
"5760","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne janeen jisey uski maa ke pet mein mar daala gaya ho, ki diyat ke taur par aik ghulam ya aik baandi diye janey ka faisla kya tha jisey diyat deeni thi usne kaha ke aisey bachche ki diyat aakhir kyon dun jisne na khaayaa, na piyaa, na bola aur na wilaadat ke waqt hi awaz nikaalii? aisi sura main to diyat nahi ho saktii. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye shakhs to kaahinon ka bhai malum hota hai."
"5761","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kuttey ki qeemat , zina ki ujrat aur kaahin ki kahaanat ki wjah se milney waley hadiya se mana farmaya hai."
"5762","kuchh logon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaahinon ke mutaalliq puchha Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke uski koi buniyad nahi. logon ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah ! kabhi-kabhi wo hamein aisi cheezein bhi bataatey hain jo sahi ho jati hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye kalima haq hota hai. usey kaahin kisi jinnii se sun leta hai wo jinnii apne dost kaahin ke kaan mein daal jata hai aur phir ye kaahin iske sath so jhoot mila kar bayan kartey hain. Ali-bin-Abdullaah madeenii ne bayan kya ke Abdur-Razzaq us kalima ( تلك الكلمة من الحق ( ko mursalan riwayat kartey they phir unhon-ne kaha mujh ko ye khabar pahunchi ke Abdur-Razzaq iske baad usko musnadan Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat kya hai."
"5763","bani zuraiq ke aik shakhs Yahudi Labid bin Aa'sam ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par jaadoo kar diya tha aur uski wjah se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kisi cheez ke mutaalliq khayal kartey ke aap ne wo kaam kar liya hai halanke aap ne wo kaam na kya hota. aik din ya ( rawi ne bayan kya ke) aik raat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere yahan tashrif rakhtey they aur musalsal dua kar rahe they phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Aaisha ! tumhen malum hai Allah se jo baat mein poochh raha tha, us ne iska jawab mujhey de diya. mere paas 2 ( Farishtey Jibraeel w Mikaail (Alaihissalam) ( aaey. aik mere sar ki taraf khada ho gaya aur doosra mere paon ki taraf . aik ne apne doosrey sathi se puchha un sahib ki bimari kya hai? doosrey ne kaha ke un par jaadoo hua hai. us ne puchha kis ne jaadoo kya hai? jawab diya ke Labid ne. puchha kis cheez mein ? jawab diya ke kanghey aur sar ke baal mein jo nar khajoor ke khoshey mein rakhey huey hain. sawal kya aur ye jaadoo hai kahan ? jawab diya ke zarwaan ke kuwein mein. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us kuwein par apne chand sahaba ke sath tashrif le gaey aur jab wapas aaey to farmaya Aaisha ! iska pani aisa ( surkh ( tha jaisey mahndii ka nichod hota hai aur uske khajoor ke darakhton ke sar ( uper ka hissa ( shaitan ke saron ki tarah they maine arz kya ya Rasulullah ! aap ne us jaadoo ko bahar kyon nahi kar diya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala ne mujhey us se aafiyat de di isliye maine munasib nahi samjha ke ab main khah-m-khah logon mein us burai ko phailaaun phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us jaadoo ka saman kanghi baal khurmaa ka ghilaaf hotey hain usi mein dafn kara diya. Esa-bin-Yonus ke sath us hadis ko abu-Usama aur abu-Zamra (Anas bin ayaaz) aur ibne-abi zinaad teenon ne Hisham se yun riwayat kya aur Lais bin Miswar aur Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne Hisham se yun riwayat kya hai) في مشط ومشاقة‏ . Mina , المشاطة ( usey kehtey hain jo baal kanghi karne mein niklin sar ya dadhi ke aur) مشاقة‏) rooii ke taar yani soot ke taar ko kehtey hain."
"5764","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tabaah kar dene wali cheez Allah ke sath shirk karna hai us se bacho aur jaadoo karne karaaney se bhi bacho.''"
"5765","mujh se ye hadis aale-Urwa ne Urwa se bayan ki, isliye maine (Urwa ke betey) Hisham se iske barey mein puchha to unhon-ne ham se apne walid ( Urwa ( se bayan kya ke unse Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par jaadoo kar diya gaya tha aur iska aap par ye asar hua tha aapko khayal hota ke aap ne paak beeviyon mein se kisi ke sath ham-bistarii ki hai halanke aap ne ki nahi hoti. Sufiyan Sory ne bayan kya ke jaadoo ki ye sabse sakht qism hai jab iska ye asar ho phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya Aaisha! tumhen malum hai Allah Taala se jo baat maine poochhi thi iska jawab us ne Kab ka de diya hai. mere paas 2 Farishtey aaey aik mere sar ke paas khada ho gaya aur doosra mere paon ke paas. jo farishta mere sar ki taraf khada tha us ne doosrey se kaha un sahib ka kya haal hai? doosrey ne jawab diya ke un par jaadoo kar diya gaya hai. puchha ke kis ne un par jaadoo kya hai? jawab diya ke Labid ne ye yahudiyon ke haleef bani zuraiq ka aik shakhs tha aur munafiq tha. sawal kya ke kis cheez mein un par jaadoo kya hai? jawab diya ke kanghey aur baal mein. puchha jaadoo hai kahaan? jawab diya ke nar khajoor ke khoshey mein jo zarwaan ke kuwein ke andar rakhey huey patthar ke nichey dafn hai. bayan kya ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us kuwein par tashrif le gaey aur jaadoo andar se nikaalaa. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke yahi wo kunwaan hai jo mujhey khuwab mein dikhaya gaya tha iska pani mahndii ke arq jaisa rangeen tha aur uske khajoor ke darakhton ke sar shaitanon ke saron jaisey they. bayan kya ke phir wo jaadoo kuwein mein se nikala gaya. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke maine kaha aap ne us jaadoo ka tod kyon nahi karaya. farmaya : haan Allah Taala ne mujhey shifa di ab main logon mein aik shor hona pasand nahi karta."
"5766","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par jaadoo kar diya gaya tha aur iska asar ye tha ke aapko khayal hota ke aap koi cheez kar chukey hain halanke wo cheez na ki hoti aik din Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere yahan tashrif rakhtey they aur musalsal duaein kar rahe they, phir farmaya : Aaisha ! tumhen malum hai Allah Taala se jo baat maine poochhi thi iska jawab usne mujhey de diya hai. maine kaha wo kya baat hai ya Rasulullah ! Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya mere paas 2 Farishtey ( Jibraeel w Mikaail (Alaihissalam) ( aaey aur aik mere sar ke paas khada ho gaya aur doosra paon ki taraf phir aik ne apne doosrey sathi se kaha un sahib ki takleef kya hai? doosrey ne jawab diya ke in par jaadoo kya gaya hai. puchha kis ne un par jaadoo kya hai? farmaya bani zuraiq ke Labid bin Aa'sam Yahudi ne, puchha kis cheez mein? jawab diya ke kanghey aur baal mein jo nar khajoor ke khoshey mein rakha hua hai. puchha aur wo jaadoo rakha kahan hai? jawab diya ke doran ke kuwein mein. bayan kya ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne chand sahaba ke sath us kuwein par tashrif le gaey aur usey dekha wahan khajoor ke darakht bhi they phir aap wapas Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke yahan tashrif laey aur farmaya (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Allah ki qism ! iska pani mahndii ke arq jaisa ( surkh ( hai aur uske khajoor ke darakht shayatin ke saron jaisey hain. maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! wo kanghi baal wghaira ghilaaf se nikalwaaey ya nahi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya nahi, sun lo Allah ne to mujh ko shifa de di, tandurust kar diya ab main dara kahin logon mein aik shor na phailey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us saman ke gaad dene ka hukm diya wo gaad diya gaya."
"5767","2 aadmi poorab ki taraf (mulk iraaq) se (9 hijri mein) Madina aaey aur logon ko khitab kya log unki taqreer se bahut mutassir huey to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kuchh taqreerein bhi jaadoo bhari hoti hain ya ye farmaya ke kuchh taqreer jaadoo hoti hain."
"5768","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo shakhs rozaana chand ajwa khajoorein kha liya karey usey us din raat tak zahar aur jaadoo nuqsan nahi pahuncha sakengey. Ali-bin-Abdullaah madeenii ke siwa doosrey rawi ne bayan kya ke saat (7) khajoorein kha liya kare."
"5769","maine Aamir-bin-Sad se suna, unhon-ne Sad-bin-abi-Waqas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne bayan kya ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jis shakhs ne subah ke waqt saat (7) ajwa khajoorein kha lein us din usey na zahar nuqsan pahuncha sakta hai aur na jaadoo."
"5770","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke chhoot lag jana , safar ki nahoosat aur ullu ki nahoosat koi cheez nahi. aik dehati ne kaha : ya Rasulullah ! phir us oont ke mutaalliq kya kaha jaeyga jo registaan mein hiran ki tarah saaf chamakdaar hota hai lekin khaarish wala oont usey mil jata hai aur usey bhi khaarish laga deta hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya lekin pahley oont ko kis ne khaarish lagai thi?"
"5771","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke koi shakhs apne bimar oonton ko kisi ke sihat mand oonton mein na ley jaey. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne pehli hadis ka inkar kya. ham ne ( Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se) arz kya ke aap hi ne ham se ye hadis nahi bayan ki hai ke chhoot ye nahi hota phir wo (ghussa mein) habshi zaban bolney lagey. abu-Salma-bin-Abdur-Rehman ne bayan kya ke is hadis ke siwa maine Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ko aur koi hadis bhooltey nahi dekha."
"5772","mujhey Salim bin-Abdullah aur Hamza ne khabar di aur unse Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke chhoot lag janey ki koi haqiqat nahi hai, badshigoonii ki koi asl nahi. (agar mumkin hoti to ( nahoosat teen chizon mein hoti, ghodey mein, aurat main aur ghar mein."
"5773","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke chhoot ki koi haqiqat nahi."
"5774","mareez oonton wala apne oont tandurust oonton waley ke oont mein na chhodey ."
"5775","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke chhoot koi cheez nahi hai. is par aik dehati ne khadey ho kar puchha aap ne dekha hoga ke aik oont registaan mein hiran jaisa saaf rehta hai lekin jab wahi aik khaarish waley oont ke paas aa jata hai to usey bhi khaarish ho jati hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya lekin pahley oont ko kis ne khaarish lagai thi."
"5776","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke chhoot lagna koi cheez nahi hai aur badshigoonii nahi hai albatta nek faal mujhey pasand hai. sahabi ne arz kya nek faal kya hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke achi baat munh se nikaalnaa ya kisi se sun lenaa."
"5777","jab khaibar fateh hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aik bakri hadiye mein pesh ki gaee (eik Yahudi aurat Zenab binte- hars ne pesh ki thi) jis mein zahar bharaa hua tha, is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan, par jitney Yahudi hain unhein mere paas jama karo. chunanche sab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas jama kiye gaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main tum se aik baat poochhunga kya tum mujhey sahi saheeh baat bata doge? unhon-ne kaha ke haan, aey abul-Qaasim! phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tumhara pardada kon hai? unhon-ne kaha ke fulaan. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum jhoot kehtey ho tumhara pardada to falan hai. is par wo boley ke aap ne sach farmaya, durust farmaya, phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya kya agar main tum se koi baat poochhunga to tum mujhey sach sach bata doge ? unhon-ne kaha ke haan, aey abul-Qaasim ! aur agar ham jhoot bolein bhi to aap hamara jhoot pakad lengey jaisa ke abhi hamarey pardada ke mutaalliq aap ne hamara jhoot pakad liya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke dozakh waley kon log hain? unhon-ne kaha ke kuchh din ke liye to ham usmein rahengey phir aap log hamari jagah ley lengey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum usmein zillat ke sath padey rahogey, Allah ki qasam! ham usmein tumhari jagah kabhi nahi lengey. aap ne phir unse malum farmaya kya agar main tum se aik baat poochhoon to tum mujhey iske mutaalliq sahi saheeh bata doge? unhon-ne kaha ke haan? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya kya tum ne us bakri mein zahar milaya tha, unhon-ne kaha ke haan. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke tumhen us kaam par kis jazbey ne aamada kya tha? unhon-ne kaha ke hamara maqsad ye tha ke agar aap jhootey hongey to hamein aap se nijat mil jaeygi aur agar sachey hongey to aapko nuqsan nahi pahuncha sakega."
"5778","maine Zakwan se suna, wo Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se ye hadis bayan kartey they ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jisne pahaad se apne aapko gira kar khudkushii kar li wo jahannam ki aag mein hoga aur is mein hamesha padaa rahega aur jisne zahar pi kar khudkushii kar li wo zahar iske sath mein hoga aur jahannam ki aag mein wo usey isi tarah hamesha peetaa rahega aur jisne lohey ke kisi hathiyar se khudkushii kar li to uska hathiyar uske sath mein hoga aur jahannam ki aag mein hamesha ke liye wo usey apne pet mein maarta rahega."
"5779","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo shakhs subah ke waqt saat (7) ajwa khajoorein kha ley usey us din zahar nuqsan pahuncha sakega aur na jaadoo.''"
"5780","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne har daant se khaney waley darinde janwar (ke gosht) se mana farmaya, Zohri ne bayan kya ke maine ye hadis us waqt tak nahi suni jab tak Sham (Syria) nahi aaya."
"5781","maine abu-Idrees se puchha kya ham ( dawaa ke taur par) gadhi ke doodh se wuzu kar saktey hain ya usey pi saktey hain ya darinda janwaron ke pittey istemal kar saktey hain ya oont ka peshab pi saktey hain. abu-Idrees ne kaha ke musalman oont ke peshab ko dawaa ke taur par istemal kartey they aur is mein koi harj nahi samajhtey they. albatta gadhi ke doodh ke barey mein hamein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ye hadis pahunchi hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne iske gosht se mana farmaya tha. iske doodh ke mutaalliq hamein koi hukm ya manaahii Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se malum nahi hai. albatta darindon ke pittey ke mutaalliq jo ibne-Shahab ne bayan kya ke mujhey abu-Idrees Kholani ne khabar di aur unhein abu-So'lba Khushni (Raziallahu anhu) ne khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne har daant waley shikaarii darindey ka gosht khaney se mana farmaya hai."
"5782","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' jab makkhii tum mein se kisi ke bartan mein pad jaey to poori makkhii ko bartan mein dubo de aur phir usey nikal kar phenk de kyonke iske aik par main shifa aur doosrey mein bimari hai.''"
"5783","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala uski taraf qiyamat ke din nazar rehmat nahi karega jo apna kapda takabbur w ghurur se zameen par ghaseet kar chalta hai.''"
"5784","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo shakhs takabbur ki wjah se tehband ghaseet'taa hua chalega to Allah paak uski taraf qiyamat ke din nazar bhi nahi karega.'' Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah! mere tahmad ka aik hissey kabhi latak jata hai magar ye ke khas taur se iska khayal rakha karun. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum un logon mein se nahi ho jo aisa takabbur se kartey hain.''"
"5785","suraj girahan hua to ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they. aap jaldi mein kapda ghaseet'tey huey masjid mein tashrif laaey, log bhi jama ho gaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne 2 rakaat Namaz padhai, girahan khatm ho gaya, tab aap hamari taraf mutwajjeh huey aur farmaya ''sooraj aur chaand Allah ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain isliye jab tum un nishaniyon mein se koi nishani dekho to Namaz padho aur Allah se dua karo yahan tak ke wo khatm ho jaaey.''"
"5786","phir maine dekha ke Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) aik neza lekar aaey aur usey zameen mein gaad diya phir Namaz ke liye takbeer kahi gaee. maine dekha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik joda pahney huey bahar tashrif laey jisey aap ne samet rakha tha. phir aap ne neze ke samney khadey ho kar do rakaat namaaze-eid padhai aur maine dekha ke insan aur janwar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney neze ke bahar ki taraf se guzar rahe they."
"5787","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tehband ka jo hissey takhnon se nichey latkaa ho wo jahannam mein hoga.''"
"5788","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo shakhs apna tahmad ghurur ki wjah se ghaseet'taa hai, Allah Taala qiyamat ke din uski taraf dekhega nahi. ''"
"5789","Nabi ya (ye bayan kya ke) abul-Qaasim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''(banii-Israaeel mein) aik shakhs aik joda pahan kar kibr w ghurur mein sar mast, sar ke baalon mein kanghi kiye huey akad kar itraataa ja raha tha ke Allah Taala ne usey zameen mein dhansaa diya ab wo qiyamat tak usmein tadaptaa rahega ya dhanstaa rahega.''"
"5790","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''eik shakhs ghurur mein apna tahmad ghaseet'taa hua chal raha tha ke usey zameen mein dhansaa diya gaya aur wo isi tarah qiyamat tak zameen mein dhanstaa hi rahega.'' uski mutabiat (pairavi) Yunus ne Zohri se ki hai, unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se, usey marfooan nahi bayan kya."
"5791","maine mahaarib-bin-dassaar qazi se mulaqat ki, wo ghodey par Sawar they aur makan adaalat mein aa rahe they jis mein wo faisla kya kartey they. maine unse yahi hadis poochhi to unhon-ne mujh se bayan kya, kaha ke maine Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo aap apna kapda ghurur ki wjah se ghaseet'taa hua chalega, qiyamat ke din uski taraf Allah Taala nazar nahi karega.'' (Shoba ne kaha ke) maine Maharib se puchha kya ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne tahmad ka zikr kya tha? unhon-ne farmaya ke tahmad ya qamees kisi ki unhon-ne takhsees nahi ki thi. Maharib ke sath us hadis ko jabla bin Saheem aur Zaid-bin-Aslam aur Zaid bin-Abdullah ne bhi Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat kya, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se. aur Leis ne Naafe se, unhon-ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se aisi hi riwayat ki aur Naafe ke sath usko Musa-bin-Aqba aur Umar-bin Muhammad aur Qudama bin-Musa ne bhi Salim se, unhon-ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat ki usmein yun hai ke jo shakhs apna kapda ( az-raah takabbur ( latkaaey."
"5792","Rifaa Qarzi (Raziallahu anhu) ki biwi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaein . main bhi baithi hui thi aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) maujood they. unhon-ne kaha : ya Rasulullah! main Rifaa ke nikah mein thi lekin unhon-ne mujhey teen talaaq de di hain. ( mughalliza ( . iske baad maine Abdur-Rehman bin Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) se nikah kar liya aur Allah ki qism ke unke sath ya Rasulullah! sirf is jhaalar jaisa hai. unhon-ne apni chadar ke jhaalar ko apne hath mein lekar ishara kya. Khaalid-bin-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) jo darwazey par khadey they aur unhein abhi andar aaney ki ijazat nahi hui thi, usne bhi unki baat suni. bayan kya ke Khalid (Raziallahu anhu)) wahin se) boley Abu-Bakar ! aap us aurat ko roktey nahi ke kis tarah ki baat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney khol kar bayan karti hai lekin Allah ki qism is baat par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka tabassum aur badh gaya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke ghaaliban tum dobara Rifaa ke paas jana chahti ho? lekin aisa us waqt tak mumkin nahi jab tak wo ( tumharey doosrey shauhar Abdur-Rehman bin Zuber ( tumhara mazaa na chakh lein aur tum unka mazaa na chakh lo phir baad mein yahi qanoon bin gaya."
"5793","Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya (ke Hamza (Raziallahu anhu) ne sharab ke haram honey se pahley sharab ke nashe mein jab unki ontni zabah kar di aur unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aa kar uski shikayat ki to ( Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni chadar mangwai aur usey odh kar tashrif ley chalney lagey. main aur Zaid-bin-Haarisa (Raziallahu anhu) aap ke peechhey peechhey they. aakhir aap us ghar mein pahunchey jis mein Hamza (Raziallahu anhu) they, aap ne andar aaney ki ijazat mangi aur unhon-ne aap hazraat ko ijazat di."
"5794","aik sahib ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah! ehram waala shakhs kis tarah ka kapda pahney. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ehram wala shakhs qamees, paa-jaama, barans ( topii ya sar par pahnney ki koi cheez (aur mozey nahi pahnega albatta agar usey chappal na milein to mozon hi ko takhnon tak kaat kar pahan ley wo hi jootii ki tarah ho jaengey."
"5795","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Abdullah-bin-Ubai (munaafiq) ke paas jab usey qabr mein dakhil kya ja chuka tha tashrif laey phir aap ke hukm se uski laash nikaalii gaee aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ghutnon par usey rakha gaya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par dam kartey huey apni qamees pahnaaii aur Allah hi khub jaanney wala hai."
"5796","jab Abdullah-bin-Ubai ki wafat hui to iske ladkey ( Abdullah ( jo mukhlis aur akaabir sahaba mein they Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ! ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! apni qamees mujhey ata farmaiye taake main apne bap ko iska kafan dun aur aap unki namaaze-janaaza padha dein aur unke liye duaaey maghfirat karein chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni qamees unhein ata farmai aur farmaya ke nehlaa-dhulaa kar mujhey itlaa dena. chunanche jab nehlaa-dhulaa liya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko itlaa di Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey taake uski namaaze-janaaza padhaaein lekin umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne aapko pakad liya aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah! kya Allah Taala ne aapko munaafeqeen par namaaze-janaaza padhney se mana nahi farmaya hai? aur farmaya hai استغفر لهم أو لا تستغفر لهم إن تستغفر لهم سبعين Murra فلن يغفر الله لهم ke ''unke liye maghfirat ki dua karo ya maghfirat ki dua na karo agar tum 70 martaba bhi unke liye maghfirat ki dua karogey tab bhi Allah unhein hargiz nahi bakhsheyga.'' phir ye aayat nazil huii ولا تصل على أحد منهم مات أبدا ke ''aur unmein se kisi par bhi jo mar gaya ho hargiz Namaz na padhiye.'' iske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unki namaaze-janaaza padhni chhod di."
"5797","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kanjoos aur sadqa dene waley ki misal bayan kya ke 2 aadmiyon jaisi hai jo lohey ke jubbey haath, Sina aur halaq tak pahney huey hain. sadqa dene wala jab bhi sadqa karta hai to iske jubbe mein kushadgi ho jati hai aur wo uski ungliyon tak badh jata hai aur qadam ke nishanat ko dhak leta hai aur kanjoos jab bhi kabhi sadqe ka irada karta hai to uska jubba usey aur chimat jata hai aur har halqa apni jagah par jam jata hai. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke maine dekha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) is tarah apni Mubarak ungliyon se apne garebaan ki taraf ishara karke bata rahe they ke tum dekhogey ke wo usmein wusat paida karna chaahega lekin wusat paida nahi hogi. iski mutabiat (pairavi) ibne-Taaoos ne apne walid se ki hai aur abu-Zinaad ne Aaraj se ki '' 2 jubbon'' ke zikr ke sath aur Hanzala ne bayan kya ke maine Taaus se suna, unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne kaha (جبتان) aur Jafar ne Aaraj ke waaste se ( جبتان‏ . Mina (ka lafz bayan kya hai."
"5798","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) qazaey-hajat ke liye bahar tashrif le gaey phir wapas aaey to main pani lekar hazir tha. aap ne wuzu kya aap shaami jubba pahney huey they, aap ne kulli ki aur naak mein pani daala aur apna chehra dhoya phir apni aasteenein chadhaaney lagey lekin wo tang thi isliye aap ne apne hath jubbe ke nichey se nikaley aur unhein dhoya aur sar par aur mozon par masah kya."
"5799","mein aik raat safar main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath tha aap ne malum farmaya tumharey paas pani hai? maine arz kya ke ji haan. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni sawari se utrey aur chaltey rahe yahan tak ke raat ki taareeki mein aap chhup gaey phir wapas tashrif laey to maine bartan ka pani aapko istemal karaya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna chehra dhoya, hath dhoey aap oon ka jubba pahney huey they jiski aasteen chadhai aap ke liye dushwar thi chunanche aap ne apne hath jubba ke nichey se nikaley aur baazuon ko (kohniyon tak) dhoya. phir sar par masah kya phir main badha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke mozey utaar dun lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke rehney do maine tahaarat ke baad unhein pehna tha chunanche aap ne un par masah kya."
"5800","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chand qubaaein taqseem kiin aur Makhrima (Raziallahu anhu) ko kuchh nahi diya to Makhrima (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha betey hamein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas ley chalo chunanche main apne walid ko sath lekar chalaa, unhon-ne mujh se kaha ke andar jao aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mera zikr kar do. maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Makhrima (Raziallahu anhu) ka zikr kya to aap bahar tashrif laey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unhein qubaaon mein se aik Quba liye huey they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye maine tumharey hi liye rakh chhodi thi. Miswar ne bayan kya ke Makhrima (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf dekha to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Makhrima khush ho gaey."
"5801","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko resham ki furooj (Qubaa) hadiya mein di gaee. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey pehna (resham ka mardon ke liye hurmat ke hukm se pahley) aur usi ko pahney huey Namaz padhi. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey badi tezi ke sath utaar daala jaisey aap us se na-gawari mehsus kartey hon phir farmaya ke ye muttaqiyon ke liye munasib nahi hai. is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Abdullah-bin Yusuf ne ki unse Leis ne aur Abdullah-bin Yusuf ke ilawa dusron ne kaha ke (furooj hareer)."
"5802","maine Anas (Raziallahu anhu) par reshamii zard topii ko dekha."
"5803","aik shakhs ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah! ehram wala shakhs kis tarah ka kapda pahney? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya (mohrim ke liye) ke qamees na pahno, na amaamey, na paajaamey, na barans aur na mozey albatta agar kisi ko chappal na miley to wo (chamdey ke) mozon ko takhna se nichey tak kaat kar unhein pahan sakta hai aur na koi aisa kapda pahno jis mein zafran ya waras lagaya gaya ho."
"5804","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( mohrim (ehraam walaa shakhs) ke barey mein) farmaya ''jisey tahmad na miley wo paa-jaama pahney aur jisey chappal na milein wo mozey pahnein.''"
"5805","aik sahib ne khadey ho kar arz kya : ya Rasulullah! ehram baandhney ke baad hamein kis cheez ke pahnney ka hukm hai? farmaya ke qamees na pahno, na paajaamey, na amaamey, na barans aur na mozey pahno. albatta agar kisi ke paas chappal na hon to wo chamdey ke aisey mozey pahney jo takhnon se nichey hon aur koi aisa kapda na pahno jis mein zafran aur waras laga hua ho."
"5806","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mohrim (ehraam walaa shakhs) qamees na pahney, na amama pahney, na paa-jaama, na barans aur na koi aisa kapda pahney jis mein zafran aur waras laga ho aur na mozey pahney albatta agar kisi ko chappal na milein to mozon ko takhnon ke nichey tak kaat de ( phir pahney ( ."
"5807","bahut se musalman Habsha hijrat karke chaley gaey aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) bhi hijrat ki taiyaariyaan karne lagey lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke abhi thahar jao kyonke mujhey bhi ummeed hai ke mujhey ( hijrat ki) ijazat di jaeygi Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : kya aapko bhi ummeed hai? mera bap aap par qurbaan . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan. chunanche Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath rehney ke khayal se ruk gaey aur apni 2 oontniyon ko babool ke pattey khilaa kar char mahiney tak unhein khub taiyaar kartey rahe. Urwa ne bayan kya ke Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ham aik din do-pahar ke waqt apne ghar mein baithey huey they ke aik shakhs ne Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sar dhakey huey tashrif la rahe hain. us waqt aam taur se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey yahan tashrif nahi latey they Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha mere maan-baap Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par qurbaan hon, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aisey waqt kisi wjah hi se tashrif la saktey hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne makan par pahunch kar ijazat chahi aur Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein ijazat di. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) andar tashrif laey aur andar dakhil hotey hi Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) se farmaya ke jo log tumharey paas is waqt hain unhein utha do Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha mera bap aap par qurbaan ho ya Rasulullah ! ye sab aap ke ghar hi ke afraad hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mujhey hijrat ki ijazat mil gaee hai. Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha phir ya Rasulullah ! mujhey sath rehney ki khushnasibi hasil rahegi? aap ne farmaya ke haan. kaha ya Rasulullah ! mere bap aap par qurbaan hon un do oontniyon mein se aik aap ley lein. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya lekin qeemat se. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke phir ham ne bahut jaldi jaldii saamaane-safar taiyaar kya aur safar ka naashta aik thailey mein rakha. Asma binte abi-Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) ne apne patkey ke aik tukdey se thailey ke munh ko baandhaa. isi wjah se unhein ''zaatun-nitaaq'' (patkey waali) kehney lagey. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) saur naam ke pahaad ki aik ghaar mein ja kar chhup gaey aur teen din tak usi mein thahrey rahe. Abdullah-bin abi-Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) raat aap hazraat ke paas hi guzaartey they. wo naujawaan zaheen aur samajhdaar they. subah tadkey mein wahan se chal detey they aur subah hotey hotey Makka ke Quraish mein pahunch jatey they. jaisey raat main Makka hi mein rahe hun. Makka Mukarrama mein jo baat bhi un hazraat ke khilaf hoti usey mehfooz rakhtey aur joon hi raat ka andhera chhaa jata ghaare-saur mein un hazraat ke paas pahunch kar tamam tafseelaat ki itlaa detey Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke Maula Aamir-bin-Fuhaira (Raziallahu anhu) doodh dene wali bakriyan charaatey they aur jab raat ka aik hissey guzar jata to un bakriyon ko ghaare-saur ki taraf haank latey they. aap hazraat bakriyon ke doodh par raat guzaartey aur subah ki po phat'tey hi Aamir-bin-Fuhaira (Raziallahu anhu) wahan se rawaana ho jatey. un teen raaton mein unhon-ne har raat aisa hi kya."
"5808","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) fateh Makka ke saal (Makka Mukarrama mein) dakhil huey to aap ke sar par khaud thi."
"5809","main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath chal raha tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke jism par (Yaman ke) Najran ki bani hui motey haashiye ki aik chadar thi. itney mein aik dehati aa gaya aur us ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki chadar ko pakad kar itni zor se kheenchaa ke maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke mundhey par dekha ke iske zor se kheenchney ki wjah se nishan pad gaya tha. phir usne kaha : aey Muhammad ! mujhey is maal mein se diye janey ka hukm kiijiye jo Allah ka maal aap ke paas hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uski taraf mutwajjeh huey aur muskuraaey aur aap ne usey diye janey ka hukm farmaayaa."
"5810","aik aurat aik chadar lekar aaein (jo us ne khud bunii thi) Sehal (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha tumhen malum hai wo parda kya tha phir batlaya ke ye aik ooni chadar thi jiske kinaron par haashiya hota hai. un khatun ne hazir ho kar arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! ye chadar maine khas aap ke odhney ke liye bunii hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wo chadar unse is tarah li maano aapko uski zarurat hai. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usey tahmad ke taur par pahan kar hamarey paas tashrif laey. sahaba ki jama'at mein se aik sahib ( Abdur-Rehman-bin-Auf ( ne us chadar ko chhuwa aur kaha ya Rasulullah ! ye mujhey inayat farma dijiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke achchha . jitni der Allah ne chaha aap majlis mein baithey rahe phir tashrif le gaey aur us chadar ko lapet kar un sahib ke paas bhijwa diya. sahaba ne is par unse kaha tum ne achi baat nahi ki ki Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se wo chadar maang li. tumhen malum hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kabhi sawal karney waley ko mahroom nahi farmatey. un sahib ne kaha : Allah ki qism ! maine to sirf Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ye isliye mangi hai ki jab main maroon to ye mera kafan ho. Sehal (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya chunanche wo chadar us sahabi ke kafan hi mein istemal hui."
"5811","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke meri ummat mein se jannat mein 70 hazaar ki aik jamat dakhil hogi unke chehrey chaand ki tarah chamak rahe hongey. Ukaasha-bin-Mohsin Asadi (Raziallahu anhu) apni dhaarii daar chadar sanbhaaltey huey uthey aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! mere liye bhi dua kijiye ke Allah Taala mujhey unhiin mein se bana de. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aey Allah ! Ukasha ko bhi unhiin mein se bana de. iske baad qabila Ansar ke aik sahabi Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) khadey huey aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! dua farmaein ke Allah Taala mujhey bhi unmein se bana de. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum se pahley Ukasha dua kara chukaa."
"5812","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kis tarah ka kapda zyada pasand tha bayan kya ke Hibra ki sabz yamnii chadar ."
"5813","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko tamam kapdon mein yamnii sabz chadar pahannaa chahiye bahut pasand thi."
"5814","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak bevi Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne unhein khabar di ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat hui to aap ki laash Mubarak par aik sabz yamnii chadar daal di gaee thi."
"5815","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par jab aakhiri marz taarii hua to aap apni kamlii chehra Mubarak par daltey they aur jab saans ghutney lagta to chehra khol letey aur usi haalat mein farmatey ''yahood w nasara Allah Taala ki rehmat se door ho gaey ke unhon-ne apne anbiya ki qabron ko sajda gaah bana liyaa.'' Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unke burey kaamo se (musalmaanon ko) dara rahe they."
"5816","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par jab aakhiri marz taarii hua to aap apni kamlii chehra Mubarak par daltey they aur jab saans ghutney lagta to chehra khol letey aur usi haalat mein farmatey ''yahood w nasara Allah Taala ki rehmat se door ho gaey ke unhon-ne apne anbiya ki qabron ko sajda gaah bana liyaa.'' Nabi Karim (sl) unke burey kaamo se (musalmaanon ko) dara rahe they."
"5817","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni aik naqshii chadar mein Namaz padhi aur uske naqsh w nigaar par Namaz hi mein aik nazar dali . phir salam pher kar farmaya ke meri ye chadar abu-Jaheem ko wapas de do. us ne abhi mujhey meri Namaz se ghaafil kar diya tha aur abu-Jaheem ki saadii chadar letey aao . ye abu-Jaheem bin Huzefa bin ghaanim bani Adii-bin Kab qabeeley mein se they."
"5818","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne hamein aik motii kamlii ( كساء (aur aik motii izaar nikal kar dikhai aur kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Rooh un hi 2 kapdon mein qabz hui thi."
"5819","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Sauda mulaamisa aur munaabiza se mana farmaya aur do waqt namazon se bhi aap ne mana farmaya, namaze-Fajr ke baad suraj buland honey tak aur Asr ke baad suraj ghurub honey tak aur us se mana farmaya ke koi shakhs sirf aik kapda jism par lapet kar ghutney uper utha kar is tarah baith jaey ke uski sharmgah par aasman w zameen ke darmyan koi cheez na ho aur ishtimaale-Sammaa (chaadar ko is tarah lapetna ki jism ka ek taraf ka hissa khula rahe) se mana farmaayaa."
"5820","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne do tarah ke pahnaawey aur do tarah ki khareed w farokht se mana farmaya, khareed w farokht mein mulaamisa aur munaabiza se mana farmaya, mulaamisa ki sura ye thi ke aik shakhs ( khareedaar ( doosrey ( bechney waale) ke kapdey ko raat ya din mein kisi bhi waqt bas chhu deta (aur dekhey baghair sirf chhooney se Sauda ho jaata) sirf chhoonaa hi kafi tha khol kar dekha nahi jata tha. munaabiza ki sura ye thi ke aik shakhs apni milkiyat ka kapda doosrey ki taraf phainktaa aur doosra apna kapda phainktaa aur baghair dekhey aur baghair aapsi raza mandi ke sirf usi se Sauda taey ho jata aur do kapdey (jin se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana farmaya unhein mein se aik ( ishtimaale-Sammaa hai (chaadar ko is tarah lapetna ki jism ka ek taraf ka hissa khula rahe). صماء (Sammaa) ki sura ye thi ke apna kapda (eik chadar ( apne aik shaaney par is tarah daala jata ke aik kinara se (sharmgaah) khul jati aur koi doosra kapda wahan nahi hota tha. doosrey pahnaawey ka tariqa ye tha ke baith kar apne aik kapdey se kamar aur pindlii baandh letey they aur sharmgah par koi kapda nahi hota tha."
"5821","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne do tarah ke pahnaawey se mana farmaya ye ke koi shakhs aik hi kapdey se apni kamar aur pindlii ko mila kar baandh ley aur sharmgah par koi doosra kapda na ho aur ye ke koi shakhs aik kapdey ko is tarah jism par lapetey ke aik taraf kapdey ka koi hissey na ho aur aap ne mulaamisa aur munaabiza se mana farmaayaa."
"5822","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ishtimaale-Sammaa se mana farmaya aur us se bhi ke koi shakhs aik kapdey se pindlii aur kamar ko mila ley aur sharmgah par koi doosra kapda na ho."
"5823","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein kuchh kapdey laey gaey jis mein aik chhoti kali kamlii bhi thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tumhara kya khayal hai ye chadar kisey di jaaey? sahaba kiram (Raziallahu anhu) khamosh rahe phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Umme- Khalid ko mere paas bula laao. unhein god mein utha kar laya gaya (kyonke bachchii thiin) aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wo chadar apne hath mein li aur unhein pahnaayaa aur dua di ke jeetii raho. is chadar mein harey aur zard naqsh w nigaar they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Umme- Khalid ! ye naqsh w nigaar ''sanaah'' hain. ''sanaah'' habshi zaban mein khub achchhey ke mana mein aata hai."
"5824","jab Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan bachcha paida hua to unhon-ne mujh se kaha ke Anas is bachchey ko dekhtey raho koi cheez iske pet mein na jaey aur ja kar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko apne sath lao taake Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apna joothaa iske munh mein daalein . chunanche main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt aik baagh mein they aur aap ke jism par qabila bani hurraiyas ki bani hui chaadar  (khameesa حريثية) thi aur aap us sawari par nishan laga rahe they jis par aap fateh Makka ke mauqe par Sawar they."
"5825","unhon-ne apni biwi ko talaaq de di thi. phir unse Abdur-Rehman bin Zuber Qarzi (Raziallahu anhu) ne nikah kar liya tha. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke wo khatun sabz odhnii odhey huey thin, unhon-ne Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se (apne shauhar ki) shikayat ki aur apne jism par sabz nishanat (chot ke) dikhaaey phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey to (jaisaa ke aadat hai) Ikrima ne bayan kya ke auratein aapas mein aik doosrey ki madad karti hain. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se) kaha ke kisi eman wali aurat ka maine us se zyada bura haal nahi dekha unka jism unke kapdey se bhi zyada bura ho gaya hai. bayan kya ke unke shauhar ne bhi sun liya tha ke (unkii) biwi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas gaee hai chunanche wo bhi aagey aur unke sath unke do bachchey unse pehlii biwi ke they. unki biwi ne kaha : Allah ki qism ! mujhey unse koi aur shikayat nahi albatta unke sath us se zyada aur kuchh nahi jis se mera kuchh nahi hota. unhon-ne apne kapdey ka pallu pakad kar ishara kya (yani unke shauhar kamzor hain) is par unke shauhar ne kaha : ya Rasulullah ! Allah ki qism ye jhoot boltii hai main to usko (hambistarii ke waqt) chamdey ki tarah udhairh (ادھیڑ) kar rakh deta hun magar ye shareer hai, ye mujhey pasand nahi karti aur Rifaa ke yahan dobara jana chahti hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke agar ye baat hai to tumharey liye wo (rifa'a) us waqt tak halal nahi hoga jab tak ye (Abdur-Rehmaan doosrey shauhar) tumhara mazaa na chakh lein. bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abdur-Rehman ke sath do bachchey bhi dekhey to malum farmaya kya ye tumharey bachchey hain? unhon-ne arz kya ji haan. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : achchha , is wjah se tum ye baatein sochtii ho. Allah ki qism ye bachchey unse itney hi mushabeh (similar) hain jitna ke kowa koey se mushabeh (similar) hota hai."
"5826","jange-Uhud ke mauqe par maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke daain baain do aadmiyon ko (jo Farishtey they) dekha wo safaid kapdey pahney huey they maine unhein na us se pahley dekha aur na iske baad kabhi dekha."
"5827","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua to aap ke jism par safaid kapda tha aur aap so rahe they phir dobara hazir hua to aap bedaar ho chukey they phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jis bande ne bhi kalima ( لا إله إلا الله ( ''Allah ke siwa koi maabood nahin'' ko maan liya aur phir usi par wo maraa to jannat mein jaeyga maine arz kya chahey usne zina kya ho, chahey us ne chori ki ho, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke chahey us ne zina kya ho, chahey usne chori ki ho, maine phir arz kya chahey usne zina kya ho, chahey usne chori ki ho. farmaya chahey usne zina kya ho, chahey usne chori ki ho. maine (hairat ki wjah se phir) arz kya chahey usne zina kya ho ya usne chori ki ho. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya chahey usne zina kya ho chahey usne chori ki ho. Abu-Zar ki naak khaak aalud ho. Abu-Zar (Raziallahu anhu) baad mein jab bhi ye hadis bayan kartey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke alfaz Abu-Zar ke (على رغم) (وإن رغم أنف أبي ذر) zaroor bayan kartey. abu-Adbullah imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha ye sura ke (sirf kalima se jannat mein dakhil hoga) ye us waqt hogi jab maut ke waqt ya us se pahley (gunaahon se) tauba ki aur kaha ke) لا إله إلا الله ( uski maghfirat ho jaeygi."
"5828","hamarey paas umr (Raziallahu anhu) ka maktoob (khat) aaya ham us waqt Utba-bin- Farqad (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath aazar baaijaan mein they (is mein likha tha) ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne resham ke istemal se (mardon ko) mana kya hai siwa itney ke aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne angoothey ke qareeb ki apni donon ungliyon ke ishaarey se uski miqdar batai . abu-Usman nehdi ne bayan kya ke hamari samajh main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki murad us se ( kapdey wghaira resham ke) phool botey banaaney se thi."
"5829","hamein umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne likha us waqt ham aazar baaijaan mein they ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne resham pahnney se mana farmaya tha siwa itney ke aur uski wazaahat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne do ungliyon ke ishaarey se ki thi. Zuhair (raawii hadis) ne beech ki aur shahadat ki ungliyan utha kar bataya ."
"5830","ham Utba (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath they. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein likha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaayaa  ''duniyaa mein resham jo shakhs bhi pahney ga usey aakhirat mein nahi pahnaayaa jaaeyga.''"
"5831","Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) madaain mein they. unhon-ne pani maanga . aik dehati chandi ke bartan mein pani laya. unhon-ne usey phenk diya aur kaha ke maine sirf usey isliye phainkaa hai ke main us shakhs ko mana kar chuka hun (ke chandi ke bartan mein mujhey khana aur pani na diya karo) lekin wo nahi maanaa . Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya hai ke sonaa, chaandii, resham aur deebaa un (kuffaar) ke liye duniya mein hai aur tumharey (musalmaanon) ke liye aakhirat mein."
"5832","is par maine puchha kya ye riwayat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se hai? Abdul-Azeez ne bayan kya ke hargiz Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwaayat hui hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo mard reshamii libaas duniya mein pahney ga wo aakhirat mein usey hargiz nahi pahan sakega."
"5833","Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya hai ke jis mard ne duniya mein resham pehna wo aakhirat mein usey nahi pahan sakega."
"5834","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jis mard ne duniya mein resham pehna wo usey aakhirat mein nahi pahan sakega aur ham se abu-Ma'mar ne bayan kya, unse Abdul-Waris ne bayan kya, unse Yazeed ne ke Muaz ne bayan kya ke mujhey Umme- Amr binte- Abdullah ne khabar di, unhon-ne Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne umr (Raziallahu anhu) se suna aur unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna."
"5835","maine Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se resham ke mutaalliq puchha to unhon-ne batlaya ke Abdullah-bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas jao aur unse poochho . bayan ki ke maine Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha to unhon-ne bayan kya ke mujhey abu-Hafs yani umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke duniya mein resham to wahi mard pahney ga jiska aakhirat mein koi hissey na ho. maine is par kaha ke sach kaha aur abu-Hafs Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf koi jhooti baat nisbat nahi kar saktey aur Abdullah-bin -Rijaa ne bayan kya ke ham se Jarir ne bayan kya, unse Yahya ne aur unse Imran ne aur poori hadis bayan ki."
"5836","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko resham ka aik kapda hadiya mein pesh hua to ham usey chhooney lagey aur uski (narmii w mulaaimiyat par) hairat zada ho gaey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya tumhen is par hairat hai. ham ne arz kya ji haan farmaya, jannat mein Sad-bin-Muaz ke roomaal us se bhi achchhey hain."
"5837","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein soney aur chandi ke bartan mein peeney aur khaney se mana farmaya tha aur resham aur deebaaj pahnney aur is par baithney se mana farmaya tha."
"5838","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein surkh ( maisra (aur (qissii) ke pahnney se mana farmaya hai."
"5839","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Zuber aur Abdur-Rehman (Raziallahu anhu) ko kyonke unhein khaarish ho gaee thi, resham pahnney ki ijazat di thi."
"5840","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey reshamii dhaariyon wala aik jodaa, hulla inayat farmaya, main usey pahan kar nikla to maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke chehre par ghusse ke aasaar dekhey. chunanche maine iske tukdey karke apni azeez aurton mein baant diye."
"5841","umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne reshamii dhaariyon wala aik joda farokht hotey dekha to arz kya ke ya Rasulullah! behtar hai ke aap usey khareed lein aur wufood se mulaqat ke waqt aur Juma ke din usey pahan liya karein. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey wo pehnta hai jiska (aakhirat mein) koi hissey nahi hota. iske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khud umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas resham ki dhaariyon wala aik joda hulla bhejaa, hadiye ke taur par. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya aap ne mujhey ye joda hulla inayat farmaya hai halanke main khud aap se iske barey mein wo baat sun chuka hun jo aap ne farmai thi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke maine tumhen ye kapda isliye diya hai ke usey bech do ya (aurton wghaira mein se) kisi ko pehna do."
"5842","unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sahibzadi Umme-Kulsum (Raziallahu anhu) ko zard dhaarii daar reshamii joda pahney dekha."
"5843","main umr (Raziallahu anhu) se un aurton ke barey mein jinhoney Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke maamle mein ittifaq kar liya tha, poochhney ka irada karta raha lekin unka raub samney aa jata tha. aik din (Makka ke raaste mein) aik manzil par qiyam kya aur peelu ke darakhton main (wo qazaey-hajat (zaroorat se farigh honey) ke liye) tashrif ley gaey. jab qazaey-hajat (zaroorat se farigh honey) se farigh ho kar wapas tashrif laey to maine puchha unhon-ne batlaya ke Aaisha aur Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) hain phir kaha ke jahiliyat mein ham aurton ko koi haisiyat nahi detey they. jab Islam aaya aur Allah Taala ne unka zikr kya (aur unke huqooq) mardon par bataaey tab ham ne jana ke unke bhi ham par kuchh huquq hain lekin ab bhi ham apne maamlaat mein unka dakheel bannaa pasand nahi kartey they. mere aur meri biwi mein kuchh guftgu ho gaee aur us ne tez w tund jawab mujhey diya to maine us se kaha achchha ab naubat yahan tak pahunch gaee. usne kaha tum mujhey ye kehtey ho aur tumhari beti Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bhi takleef pahunchaatii hai. main (apni beti ummul-momeneen) Hafsa ke paas aaya aur us se kaha, main tujhey tanbeeh karta hun ke Allah aur uske rasool ki nafarmani kare. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko takleef pahunchaney ke maamle mein sabse pahley mein hi Hafsa ke yahan gaya phir main Umme-Salma ke paas aaya aur unse bhi yahi baat kahi lekin unhon-ne kaha ke hairat hai tum par Umar! tum hamarey maamlaat mein dakheel ho gaey ho. sirf Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur aap ki beeviyon ke maamlaat mein dakhal dena baqi tha. (so ab wo bhi shuru kar diyaa) unhon-ne meri baat radd kar di. qabila Ansar ke aik sahabi they jab wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sohbat mein maujood na hotey aur main hazir hota to tamam khabrein unse aa kar bayan karta tha aur jab main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sohbat se ghair hazir hota aur wo maujood hotey to wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke mutaalliq tamam khabrein mujhey aa kar sunatey they. aap ke charon taraf jitney ( badshah wghaira) they un sabse aap ke ta'lluqaat theek they. sirf Sham (Syria) ke mulk ghassaan ka hamein khof rehta tha ke wo kahin ham par hamla na kar de. maine jo hosh w hawaas durust kiye to wahi Ansari sahabi they aur keh rahe they ke aik haadisa ho gaya. maine kaha kya baat hui. kya ghassaan chadh aaya hai. unhon-ne kaha ke us se bhi bada haadisa ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni beeviyon ko talaaq de di. mein jab (Madeena) hazir hua to tamam beeviyon ke hujron se roney ki awaz aa rahi thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne bula khaana par chaley gaey they aur bula khaane ke darwaze par aik naujawaan pahrey daar maujood tha maine uske paas pahunch kar us se kaha ke mere liye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se andar hazir honey ki ijazat maang lo phir main andar gaya to aap aik chatai par tashrif rakhtey they jiske nishanat aap ke pahlu par padey huey they aur aap ke sar ke nichey aik chhota sa chamdey ka takiya tha. jis mein khajoor ki chhaal bhari hui thi. chand kachchi khaalein latak rahi thin aur babool ke patey they. maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se apni un baton ka zikr kya jo maine Hafsa aur Umme-Salma se kahi thin aur wo bhi jo Umme-Salma ne meri baat radd kartey huey kaha tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) is par muskuraa diye. aap ne us bula khaana mein untees din tak qiyam kya phir aap wahan se nichey utar aaey."
"5844","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat ke waqt bedaar huey aur kaha Allah ke siwa koi maabood nahi, kaisii-kaisii balaaein us raat mein nazil ho rahi hain aur kya-kyaa rahmatein uske khazaanon se utar rahi hain. koi hai jo un hujre waaliyon ko bedaar kar de. dekho bahut si duniya mein pahnney odhney waaliyaan aakhirat mein nangii hongii. Zohri ne bayan kya ke hinda apni aastinon mein ungliyon ke darmyan ghundiyaan lagaatii thin, taake sirf ungliyan khulein us se aagey na khuley."
"5845","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas kuchh kapdey aaey jin mein aik kali chadar bhi thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tumhara kya khayal hai, kisey ye chadar di jaaey? sahaba kiram (Raziallahu anhu) khamosh rahe phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Umme- Khalid ko bula laao. chunanche mujhey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein laya gaya aur mujhey wo chadar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne hath se inayat farmai aur farmaya der tak jeetii raho, 2 martaba Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, phir aap us chadar ke naqsh-w-nigaar ko dekhney lagey aur apne hath se meri taraf ishara karke farmaya umme-Khalid! (سنا ‏,والسنا) ye habshi zaban ka lafz hai yani waah kya zeb deti hai. Is'haaq-bin-Saeed ne bayan kya ke mujh se mere ghar ki aik aurat ne bayan kya kaha ke unhon-ne wo chadar Umme- Khalid (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas dekhi thi."
"5846","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se mana farmaya ke koi mard zafran ke rang ka istemal kare."
"5847","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana kya tha ke koi mohrim (ehraam walaa shakhs) waras ya zafran se ranga hua kapda pahney."
"5848","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) miyaanaa qad they aur maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko surkh jodey mein dekha aap se zyada khoobsurat koi cheez maine nahi dekhi."
"5849","hamein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne saat (7) chizon ka hukm diya tha. bimar ki iyaadat ka, janaaze ke peechhey chalney ka, chheenkney waley ka jawab (yarhamakallaah se) dene ka aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein resham, deebaa, qissii, istibraq aur surkh zeen poshon ke istemal se bhi mana farmaya tha."
"5850","kya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jootey pahney huey Namaz padhtey they? to unhon-ne kaha ke haan."
"5851","main aapko char aisi cheezein kartey dekhta hun jo maine aap ke kisi sathi ko kartey nahi dekha. ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : ibne-Juraij! wo kya cheezein hain? unhon-ne kaha ke maine aapko dekha hai ke aap (khaana Kaba ke) kisi koney ko tawaaf mein hath nahi lagaatey sirf 2 arkaan Yamani (yani sirf rukn Yamani aur hajre-Aswad) ko chhotey hain aur maine aapko dekha hai ke aap saaf zeen ke chamdey ka jootaa pahntey hain aur maine aapko dekha ke aap apna kapda zard rang se rangtey hain ya zard khizaab lagaatey hain aur maine aapko dekha ke jab Makka mein hotey hain to sab log to Zil-Hijja ka chaand dekh kar ehram baandh letey hain lekin aap ehram nahi baandhtey balke tarwiya ke din (8 Zil-Hijja ko) ko ehram baandhtey hain. unse Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke khaana Kaba ke arkaan ke mutaalliq jo tum ne kaha to maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko hamesha sirf hajre-Aswad aur rukne-Yamaanii ko chhootey dekha. saaf tarii ke chamdey ke jooton ke mutaalliq jo tum ne puchha to maine dekha hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usi chamdey ka jootaa pahntey they jis mein baal nahi hotey they aur aap usko pahney huey wuzu kartey they isliye main bhi pasand karta hun ke aisa hi jootaa istemal karun. zard rang ke mutaalliq tum ne jo kaha hai to maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko us se khizaab kartey ya kapdey rangtey dekha hai is liye main bhi us zard rang ko pasand karta hun aur raha ehram baandhney ka masla to maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha ke aap usi waqt ehram baandhtey jab oont par Sawar ho kar janey lagtey."
"5852","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mohrim (ehraam walaa shakhs) ko zafran ya waras se ranga hua kapda pahnney se mana farmaya tha aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jisey jootey na milein wo mozey hi pahan lein lekin unko takhney ke nichey tak kaat dein."
"5853","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jiske paas ehram baandhney ke liye tehband na ho wo paa-jaama pahan ley (iska kaatna zaroori nahi hai) aur jiske paas jootey na hon wo mozey hi pahan ley lekin takhnon ke nichey tak unko kaat daley (jaisaa ke pichhli hadis mein hai)."
"5854","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tahaarat mein kangha karne main aur jootaa pahnney mein dahini taraf se shuru karne ko pasand farmatey they."
"5855","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab tum mein se koi shakhs jootaa pahney to daain taraf se shuru karey aur jab utaarey to baain taraf se utaarey taake dahini taraf pahnney mein awwal ho aur utaarney mein aakhir ho."
"5856","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum mein koi shakhs sirf aik paon mein jootaa pahan kar na chaley ya donon paon nangaa rakhey ya donon mein jootaa pahney."
"5857","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke chappal mein 2 tasmey they."
"5858","Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) 2 jootey lekar hamarey paas bahar aaey jis mein 2 tasmey lagey huey they. Sabit Bunani ne kaha ke ye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke jootey hain."
"5859","mein (hijjatul-wadaa ke mauqe par) khidmate-nabawii mein hazir hua to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chamdey ke aik surkh kheme mein tashrif rakhey huey they aur maine Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ko dekha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke wuzu ka pani liye huey hain aur sahaba kiram (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke wuzu ke pani ko ley leney mein aik doosrey ke aagey badhney ki koshish kar rahe hain. agar kisi ko kuchh pani mil jata hai to wo usey apne badan par laga leta hai aur jisey kuchh nahi milta wo apne sathi ke hath ki tarii hi ko lagaaney ki koshish karta hai."
"5860","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ansar ko bulwaya aur unhein laal chamdey ke aik kheme mein jama kya."
"5861","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat mein chatai ka gheraa bana letey they aur us gherey mein Namaz padhtey they aur usi chatai ko din mein bichhaatey they aur is par baithtey they phir log (raat ki Namaz ke waqt) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas jama honey lagey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Namaz ki iqtida (pairvi) karne lagey jab majma' zyada badh gaya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mutwajjeh huey aur farmaya ke logo! amal itney hi kya karo jitni ke tum mein taqat ho kyonke Allah Taala (ajr dene se) nahi thaktaa magar tum (amal se) thak jatey ho aur Allah ki bargah mein sabse zyada pasand wo amal hai jisey pabandi se hamesha kya jaey, chahe wo kam hi ho."
"5862","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas kuchh qubaaein (chaadarein) aai hain aur aap unhein taqseem farma rahe hain. hamein bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas ley chalo. chunanche ham gaey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aap ke ghar hi mein paya. walid ne mujh se kaha betey mera naam lekar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bulaao. maine usey bahut badi tauheen aamez baat samjha (ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko apne walid ke liye bula kar takleef doon) chunanche maine walid sahib se kaha ke main aap ke liye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bulaaun ! unhon-ne kaha ke betey haan. aap koi Jaabir sifat insan nahi hain. chunanche maine bulaya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bahar tashrif ley aaey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke uper deebaa ki aik Quba thi jis mein soney ki ghundiyaan lagi hui thin. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Makhrima usey maine tumharey liye chipa ke rakha hua tha. chunanche Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wo chadar unhein inayat farma di."
"5863","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein saat (7) chizon se rokaa tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein soney ki anguthi se ya rawi ne kaha ke soney ke chhalley se, resham se, istibraq se, deebaa se, surkh maisara se, qissii se aur chandi ke bartan se mana farmaya tha aur hamein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne saat (7) chizon yani bimar ki mizaaj pursi karne , janaaze ke peechhey chalney, chheenkney waley ka jawab dene, salam ke jawab dene, dawat karne waley ki dawat qabool karne, (kisi baat par) qism kha leney waley qism poori karaaney aur mazloom ki madad karne ka hukm farmaya tha."
"5864","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne soney ki anguthi ke pahnney se mardon ko mana farmaya tha aur Amr ne bayan kya, kaha ham ko Shoba ne khabar di, unhein Qatada ne, unhon-ne nazar se suna aur unhon-ne Bashir se suna, aagey isi tarah riwayat bayan ki."
"5865","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne soney ki aik anguthi banwaai aur uska nageena hatheli ki taraf rakha phir kuchh doosrey logon ne bhi isi tarah ki anguthiyan banwaa lein. aakhir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey phenk diya aur chandi ki anguthi banwaa li."
"5866","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne soney ya chandi ki anguthi banwaai aur uska nageena hatheli ki taraf rakha aur is par (Muhammad rasoolullah.) ke alfaz khudwaaey phir doosrey logon ne bhi isi tarah ki anguthiyan banwaa liin. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dekha ke kuchh doosrey logon ne bhi is tarah ki anguthiyan banwaa li to aap ne usey phenk diya aur farmaya ke ab main usey kabhi nahi pahnoonga. phir aap ne chandi ki anguthi banwaai aur doosrey logon ne bhi chandi ki anguthiyan banwaa liin. ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baad us anguthi ko Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne pehna phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) aur phir Usman ne pehna . aakhir Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ke daure-khilaafat mein wo anguthi arees ke kuwein mein gir gaee."
"5867","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (hurmat se pahley) soney ki anguthi pahntey they phir hurmat ka hukm aaney par aap ne usey phenk diya aur farmaya ke main ab se kabhi nahi pahnoonga aur logon ne bhi apni anguthiyan phenk din."
"5868","unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hath mein aik din chandi ki anguthi dekhi phir doosrey logon ne bhi chandi ki anguthiyan banwaanii shuru kar diin aur pahnney lagey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni anguthi phenk di aur doosrey logon ne bhi apni anguthiyan phenk din. is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Ibrahim bin Sad , Ziyad aur Shuaib ne Zohri se ki hai aur ibne- musaafir ne Zohri se bayan kya ke mera khayal hai ke) khaatmaa waraq sey) bayan kya."
"5869","kya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne anguthi banwaai thi? unhon-ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik raat isha ki Namaz aadhi raat mein padhai. phir chehra Mubarak hamari taraf kya, jaisey ab bhi main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki anguthi ki chamak dekh raha hun. farmaya ke bahut se log Namaz padh kar so chukey hongey lekin tum is waqt bhi Namaz mein ho jab tak tum Namaz ka intizar kartey rahe ho."
"5870","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki anguthi chandi ki thi aur iska nageena bhi usi ka tha aur Yahya bin Ayub ne bayan kya ke mujh se humaid ne bayan kya, unhon-ne Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se isi tarah bayan kya."
"5871","aik aurat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huin aur kaha ke main apne aapko hiba karne aai hon, der tak wo aurat khadi rahi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein dekha aur phir sar jhukaa liya jab der tak wo wahin khadi rahen to aik sahib ne uth kar arz kya : agar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko unki zarurat nahi hai to unka nikah mujh se kar dein. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, tumharey paas koi cheez hai jo mehar mein unhein de sako, unhon-ne kaha ke nahi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke dekh lo. wo gaey aur wapas aa kar arz kya ke Allah ki qism ! mujhey kuchh nahi mila. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jao talash karo, lohey ki aik anguthi hi sahii . wo gaey aur wapas aa kar arz kya ke wo mujhey lohey ki aik anguthi bhi nahi milii. wo aik tahmad pahney huey they aur unke jism par (kurtey ki jagah) chadar bhi nahi thi. unhon-ne arz kya ke main unhein apna tahmad mehar mein de doonga. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar tumhara tahmad ye pahan lengii to tumharey liye kuchh baqi nahi rahega aur agar tum usey pahan logey to unke liye kuchh nahi rahega. wo sahib iske baad aik taraf baith gaey phir jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein jatey dekha to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein bulwaya aur farmaya tumhen Quran kitna yad hai? unhon-ne arz kya ke falan-falan soortein. unhon-ne Suraton ko shumaar kya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ja maine us aurat ko tumharey nikah mein us Quran ke iwaz mein de diya jo tumhen yad hai."
"5872","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ajam ke kuchh logon (shaahaane-ajam) ke paas khat likhnaa chaha to aap se kaha gaya ke ajam ke log koi khat us waqt tak nahi qabool kartey jab tak is par mehar lagi hui na ho. chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chandi ki aik anguthi banwai. jis par ye khuda tha (Muhammad rasool Allah). maano us waqt Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ungli ya aap ki hatheli mein uski chamak dekh raha hun."
"5873","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chandi ki aik anguthi banwai. wo anguthi aap ke hath mein, iske baad umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke hath mein, iske baad Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ke hath mein rehti thi lekin unke zamane mein wo arees ke kuwein mein gir gaee iska naqsh (Muhammad rasoolullah) tha."
"5874","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik anguthi banwaai aur farmaya ke ham ne aik anguthi banwaai hai is par lafz (Muhammad rasoolullah) kanda karaya hai isliye anguthi par koi shakhs ye naqsh na khudwaaey. Anas ne bayan kya ke jaisey us anguthi ki chamak Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki chhanguliyaan mein ab bhi mein dekh raha hun."
"5875","jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Rome (mojooda Itly) (ke badshah ko) khat likhaanaa chaha to aap se kaha gaya ke agar aap ke khat par mehar na hui to wo khat nahi padhtey. chunanche Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chandi ki aik anguthi banwaai is par lafz (Muhammad rasool Allah) khudwaayaa. jaisey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hath mein uski safedi ab bhi mein dekh raha hun."
"5876","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne pahley aik soney ki anguthi banwaai aur pahnney mein aap iska rang andar ki taraf rakhtey they. aap ki dekha dekhi logon ne bhi soney ki anguthiyan bana lin to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) member par tashrif laey aur Allah ki hamd w sana ki aur farmaya maine bhi soney ki anguthi banwaai thi. (hurmat nazil honey ke baad) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ab main usey nahi pahnoonga. phir aap ne wo anguthi phenk di aur logon ne bhi apni soney ki angoothiyon ko phenk diya. Juweriya ne bayan kya ke mujhey yahi yad hai ke Naafe ne ''daahiney hath mein'' bayan kya."
"5877","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chandi ki aik anguthi banwaai aur is mein ye naqsh khudwaayaa (Muhammad rasoolullah) aur logon se keh diya ke maine chandi ki aik anguthi banwaa kar is par (Muhammad Rasulullah ( naqsh karwaya hai. isliye ab koi shakhs ye naqsh apni anguthi par na khudwaaey."
"5878","Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) jab khaleefa huey to unhon-ne mujh ko zakat ke masayel likhwaa diye aur anguthi (mohar) ka naqsh teen linon mein tha aik line mein ''Muhammad'' dusri line mein ''rasool'' aur teesri line mein ''Allaah''."
"5879","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki anguthi wafat tak aap ke hath mein rahi. aap ke baad Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke hath main aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke baad umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke hath mein rahi phir jab Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ki khilafat ka zamana aaya to wo arees ke kuwein par aik martaba baithey, bayan kya ke phir anguthi nikaalii aur usey ulatney-palatney lagey ke itney mein wo (kuwein mein) gir gaee. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke phir Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath ham teen din tak usey dhoondtey rahe aur kuwein ka Sara pani bhi kheench daala lekin wo anguthi nahi mili ."
"5880","mein eidul-fitr ki Namaz main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath maujood tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khutbe se pahley Namaz padhai aur ibne-wahab ne Juraij se ye lafz badhaatey ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aurton ke majma' ki taraf gaey (aur sadqe ki targheeb dilaaii) to auratein Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ke kapdey mein chhalley daar anguthiyan dalney lagein."
"5881","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) eidul-fitr ke din (aabaadii se baahar) gaey aur 2 rakaat Namaz padhai aap ne us se pahley aur uske baad koi dusri nafl Namaz nahi padhi phir aap aurton ke majme' ki taraf aaey aur unhein sadqe ka hukm farmaya, chunanche auratein apni baaliyaan aur khushbu aur mushk ke haar sadqe mein dene lagiin."
"5882","Asma (Raziallahu anha) ka haar (jo Ummul-Momenin Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne udhaar liya tha) gum ho gaya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey talash karne ke liye chand sahaba ko bheja usi doran mein Namaz ka waqt ho gaya aur log bila wuzu ( wuzu ke baghair ( they chunkey pani bhi maujood nahi tha, isliye sab ne bila wuzu Namaz padhi phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se iska zikr kya to tayammum ki aayat nazil hui. ibne-Numair ne ye izafa kya, unse Hisham ne, unse unke walid ne aur unse Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne ke wo haar unhon-ne Asma se udhaar liya tha."
"5883","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne eid ke din 2 rakatein padhaaiin na iske pahley koi Namaz padhi aur na iske baad phir aap aurton ki taraf tashrif laaey, aap ke sath Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) they. aap ne aurton ko sadqe ka hukm farmaya to wo apni baaliyaan Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ki jholii mein dalney lagiin."
"5884","main Madina ke bazaron mein se aik bazar main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wapas huey to main phir aap ke sath wapas hua, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya bachcha kahan hai. ye aap ne teen martaba farmaya, Hasan-bin-Ali ko bulaao. Hasan-bin-Ali (Raziallahu anhu) aa rahe they aur unki gardan main ( khushbu daar long wghaira ka ( haar padaa tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna hath is tarah phailaayaa ke (aap Hasan (Raziallahu anhu) ko galley se lagaaney ke liye) aur Hasan (Raziallahu anhu) ne bhi apna hath phailaayaa aur wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se lipat gaey. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, aey Allaah! mein us se mohabbat karta hun to bhi us se mohabbat kar aur unse bhi mohabbat kar jo us se mohabbat rakhein. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke us irshad ke baad koi shakhs bhi Hasan-bin-Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se zyada mujhey pyara nahi tha."
"5885","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un mardon par laanat bheji jo aurton jaisa chaal chalan ikhtiyar karein aur un aurton par laanat bheji jo mardon jaisa chaal chalan ikhtiyar karein. ghandar ke sath is hadis ko Amr bin marzooq ne bhi Shoba se riwayat kya."
"5886","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mukhannas mardon par aur mardon ki chaal-chalan ikhtiyar karne wali aurton par laanat bheji aur farmaya ke un zanaana banney waley mardon ko apne gharon se bahar nikal do. Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne falan heejdey ko nikala tha aur umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne falan heejdey ko nikala tha."
"5887","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unke paas tashrif rakhtey they. ghar mein aik mukhannas bhi tha, us ne Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ke bhai Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha Abdullaah! agar kal tumhen Taaif par fateh hasil ho jaey to main tumhen binte- Ghelaan ( baadiya naam ke) ko dikhlaaoonga wo jab samney aati hai to (iske motaapey ki wjah se) char silwatein dikhai deti hain aur jab peeth pherti hai to aath (8) silwatein dikhai deti hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ab ye shakhs tum logon ke paas na aaya kare. abu-Adbullah (Imam Bukhari (rh)) ne kaha ke samney se char silwaton ka matlab ye hai ke (motey honey ki wjah se) iske pet mein char silwatein padi hui hain aur jab wo samney aati hai to wo dikhai deti hain aur aath (8) silwaton se peechhey phirtii hai ka mafhoom hai) aagey ki) un charon silwaton ke kinarey kyonke ye donon pahluon ko gherey huey hotey hain aur phir wo mil jati hain aur hadis main ( بثمان‏ (ka lafz hai halanke qaayede ke mutabiq nahw ke) بثمانية‏ . Mina ( hona tha kyonke murad aath (8) aas-paas yani kinarey hain aur) لأطراف ( , Mina ( taraf ( ki jama hai aur) taraf (ka lafz muzakkar hai. magar chunkey ( لأطراف (ka lafz mazkoor na tha isliye ( بثمان‏ ( bhi kehna durust hua."
"5888","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' moonchh ke baal katarwaanaa paidaaishii sunnat hai.''"
"5889","panch cheezein (farmaayaa ke) panch cheezein, khatna karaanaa, naaf ke nichey ke baal moondnaa, baghl ke baal nochna, naakhun tarashwaanaa aur moonchh kam karaanaa paidaaishii sunnaton mein se hain."
"5890","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''naaf ke nichey ke baal moondnaa, naakhun tarashwaanaa aur moonchh katrana paidaaishii sunnatein hain.''"
"5891","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''paanch cheezein khatna karaanaa, naaf ke nichey ke baal moondnaa, moonchh katraanaa, naakhun tarashwaanaa aur baghl ke baal nochna paidaaishii sunnatein hain.''"
"5892","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum mushrekeen ke khilaf karo, dadhi chhod do aur munchhein katarwaao. '' Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) jab Haj ya Umra kartey to apni dadhi (haath se) pakad letey aur (muththii) se jo baal zyada hotey unhein katarwaa detey."
"5893","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''moonchhein khub katarwaayaa liya karo aur dadhi ko badhaao.''"
"5894","maine Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha kya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khizaab istemal kya tha? boley ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baal hi bahut kam safaid huey they."
"5895","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke khizaab ke mutaalliq sawal kya gaya to ahwal ne kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khizaab ki naubat hi nahi aai thi agar main aap ki dadhi ke safaid baal ginnaa chahta to gin sakta tha."
"5896","mere ghar walon ne Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ke paas pani ka aik piyala lekar bheja (raawii hadis) Israel rawi ne teen ungliyan band kar lein yani wo itni chhoti piyaalii thi us piyaalii mein baalon ka aik guchchaa tha jis main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baalon mein se kuchh baal they. Usman ne kaha jab kisi shakhs ko nazar lag jati ya aur koi bimari hoti to wo apna pani ka bartan bii-bii Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ke paas bhej detaa. (wo usmein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baal dubo detein) Usman ne kaha ke maine naklkii ko dekha (jis mein muey Mubarak rakhey huey they) to surkh surkh baal dikhai diye."
"5897","mein Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ki khidmat mein hazir hua to unhon-ne hamein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke chand baal nikal kar dikhaaey jin par khizaab laga hua tha."
"5898","Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ne unhein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka baal dikhaya jo surkh tha."
"5899","yahood w nasara khizaab nahi lagaatey tum unke khilaf karo yani khizaab lagaya karo."
"5900","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bahut lambey nahi they aur na aap chhotey qad ke hi they (balke aap ka beech wala qad tha) na aap bilkul safaid bhoorey they aur na gehunwey rang ke hi they, aap ke baal ghunghraaley uljhey huey nahi they aur na bilkul seedhey latkey huey they. Allah Taala ne aapko chalis (40) saal ki umr mein rasool banaya das saal aap ne (nubuwat ke baad) Makka Mukarrama mein qiyam kya aur das saal Madina Munawra main aur taqriban sath saal ki umr mein Allah Taala ne aapko wafat di. wafat ke waqt aap ke sar aur dadhi mein bees baal bhi safaid nahi they."
"5901","maine surkh hulle mein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se zyada kisi ko khoobsurat nahi dekha (Imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha ke) mujh se mere kuchh ashaab ne Imam Malik (Rahmatullahi-alaih) se bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sar ke baal shaane Mubarak ke qareeb tak they. Abu-Ishaq ne bayan kya ke maine Bara (Raziallahu anhu) ko aik martaba se zyada ye hadis bayan kartey suna jab bhi wo ye hadis bayan kartey to muskuraatey. is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Shoba ne ki ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baal aap ke kanon ki lo tak they."
"5902","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya raat Kaba ke paas mujhey dikhaya gaya, maine dekha ke aik sahib hain gehunwey rang, gehunwey rang ke logon mein sabse zyada khoobsoorat, unke shaanon tak lambey lambey baal hain aisey baal waley logon mein sabse zyada khoobsoorat, unhon-ne baalon mein kangha kar rakha hai aur uski wjah se sar se pani tapak raha hai. 2 aadmiyon ka sahara liye huey hain ya 2 aadmiyon ke kandhon ka sahara liye huey hain aur khaana Kaba ka tawaaf kar rahe hain, maine puchha ke ye kon buzurg hain to mujhey bataya gaya ke ye Esa-ibne-Maryam (Alaihissalam) hain phir achcha maine aik uljhey huey ghunghraaley baal waley shakhs ko dekha, daain aankh se kaana tha maano angoor hai jo ubhraa hua hai. maine puchha ye kaana kon hai? mujhey bataya gaya ke ye Masih dajjal hai."
"5903","Nabi Karim ke baal moondhon tak pahunchtey they."
"5904","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke) sar ke) baal moondhon tak pahunchtey they."
"5905","maine Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baalon ke mutaalliq puchha to unhon-ne kaha ke aap ke baal darmyaana they, na bilkul seedhey latkey huey aur na ghunghraaley aur wo kanon aur moondhon ke beech tak they."
"5906","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hath bharey huey they maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baad aap jaisa (khoobsoorat koi aadmii) nahi dekha aap ke sar ke baal miyaanaa they na ghunghraaley aur na bilkul seedhey latkey huey."
"5907","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hath aur paon bharey huey they. chehra Husain w jameel tha, maine aap jaisa khoobsurat koi na pahley dekha aur na baad mein, aap ki hatheliyan kushaada thin."
"5908","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bharey huey qadmon waley they, bahut hi Husain w jameel, aap jaisa khoobsurat maine aap ke baad kisi ko nahi dekha."
"5909","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bharey huey qadmon waley they, bahut hi Husain w jameel, aap jaisa khoobsurat maine aap ke baad kisi ko nahi dekha."
"5910","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke qadam aur hatheliyan bhari hui aur gudaaz thin."
"5911","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki hatheliyan aur qadam bharey huey they, aap jaisa phir maine koi khoobsurat aadmi nahi dekha."
"5912","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki hatheliyan aur qadam bharey huey they, aap jaisa phir maine koi khoobsurat aadmi nahi dekha."
"5913","ham Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas baithey huey they. logon ne dajjal ka zikr kya aur kisi ne kaha ke uski donon aankhon ke darmyan lafz ''kaafir'' likha hoga. is par Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey maine to nahi suna albatta Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye farmaya tha ke agar tumhen Ibrahim ko dekhnaa ho to apne sahib (khud Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam)) ko dekho (ke aap bilkul unke ham shakl hain) aur Musa (Alaihissalam) gehunwey rang ke hain baal ghunghraaley jaisey us waqt bhi main unhein dekh raha hun ke wo us naley waadiie-azraq naam ke main labbaik kehtey huey utar rahe hain unke surkh oont ki nakel ki rassii khajoor ki chhaal ki hai."
"5914","maine umr (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne kaha ke jo shakhs sar ke baalon ko gondh ley (wo Haj ya Umerey se farigh ho kar sar mundaaey) aur jaisey ehram mein baalon ko jama letey hain ghair ehram mein na jamaaw aur ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey they maine to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko baal jamaatey dekha."
"5915","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne baal jama liye they aur ehram ke waqt yun aap labbaik keh rahe they لبيك اللهم لبيك ، Mina لبيك لا شريك لك لبيك ، Mina إن الحمد والنعمة لك والملك لا شريك لك in kalimaat ke uper aur kuchh aap nahi badhaatey they."
"5916","maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah! kya baat hai ke log Umra karke ehram khol chukey hain halanke aap ne ehram nahi kholaa. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kyonke maine apne sar ke baal jama liye hain aur apni qurbani ka janwar (qurbaanii ke jaanwar) ke galey mein haar daal diya hai. isliye jab tak meri qurbani ka nehar na ho ley main ehram nahi khol sakta."
"5917","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko agar kisi mas'ale mein koi hukm malum na hota to aap usmein ahle-kitab ke amal ko apnaatey they. ahle-kitab apne sar ke baal latkaey rakhtey aur mushrekeen maang nikaaltey they. chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi (ahale-kitaab ki muwafiqat mein) pahley sar ke baal peshani ki taraf latkaatey lekin baad mein aap beech mein se maang nikalney lagey."
"5918","jaisey mein ab bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki maang mein ehram ki haalat mein khushbu ki chamak dekh rahi hun. Abdullaah-bin-Rijaa ne (apni riwayat mein) مفرق النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم (waahid ke seegha (singular) ke saath) bayan kya yani maangon ki jagah sirf lafz maang istemal kya."
"5919","maine aik raat apni khala Ummul-Momenin Memuna binte- Haris (Raziallahu anhu) ke ghar guzaarii, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye us raat unhiin ke yahan baari thi. Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat ki Namaz padhney khadey huey to main bhi aap ke baain taraf khada ho gaya. Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne merey sar ke baalon ki aik lat pakdi aur mujhey apni dahini taraf kar diya."
"5920","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai aap ne ( قزع‏ . Mina ( se mana farmaya, Ubaidullah kehtey hain ke maine Naafe se puchha ke) قزع‏ . Mina ( kya hai? phir Ubaidullah ne hamein ishara se bataya ke Naafe ne kaha ke bachche ka sar mundaatey waqt kuchh yahan chhod de aur kuchh baal wahan chhod de. (to usey ( قزع‏ . Mina ( kehtey hain) usey Ubaidullah ne peshani aur sar ke donon kinaron ki taraf ishara karke hamein uski sura bataaii. Ubaidullah ne uski tafseer yun bayan ki, yani peshani par kuchh baal chhod diye jayen aur sar ke donon konon par kuchh baal chhod diye jaaein. phir Ubaidullah se puchha gaya ke usmein ladka aur ladki donon ka aik hi hukm hai? farmaya ke mujhey malum nahi. Naafe ne sirf ladkey ka lafz kaha tha. Ubaidullah ne bayan kya ke maine Amr bin Naafe se dobara uske mutaalliq puchha to unhon-ne kaha ke ladkey ki kanpatii ya gaddii par choti ke baal agar chhod diye jayen to koi harj nahi hai lekin) قزع‏ . Mina ( ye hai ke peshani par baal chhod diye jayen aur baqi sab mundwaaey jayen isi tarah sar ke us taraf main aur is taraf mein."
"5921","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( قزع‏ . Mina ( se mana farmaya tha."
"5922","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aap ke ehram mein rehney ke liye apne hath se khushbu lagai maine isi tarah ( dasween taareekh ko) Mina mein tawaafe-ziyaarat karne se pahley apne hath se aapko khushbu lagaaii."
"5923","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko sabse umda khushbu lagaya karti thi, yahan tak ke khushbu ki chamak mein aap ke sar aur aap ki dadhi mein dekhti thi."
"5924","aik sahib ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke diwar ke aik suraakh se ghar ke andar dekha Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt apna sar kanghey se khujlaa rahe they phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar mujhey malum hota ke tum jhank rahe ho to main tumhari aankh phod deta arey izn (ijaazat) lena to uske liye hai ke aadmi ki nazar (kisi ke) 70 par na padey."
"5925","mein haalat haiz ke bawajud Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sar mein kangha karti thi. ham se Abdullah-bin Yusuf ne bayan kya, kaha ham ko Imam Malik ne khabar di, unhein Hisham ne, unse unke walid ne aur unse Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne isi tarah ye hadis bayan ki."
"5926","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) har kaam mein jahan tak mumkin hota dahini taraf se shuru karne ko pasand farmatey they, kangha karne aur wuzu karne mein bhii."
"5927","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''(ke Allah Taala ne farmaya) ibne-Aadam ka har amal uska hai siwa roze ke ke ye mera hai aur main khud iska badla doonga aur roze-daar ke munh ke khushbu Allah ke nazdeek mushk ki khushbu se bhi badh kar hai.''"
"5928","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aap ke ehram ke waqt umda se umda khushbu jo mil sakti thi, wo lagaatii."
"5929","(jab unko) khushbu (hadiya ki jati to) aap wo wapas nahi kya kartey they aur kehtey ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi khushbu ko wapas nahi farmaya kartey they."
"5930","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Hijjatul-wada ke mauqe par ehram kholney aur ehram baandhney ke waqt apne hath se zareera (eik qism ki murakkab) khushbu lagai thi."
"5931","Allah Taala ne Hasan ke liye godney waaliyon, gudwaaney waaliyon par aur chehrey ke baal ukhaadney waaliyon par aur daanton ke darmyan kushadgi paida karne waaliyon par, jo Allah ki khilqat ko badlein un sab par laanat bheji hai, main bhi kyon na un logon par laanat karun jin par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne laanat ki hai aur uski daleel ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki laanat khud Quran Majeed mein maujood hai. aayat ( وما آتاكم الرسول فخذوه‏ ( hai."
"5932","Muawiya bin abi Sufiyan (Raziallahu anhu) se Haj ke saal mein suna wo Madina Munawra mein member par ye farma rahe they unhon-ne baalon ki aik choti jo unke chaukeedaar ke hath mein thi lekar kaha kahan hain tumharey ulma maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai aap is tarah baal banaaney se mana farma rahe they aur farma rahe they ke Bani-Israeel us waqt tabah ho gaey jab unki aurton ne is tarah apne baal sanwaarney shuru kar diye."
"5933","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' sar ke qudrati baalon mein masnooii baal lagaaney waaliyon par aur lagwaaney waaliyon par aur godney waaliyon par aur gudwaaney waaliyon par Allah ne laanat bheji hai.''"
"5934","Ansar ki aik ladki ne shadi ki. iske baad wo bimar ho gaee aur uske sar ke baal jhad gaey, uske ghar walon ne chaha ke iske baalon mein masnooii baal laga dein. isliye unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se iske mutaalliq poochha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala ne masnooii baal jodney wali aur judwaaney wali donon par laanat bheji hai. Shoba ke sath is hadis ko Muhammad-bin Ishaq ne bhi Aban bin Saleh se, unhon-ne hasan-bin-muslim se, unhon-ne Safiya se, unhon-ne Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat ki hai."
"5935","aik khatun Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huin aur kaha ke maine apni ladki ki shadi ki hai iske baad wo bimar ho gaee aur uske sar ke baal jhad gaey aur iska shauhar mujh par iske maamle mein zor deta hai. kya main iske sar mein masnooii baal laga dun? is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne masnooii baal jodney waaliyon aur judwaaney waaliyon ko bura kaha, un par laanat bheji ."
"5936","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne masnooii baal lagaaney wali aur lagwaaney wali par laanat bheji hai."
"5937","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah ne masnooii baal jodney waaliyon par, judwaaney waaliyon par, godney waaliyon par aur gudwaaney waaliyon par laanat bheji hai.'' Naafe ne kaha ke godna kabhi masoodey par bhi goodaa jata hai."
"5938","Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) aakhiri martaba Madina Munawra tashrif laey aur hamein khutba diya. aap ne baalon ka aik guchchaa nikal ke kaha ke ye yahudiyon ke siwa aur koi nahi karta tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey ( zor . Mina ( yani faraibi farmaya yani jo baalon mein jod lagaey to aisa aadmi mard ho ya aurat wo makkaar hai jo apne makar w faraib par is taur par parda daalta hai."
"5939","Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne khoobsoortii ke liye godney waaliyon, chehrey ke baal ukhaadney waaliyon aur samney ke daanton ke darmyan kushadgi paida karne waaliyon jo Allah ki paidaaish mein tabdili karti hain, un sab par laanat bheji to umme-ya'qoob ne kaha ke ye kya baat hui. Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha aakhir mein kyon na un par laanat bhejoon jin par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne laanat bheji hai aur kitabullah main is par laanat maujood hai. umme-ya'qoob ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam! maine pura Quran Majeed padh daala aur kahin bhi aisi koi aayat mujhey nahi milii. Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Allah ki qasam! agar tum ne padha hota to tumhen zaroor mil jata kya tum ko ye aayat malum nahi ( وما آتاكم الرسول فخذوه وما نهاكم عنه فانتهوا‏ ( yani ''aur jo kuchh rasool tumhen dein usey ley lo aur jis se bhi tumhen mana karein us se ruk jaao.''"
"5940","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne masnooii baal jodney wali aur judwaaney wali , godney wali aur gudwaaney wali par laanat bheji hai."
"5941","aik aurat ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha ke ya Rasulullah! meri ladki ko khasrey ka bukhar ho gaya aur us se iske baal jhad gaey. mein uski shadi bhi kar chuki hon to kya iske masnooii baal laga dun? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ne masnooii baal lagaaney wali aur jiske lagaya jaey, donon par laanat bheji hai."
"5942","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, ya (raawii ne is tarah bayan kya ke) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''godney waali, gudwaaney waali, masnooii baal jodney wali aur judwaaney wali '' yani Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un sab par laanat bheji hai."
"5943","Allah Taala ne godney waaliyon par aur gudwaaney waaliyon par aur chehrey ke baal ukhaadney waaliyon par aur khoobsoortii paida karne ke liye samney ke daanton ke darmyan kushadgi karne waaliyon par jo Allah ki paidaaish mein tabdili karti hain, laanat bheji hai phir main kyon na un par laanat bhejoon jin par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne laanat bheji hai aur wo Allah ki kitab mein maujood hai."
"5944","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''nazar lag jana haq hai'' aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne godney se mana farmaayaa."
"5945","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khoon ki qeemat, kuttey ki qeemat khaney se mana farmaya aur sood leney waley aur dene waale, godney wali aur godaaney wali) par laanat bheji ( ."
"5946","umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aik aurat laai gaee jo godney ka kaam karti thi. umr (Raziallahu anhu) khadey ho gaey (aur us waqt maujood sahaba se) kaha, main tumhen Allah ka waasta deta hun kisi ne kuchh Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se godney ke mutaalliq suna hai. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke maine khadey ho kar arz kya : ameerul-momineen ! maine suna hai. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne puchha kya suna hai? Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai ke godney ka kaam na karo aur na gudwaao."
"5947","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne masnooii baal lagaaney wali aur lagwaaney wali aur godney wali aur gudwaaney wali par laanat bheji hai."
"5948","godney waaliyon par aur gudwaaney waaliyon par, baal ukhaadney waaliyon par aur khoobsoortii ke liye daanton ke darmyan kushadgi karne waaliyon par jo Allah ki paidaaish mein tabdili karti hain, Allah Taala ne laanat bheji hai phir main bhi kyon na un par laanat bhejoon jin par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne laanat bheji hai aur wo kitabullah mein bhi maujood hai."
"5949","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke rehmat ke Farishtey us ghar mein dakhil nahi hotey jis mein kutta ya moortein hon aur Lais-bin-Sad ne bayan kya, unse Yunus bin Yazeed ne, unse ibne-Shahab ne kaha ke mujh ko Ubaidullah-bin-Abdullaah-bin-Utba ne khabar di, unhon-ne Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo kehtey they ke maine abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, phir unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se yahi hadis naql ki hai."
"5950","ham Masruq bin ajda' ke sath Yasar bin Numer ke ghar mein they. Masruq ne unke ghar ke saaybaan mein tasweerein dekhiin to kaha ke maine Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se suna hai, unhon-ne bayan kya ke maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah ke paas qiyamat ke din tasweer banaaney walon ko sakht se sakht tar azab hoga.''"
"5951","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo log ye moortein banatey hain unhein qiyamat ke din azab kya jaeyga aur unse kaha jaeyga ke jisko tum ne banaya hai ab usmein jaan bhi daalo.''"
"5952","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko apne ghar mein jab bhi koi cheez aisi miltii jis par saleeb ki moorat bani ho ( jaisey nasara rakhtey hain) to usko tod daaltey."
"5953","mein Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath Madina Munawra main ( Marwaan-bin-Hakam ke ghar mein) gaya to unhon-ne chhat par aik musawwir ko dekha jo tasweer bana raha tha, unhon-ne kaha ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke) Allah Taala irshad farmata hai) us shakhs se badh kar zaalim kon hoga jo meri makhlooq ki tarah paida karne chala hai agar usey yahi ghamand hai to usey chahiye ke aik daana paida karey, aik chewntii paida kare. phir unhon-ne pani ka aik tasht mangwaya aur apne hath usmein dhoey. jab baghl dhoney lagey to maine arz kya abu-Huraira! kya (baghl tak dhoney ke barey mein) tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kuchh suna hai unhon-ne kaha maine jahan tak zewar pehna ja sakta hai wahan tak dhoya hai."
"5954","maine apne walid (Qaasim-bin-abii-Bakar) se suna, unhon-ne bayan kya ke maine Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) safar (jange-Tabook) se tashrif laey to maine apne ghar ke saaybaan par aik parda latkaa diya tha, is par tasweerein thin jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dekha to usey kheench kar phenk diya aur farmaya ke qiyamat ke din sabse zyada sakht azab mein wo log giraftaar hongey jo Allah ki makhlooq ki tarah khud bhi banatey hain. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke phir maine phaad kar us parde ki aik ya 2 takiye bana liye."
"5955","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) safar se aaey aur maine parda latkaa rakha tha jis mein tasweerein thin, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey iske utaar leney ka hukm diya to maine usey utaar liya."
"5956","aur main aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik hi bartan mein ghusle-janabat kya kartey they."
"5957","unhon-ne aik gaddaa khareedaa jis par tasweerein thin. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (usey dekh kar) darwazey par khadey ho gaey aur andar tashrif nahi laey. maine arz kya ke ya Rasulullah! maine jo ghalati ki hai us se main Allah se maafi maangtii hun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye gaddaa kis liye hai? maine arz kya ke aap ke baithney aur is par tek lagaaney ke liye hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke un moorat ke banaaney walon ko qiyamat ke din azab diya jaeyga aur unse kaha jaeyga ke jo tum ne paida kya hai usey zinda bhi karke dikhao aur Farishtey us ghar mein nahi dakhil hotey jis mein moorat ho."
"5958","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''farishtey us ghar mein nahi dakhil hotey jis mein tasweerein hoon.'' Basar ne bayan kya ke (is hadis ko riwayat karne ke baad) phir Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) bimar padey to ham unki mizaaj pursi ke liye gaey. ham ne dekha ke unke darwaze par aik parda padaa hua hai jis par tasweer hai. maine Ummul-Momenin Memuna (Raziallahu anha) ke rabeeb (zere-parwarish) Ubaidullaah-bin-Aswad se kaha ke Zaid-bin-Khalid (Raziallahu anhu) ne hamein us se pahley aik martaba tasweeron ke mutaalliq hadis sunai thi. Ubaidullah ne kaha ke kya tum ne suna nahi tha, hadis bayan kartey huey unhon-ne ye bhi kaha tha ke jo moorat kapdey mein ho wo jaaiz hai) basharte ke ghair zi Rooh ki ho) aur Abdullah-bin Wahab ne kaha, unhein Amr ne khabar di wo ibne-Haaris hain, unse Bukair ne bayan kya, unse Basar ne bayan kya, unse Zaid ne bayan kya, unse abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bayan farmaya jaisa ke uper mazkoor hua."
"5959","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke paas aik parda tha. usey unhon-ne ghar ke aik kinarey par latkaa diya tha to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye parda nikal daal, uski moorat us Namaz mein mere samney aati hain aur dil uchaat hota hai."
"5960","aik waqt par Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke yahan aaney ka wada kya lekin aaney mein der hui. us waqt par nahi aaey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sakht pareshan huey phir aap bahar nikley to Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) se mulaqat hui. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse shikayat ki to unhon-ne kaha ke ham ( Farishtey ( kisi aisey ghar mein nahi jatey jis mein moorat ya kutta ho."
"5961","unhon-ne aik gaddaa khareedaa jis mein moortein thin. jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey dekha to aap darwazey par khadey ho gaey aur andar nahi aaey. mein aap ke chehrey se narazagi pehchan gaee. maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah! main Allah se iske rasool ke samney tauba karti hon, maine kya ghalati ki hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke gaddaa kaisa hai? maine arz kya ke maine hi usey khareedaa hai taake aap is par baithein aur tek lagaaein. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke un moorton ke banaaney walon ko qiyamat ke din azab diya jaeyga aur unse kaha jaeyga ke jo tum ne paida kya hai ab unmein jaan bhi dalo aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jis ghar mein moorat hoti hai us main (rahmat ke) Farishtey nahi dakhil hotey."
"5962","unhon-ne aik ghulam khareedaa jo pachhna lagata tha phir farmaya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khoon nikalney ki ujrat, kuttey ki qeemat aur randii ki kamaaii khaney se mana farmaya hai aur aap ne sood leney waale, dene waale, godney waali, gudwaaney wali aur moorat banaaney waley par laanat bheji hai."
"5963","mein Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas tha log unse mukhtalif masayel poochh rahe they. jab tak unse khas taur se puchha na jata wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka hawale nahi detey they phir unhon-ne kaha ke maine Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo shakhs duniya mein moorat banaaeyga qiyamat ke din is par zor daala jaeyga ke usey wo zinda bhi karey halanke wo usey zinda nahi kar sakta."
"5964","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik gadhey par Sawar huey jis par fidak ki bani hui kamlii padi hui thi. aap ne Usama (Raziallahu anhu) ko usi par apne peechhey bitha liya."
"5965","jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Makka Mukarrama tashrif laey (fatah ke mauqe par) to abdul-Muttalib ki aulad ne (jo Makka mein thi) aap ka istiqbaal kya. (ye sab bachchey hi they) aap ne az raah mohabbat aik bachchey ko apne samney aur aik ko apne peechhey bitha liya."
"5966","Ikrima ke samney ye zikr aaya ke teen aadmi jo aik janwar par chadhein usmein kon bahut bura hai. unhon-ne bayan kya ke Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (Makka Mukarrama ( tashrif laey to aap qusum bin Abbas ko apni sawari par aagey aur Fazal-bin-Abbaas ko peechhey bithaaey huey they. ya qusum peechhey they aur Fazal aagey they (Raziallahu anhu) ab tum unmein se kisey bura kahogey aur kisey achchha."
"5967","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sawari par aap ke peechhey betha hua tha aur mere aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke darmyan kajaawe ki pichhli lakdi ke siwa aur koi cheez haail nahi thi usi haalat main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : yaa-muaaz! mein bola ya Rasulullah! main hazir hun, aap ki itaat aur farmabardaarii ke liye taiyaar hun. phir aap ne thodi der tak chaltey rahe. iske baad farmaya : ya Muaaz! mein bola, ya Rasulullah! hazir hun aap ki itaat ke liye taiyaar hun. phir aap thodi der chaltey rahe iske baad farmaya : ya Muaz ! maine arz kya hazir hun, ya Rasulullah! aap ki itaat ke liye taiyaar hun. iske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tumhen malum hai Allah ke apne bandon par kya haq hain? maine arz kya Allah aur uske rasool hi ko zyada ilm hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala ke bandon par haq ye hain ke bandey khas uski ibadat karein aur uske sath kisi ko Sharik na banaaein phir aap thodi der chaltey rahe. iske baad farmaya : Muaaz! maine arz kya, hazir hun ya Rasulullah! aap ki itaat ke liye taiyaar hun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tumhen malum hai bandon ka Allah par kya haq hai. jabke wo ye kaam kar lein. maine arz kya Allah aur uske rasool ko zyada ilm hai. farmaya ke phir bandon ka Allah par haq hai ke wo unhein azab na kare."
"5968","ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath khaibar se wapas aa rahe they aur main abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ki sawari par aap ke peechhey betha hua tha aur chal rahe they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi Safiya (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sawari par aap ke peechhey thin ke achcha ontni ne thokar khaai, maine kaha aurat ki khabar-geeri karo phir main utar padaa. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ye tumhari maan hain phir maine kajaawa mazbut baandha aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Sawar ho gaey phir jab Madina Munawra ke qareeb huey ya (raawii ne bayan kya ke) Madina Munawra dekha to farmaya ''ham wapas hone-waale hain Allah Taala ki taraf rujoo hone-waale hain, usi ko poojney waley hain, apne Malik ki tareef karne waley hain.''"
"5969","unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko masjid main ( chit ( letey huey dekha ke aap aik paon ko doosrey paon par utha kar rakhey huey they."
"5970","hamein us ghar waley ne khabar di aur unhon-ne apne hath se Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ke ghar ki taraf ishara kya, unhon-ne bayan kya ke maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha Allah Taala ke nazdeek kon sa amal sabse zyada pasand hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke waqt par Namaz padhna . puchha ke phir kon sa ? farmaya ke waalidain ke sath achchha sulook karnaa, puchha phir kon sa ? farmaya ke Allah ke rastey mein jihad karna. Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se un kaamon ke mutaalliq bayan kya aur agar main isi tarah sawal karta rehta to aap jawab detey rehtey."
"5971","aik sahabi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur arz kya ke ya Rasulullah! mere achchhey sulook ka sabse zyada haqdaar kon hai? farmaya ke tumhari maan hai. puchha iske baad kon hai? farmaya ke tumhari maan hai. unhon-ne phir puchha iske baad kaun? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tumhari maan hai. unhon-ne puchha iske baad kon hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir tumhara bap hai. ibne- shabarma aur Yahya bin Ayub ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Abu-Zaraa ne usi ke mutabiq bayan kya."
"5972","aik sahabi ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha kya main bhi jihad mein Sharik ho jaaun? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke tumharey maan-baap maujood hain unhon-ne kaha ke ji haan maujood hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir unhiin mein jihad karo."
"5973","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : yaqinan sabse badey gunahon mein se ye hai ke koi shakhs apne waalidain par laanat bhejey. puchha gaya : ya Rasulullah! koi shakhs apne hi waalidain par kaisey laanat bhejega? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wo shakhs doosrey ke bap ko bura-bhala kahega to doosra bhi iske bap ko aur uski maan ko bura-bhala kahega."
"5974","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke teen aadmi chal rahe they ke barish ne unhein aa liya aur unhon-ne mud kar pahaadii ki ghaar mein panah li. iske baad unke ghaar ke munh par pahaad ki aik chattaan giri aur uska munh band ho gaya. ab ek ne doosrey se kaha ke tum ne jo nek kaam kiye hain unmein se aisey kaam ko dhyaan mein lao jo tum ne khalis Allah ke liye kya ho taake Allah se iske zariey dua karo mumkin hai wo ghaar ko khol de. is par unmein se aik ne kaha : aey Allah ! mere waalidain they aur bahut boodhey they aur mere chhotey chhotey bachchey bhi they. main unke liye bakriyan charaataa tha aur wapas aa kar doodh nikaaltaa to sabse pahley apne waalidain ko pilaataa tha apne bachchon se bhi pahley. aik din chaarey ki talash ne mujhey bahut door ley ja daala chunanche main raat gaey wapas aaya. maine dekha ke mere waalidain so chukey hain. maine mamool (routine) ke mutabiq doodh nikala phir main dohaa hua doodh lekar aaya aur unke sarhaaney khada ho gaya mein gawara nahi kar sakta tha ke unhein soney mein jagaaoon aur ye bhi mujh se nahi ho sakta tha ke waalidain se pahley bachchon ko pilaaun. bachchey bhook se mere qadmon par lait rahe they aur usi kash-m-kash mein subah ho gaee. to aey Allah ! agar terey ilm mein bhi ye kaam maine sirf teri raza hasil karne ke liye kya tha to hamarey liye kushadgi paida kar de ke ham aasman dekh sakein. Allah Taala ne (dua'a qabool ki aur) unke liye itni kushadgi paida kar di ke wo aasman dekh saktey they. doosrey shakhs ne kaha : aey Allaah! meri aik chacha zaad behan thi aur main us se mohabbat karta tha, wo intihai mohabbat jo aik mard aik aurat se kar sakta hai. maine us se usey maanga to usne inkar kya aur sirf is shart par razi hui ke main usey so Dinar dun. maine daud-dhoop ki aur so Dinar jama kar laya phir uske paas unhein lekar gaya phir jab main iske donon paon ke darmyan mein baith gaya to usne kaha ke aey Allah ke bandey! Allah se dar aur mehar ko mat tod. main ye sun kar khada ho gaya (aur zina se baaz raha) to agar terey ilm mein bhi maine ye kaam teri raza w khushnoodii hasil karne ke liye kya tha to hamarey liye kuchh aur kushadgi (chattaan ko hata kar) paida kar de. chunanche unke liye thodi si aur kushadgi ho gaii. teesrey shakhs ne kaha : aey Allaah! maine aik mazdoor aik farq chaawal ki mazdoorii par rakha tha us ne apna kaam pura karke kaha ke meri mazdoorii do. maine uski mazdoorii de di lekin wo chhod kar chala gaya aur uske sath be-tawajjohi ki. mein uske us bachey huey dhaan ko botaa raha aur is tarah maine us se aik gaaey aur iska charwaha kar liya (phir jab wo aaya to) maine us se kaha ke ye gaaey aur charwaha ley jao. usne kaha Allah se daro aur mere sath mazaaq na karo. maine kaha ke main tumharey sath mazaaq nahi karta. us gaaey aur charwaahey ko ley jao. chunanche wo unhein lekar chala gaya. to agar terey ilm mein bhi maine ye kaam teri raza w khushnoodii hasil karne ke liye kya tha to (chattaan ki wjah se ghaar se nikalney mein jo rukawat baqi reh gaee hai usey bhi khol de. chunanche Allah Taala ne unke liye poori tarah kushadgi kar di jis se wo bahar aa gaey."
"5975","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ne tum par maa ki nafarmani haram qarar di hai aur) waalidain ke huquq ( na dena aur nahaq unse mataalbaat (maangein) karna bhi haram qarar diya hai, ladkiyon ko zinda dafn karna ( bhi haram qarar diya hai) aur) قيل وقال ( (fuzool baatein) kasarate-sawaal aur maal ki barbadi ko bhi na-pasand kya hai."
"5976","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : kya main tumhen sabse bada gunah na bataaun ? ham ne arz kya zaroor bataiye ya Rasulullah ! Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ke sath shirk karna aur waalidain ki nafarmani karna. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt tek lagaey huey they ab aap seedhey baith gaey aur farmaya aagah ho jao jhooti baat bhi aur jhooti gawahi bhi (sab se badey gunah hain) aagah ho jao jhooti baat bhi aur jhooti gawahi bhii. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usey musalsal dohraatey rahe aur maine sochaa ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khamosh nahi hongey."
"5977","mujh se Ubaidullaah-bin-abii-Bakar ne bayan kya, unhon-ne kaha ke maine Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne badey gunah ka zikr kya ya (unhon-ne kaha ke) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se badey gunahon ke mutaalliq puchha gaya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ke sath shirk karnaa, kisi ki (naahaq) jaan lena , waalidain ki nafarmani karna phir farmaya kya main tumhen sabse bada gunah na bata dun? farmaya ke jhooti baat ya farmaya ke jhooti shahadat (sab se bada gunah hai) Shoba ne bayan kya ke mera ghalib guman ye hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jhooti gawahi farmaya tha."
"5978","meri walida Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein mere paas aaein, wo Islam se munkar thin. maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha kya main iske sath sila rehmii kar sakti hon? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan. iske baad Allah Taala ne ye aayat nazil ki (لا ينهاكم الله an (an) الذين لم يقاتلوكم في الدين) yaanii ''Allah paak tum ko un logon ke sath nek sulook karne se mana nahi karta jo tum se hamarey Deen ke mutaalliq koi ladai jhagdaa nahi kartey.''"
"5979","meri walida mushrika thin wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke Quraish ke sath suleh ke zamane main apne walid ke sath (Madina Munawra ( aaein . maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se unke mutaalliq puchha ke meri walida aai hain aur wo Islam se alag hain (kya mein unke sath sila rehmii kar sakti hon?) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan, apni walida ke sath sila rehmii karo."
"5980","Hiraql ne unhein bula bheja to unhon-ne usey bataya ke wo yani Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamein namaaz, sadqa, paak daamanii aur sila rehmii ka hukm farmatey hain."
"5981","umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne سیراء ka (eik reshamii ( hulla biktey dekha to arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! aap usey khareed lein aur Juma ke din aur jab aap ke paas wufad aaein to usey pehna karein. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey to wahi pahan sakta hai jiska (aakhirat mein) koi hissey na ho. iske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas usi qism ke kai hulley aaey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usmein se aik hulla umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke liye bhejaa. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya ke main usey kaisey pahan sakta hun jabke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) iske mutaalliq pahley manaahii farma chukey hain? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke maine usey tumhen pahnney ke liye nahi diya balke isliye diya hai ke tum usey bech do ya kisi doosrey ko pehna do chunanche umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne wo hulla apne aik bhai ko bhej diya jo Makka Mukarrama mein they aur Islam nahi laey they."
"5982","maine Musa-bin-Talha se suna aur unse Abu-Ayub (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya, kaha gaya ke ya Rasulullah ! koi aisa amal bataein jo mujhey jannat mein ley jaey."
"5983","unhon-ne Musa-bin-Talha se suna aur unhon-ne Abu-Ayub Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) se ke aik sahib ne kaha : ya Rasulullah ! koi aisa amal bataein jo mujhey jannat mein ley jaey. is par logon ne kaha ke usey kya ho gaya hai, usey kya ho gaya hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kyon ho kya gaya hai? ajii usko zarurat hai bechaara isliye poochhta hai. iske baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke Allah ki ibadat kar aur uske sath kisi aur ko Sharik na kar, Namaz qaaim kar, zakat detey raho aur sila rehmii kartey raho. (bas ye aamaal tujh ko jannat mein ley jaaeinge) chal ab nakel chhod de. rawi ne kaha shayad us waqt Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni ontni par Sawar they."
"5984","unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke qata' rehmii karne wala jannat mein nahi jaeyga"
"5985","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jisey pasand hai ke uski rozii mein faraakhii ho aur uski umr-daraaz ki jaey to wo sila rehmii kya kare."
"5986","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo chahta ho ke uske rizq mein faraakhii ho aur uski umr-daraaz ho to wo sila rehmii kya kare."
"5987","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala ne farmaya Allah Taala ne makhlooq paida ki aur jab us se faraghat hui to raham ne arz kya ke ye us shakhs ki jagah hai jo qata' rehmii se teri panah maangey. Allah Taala ne farmaya ke haan, kya tum is par razi nahi ke main us se jodonga jo tum se apne aapko jodey aur us se tod loonga jo tum se apne aapko tod ley? raham ne kaha kyon nahi, aey rab! Allah Taala ne farmaya ke to ye tujh ko diya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne iske baad farmaya ke agar tumhara ji chahey to ye aayat padh lo ( فهل عسيتم إن توليتم أن تفسدوا في الأرض وتقطعوا أرحامكم‏ ) yaanii ''kuchh ajeeb nahi ke agar tum ko hukumat mil jaey to tum mulk mein fasaad barpa karo aur rishtey naatey tod daalo.''"
"5988","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke raham ka talluq Rehman se juda hua hai to jo koi us se apne aapko jodtaa hai Allah paak ne farmaya ke main bhi usko apne se jod leta hun aur jo koi usey todtaa hai main bhi apne aapko us se tod leta hun."
"5989","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke raham (rishte-daarii Rehman se mili hui) shaakh hai jo shakhs us se miley mein us se milta hun aur jo us se qata' talluq karey mein us se qata' talluq karta hun."
"5990","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna ke falan ki aulad (yani Abu-Sufiyan bin-Hakam bin Aas ya abu-Lahab ki aulad ( ye Amr bin Abbas ne kaha ke Muhammad-bin-Jafar ki kitab mein us waham par safaid jagah khali thi (yani tahreer na thi) mere azeez nahi hain (go unse nasbi (rishtey ka ( rishta hai) mera wali to Allah hai aur mere azeez to wali hain jo musalmanon mein nek aur parhezgaar hain (go unse nasbi (rishtey ka ( rishta bhi na ho). anbasaa bin abdul-Wahid ne bayaan-bin-bashar se, unhon-ne Qais se, unhon-ne Amr-bin-al-Aas se itna badhaya hai ke maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap ne farmaya albatta unse mera rishta nataa hai agar wo tar rakhengey to main bhi tar rakhoonga yani wo nataa jodengey to main bhi jodonga."
"5991","Aamash ne ye hadis Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tak marfoo nahi bayan ki lekin Hasan aur fitr ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se marfooan bayan kya, farmaya ke kisi kaam ka badla dena sila rehmii nahi hai balke sila rehmii karne wala wo hai ke jab uske sath sila rehmii ka mamla na kya ja raha ho tab bhi wo sila rehmii kare."
"5992","ya Rasulullah! aap ka un kaamon ke barey mein kya khayal hai jinhein main ibadat samajh kar zamana jahiliyat mein karta tha maslan sila rehmii, ghulam ki aazaadii, sadqa, kya mujhey un par sawab milega? hakeem (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya hai tum un tamam aa'maale-khair ke sath Islam laey ho jo pahley kar chukey ho. aur kuchh ne abul-Yamaan se bajaey ( اتحنث ( ke) اتحت ( riwayat kya hai aur Mamar aur Saleh aur ibne- musaafir ne bhi) اتحت ( riwayat kya hai. ibne- Ishaq ne kaha ( اتحنث ( , Mina ( tehet ( se nikla hai iske mana misl aur ibadat karna. Hisham ne bhi apne walid Urwa se un logon ki mutabiat (pairavi) ki hai."
"5993","main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat main apne walid ke sath hazir hui. mein aik zard qamees pahney huey thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, '' سنہ سنہ '' Abdullah-bin-Mubarak ne kaha ke ye habshi zaban mein '' achchha '' ke mana mein hai. Umme- Khalid ne bayan kya ke phir main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki nabwooat ki mehar se khelney lagi to mere walid ne mujhey daantaa lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey khelney 2 phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum aik zamane tak zinda rahogii Allah Taala tumhari umr khub lambi karey, tumhari zindagi daraaz ho. Abdullah ne bayan kya chunanche unhon-ne bahut hi lambi umr paai aur unki lambi umr ke charchey honey lagey."
"5994","mein ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein maujood tha unse aik shakhs ne (haalate-ehraam mein) machchar ke maarney ke mutaalliq puchha (ke iska kya kaffara hoga) ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne malum farmaya ke tum kahan ke ho? us ne bataya ke Iraq ka, farmaya ke us shakhs ko dekho, (machchar ki jaan leney ke taawaan ka masla poochhta hai) halanke iske mulk walon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke nawaasey ko (be-takalluf qatl kar daalaa) maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farma rahe they ke ye donon (Hasan aur Husain (Raziallahu anhu)) duniya mein mere 2 phool hain."
"5995","mere yahan aik aurat (aur) uske sath 2 bachchiyaan thin, wo maangney aai thi. mere paas se siwa aik khajoor ke usey aur kuchh na mila. maine usey wo khajoor de di aur us ne wo khajoor apni donon ladkiyon ko taqseem kar di. phir uth kar chali gaee iske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey to maine aap se iska zikr kya to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo shakhs bhi is tarah ki ladkiyon ki parwarish karega aur unke sath achchha mamla karega to ye uske liye jahannam se parda bin jaaeingii."
"5996","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bahar tashrif laey aur amaama-binte-abii al-Aas (jo bachchii thiin) wo aap ke shana Mubarak par thin phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Namaz padhi jab aap rukoo kartey to unhein utaar detey aur jab khadey hotey to phir utha letey."
"5997","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hasan-bin-Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ko bosa diya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas Aqra-bin-Habis (Raziallahu anhu) baithey huey they. Aqraa (Raziallahu anhu) ne is par kaha ke mere das ladkey hain aur maine unmein se kisi ko bosa nahi diya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unki taraf dekha aur farmaya ke jo Allah ki makhlooq par raham nahi karta is par bhi raham nahi kya jata."
"5998","aik dehati Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur kaha aap log bachchon ko bosa detey hain, ham to unhein bosa nahi detey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar Allah ne tumharey dil se raham nikal diya hai to main kya kar sakta hun."
"5999","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas kuchh qaidi aaey qaidiyon mein aik aurat thi jiska pistaan doodh se bharaa hua tha aur wo daud rahi thi, itney mein aik bachcha usko qaidiyon mein mila us ne jhat apne pet se laga liya aur usko doodh pilaaney lagi ham se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya tum khayal kar saktey ho ke ye aurat apne bachchey ko aag mein daal sakti hai. ham ne arz kya ke nahi jab tak usko qudrat hogi ye apne bachchey ko aag mein nahi phenk saktii. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke Allah apne bandon par usse bhi zyada raham karne wala hai jitna ye aurat apne bachcha par meharban ho sakti hai."
"6000","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ne rehmat ke so hissey banaey aur apne paas unmein se ninyaanwe hissey rakhey sirf aik hissey zameen par utara aur usi ki wjah se tum dekhtey ho ke makhlooq aik doosrey par raham karti hai, yahan tak ke ghodii bhi apne bachche ko apne sum nahi lagney deti balke sumon ko utha leti hai ke kahin us se iske bachcha ko takleef na pahunchey ."
"6001","maine kaha : ya Rasulullah ! kon sa gunah sabse bada hai. farmaya ye ke tum Allah Taala ka kisi ko Sharik banao halanke usi ne tumhen paida kya hai. unhon-ne kaha phir, iske baad farmaya ye ke tum apne ladkey ko us khof se qatl karo ke agar zinda raha to tumhari rozii mein Sharik hoga. unhon-ne kaha iske ba'd, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ye ke tum apne padosi ki biwi se zina karo. chunanche Allah Taala ne bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke us irshad ki taaiid mein ye aayat والذين لا يدعون مع الله إلها آخر, nazil ki ke ''aur wo log jo Allah ke siwa kisi doosrey maabood ko nahi pukaartey aur na wo nahaq kisi ko qatl kartey hain aur na wo zina kartey hain.''"
"6002","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik bachcha (Abdullaah-bin-Zubair) ko apni god mein bithlaayaa aur khajoor chabaa kar iske munh mein di, usne aap par peshab kar diya aap ne pani mangwa kar is par baha diya."
"6003","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mujhey apni aik raan par bithatey they aur Hasan (Raziallahu anhu) ko dusri raan par bithlaatey they. phir donon ko milaate aur farmaatey, aey Allaah! in donon par raham karke main bhi un par raham karta hun aur Ali-bin-Abdullaah madeenii ne bayan kya ke ham se Yahya ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Sulaiman Taimi ne bayan kya, unse abu-Usman nehdi ne usi hadis ko bayan kya. Sulaiman Taimi ne kaha jab abu tameema ne ye hadis mujh se bayan ki abu-Usman nehdi se to mere dil mein shak paida hua. maine abu-Usman se bahut si hadison suni hain par ye hadis kyon nahi suni phir maine apni hadison ki kitab dekhi to usmein ye hadis abu-Usman nehdi se likhi hui thi."
"6004","mujhey kisi aurat par itna rashk nahi aata tha jitna Khadija (Raziallahu anha) par aata tha halanke wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki mujh se shadi se teen saal pahley wafat pa chuki thin. (rashk ki wjah ye thi) ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko main kasarat se unka zikr kartey suntii thi aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko unke rab ne hukm diya tha ke Khadija ko jannat mein aik khauldaar motiyon ke ghar ki khushkhabri suna dein. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kabhi bakri zabah kartey phir usmein se Khadija (Raziallahu anha) ki saheliyon ko hissey bhejtey they."
"6005","main aur yateem ki parwarish karne wala jannat mein is tarah hongey aur aap ne shahadat aur darmyani ungliyon ke ishara se ( qurb ko) bataya ."
"6006","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke bewaon aur miskinon ke liye koshish karne wala Allah ke raaste mein jihad karne waley ki tarah hai ya us shakhs ki tarah hai jo din mein rozey rakhta hai aur raat ko ibadat karta hai."
"6007","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke bewaon aur miskinon ke liye koshish karne wala Allah ke rastey mein jihad karne waley ki tarah hai. Abdullah Qanabi ko usmein shak hai. Imam Malik ne us hadis mein ye bhi kaha tha us shakhs ke barabar sawab milta hai jo Namaz mein khada rehta hai thaktaa hi nahi aur us shakhs ke barabar jo rozey barabar rakhey chala jata hai iftaar hi nahi karta hai."
"6008","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein Madina hazir huey aur ham sab naujawaan aur ham-Umr they. ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath bees dinon tak rahe. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khayal hua ke hamein apne ghar ke log yad aa rahe hongey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham se unke mutaalliq puchha jinhein ham apne gharon par chhod kar aaey they. ham ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Sara haal suna diya. aap badey hi narm khoo aur badey raham karne waley they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum apne gharon ko wapas jao aur apne mulk walon ko Deen sikhaao aur bataao aur tum is tarah Namaz padho jis tarah tum ne mujhey Namaz padhtey dekha hai aur jab Namaz ka waqt aa jaey to tum mein se aik shakhs tumharey liye azan de phir jo tum mein bada ho wo imamat karaaey."
"6009","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aik shakhs raaste mein chal raha tha ke usey shiddat ki piyaas lagi usey aik kunwaan mila aur usne usmein utar kar pani piyaa. jab bahar nikla to wahan aik kutta dekha jo haanp raha tha aur piyaas ki wjah se tarii ko chaat raha tha. us shakhs ne kaha ke ye kutta bhi itna hi zyada piyaasaa malum ho raha hai jitna mein tha. chunanche wo phir kuwein mein utra aur apne jootey mein pani bharaa aur munh se pakad kar uper laya aur kuttey ko pani pilaya . Allah Taala ne iske us amal ko pasand farmaya aur uski maghfirat kar di. sahaba kiram (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya ke ya Rasulullah! kya hamein janwaron ke sath neki karne mein bhi sawab milta hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tumhen har taaza kalejey waley par neki karne mein sawab milta hai."
"6010","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik Namaz ke liye khadey huey aur ham bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath khadey huey. Namaz padhtey hi aik dehati ne kaha : aey Allaah! mujh par raham kar aur Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par aur hamarey sath kisi aur par raham na kar. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne salam phera to dehati se farmaya ke tum ne aik wasee cheez ko tang kar diya aap ki murad Allah ki rehmat se thi."
"6011","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum mominon ko aapas mein aik doosrey ke sath rehmat w mohabbat ka mamla karne aur aik doosrey ke sath lutf w narm khooi mein aik jism jaisa paogey ke jab iska koi tukda bhi takleef mein hota hai, to Sara jism takleef mein hota hai aisa ke neend ud jati hai aur jism bukhar mein mubtala ho jata hai.''"
"6012","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''agar koi musalman kisi darakht ka paudaa lagata hai aur us darakht se koi insan ya janwar khata hai to lagaaney waley ke liye wo sadqa hota hai.''"
"6013","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo raham nahi karta is par raham nahi kya jata. ''"
"6014","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Jibraaiil (Alaihissalam) mujhey padosi ke barey mein baar-baar is tarah wasiiyat kartey rahe ke mujhey khayal guzra ke shayad padosi ko wiraasat mein Sharik na kar dein.''"
"6015","nabii Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Jibraaiil (Alaihissalam) mujhey padosi ke barey mein baar-baar is tarah wasiiyat kartey rahe ke mujhey khayal guzra ke shayad padosi ko wiraasat mein Sharik na kar dein.''"
"6016","aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bayan kya ''Allah ki qism ! wo eman wala nahi. Allah ki qism ! wo eman wala nahi. Allah ki qism ! wo eman wala nahi. arz kya gaya kon : ya rasoolullaah? farmaya wo jiske shar se iska padosi mehfooz na ho. is hadis ko Shababaa aur Asad bin-Musa ne bhi riwayat kya hai aur Humaid bin Aswad aur Usman bin umr aur Abu-Bakar bin Ayash aur Shuaib bin Ishaq ne us hadis ko ibne-abi-Ze-ib se yun riwayat kya hai, unhon-ne Maqbari se, unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se."
"6017","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmaya kartey they ''aey musalman aurton ! tum mein se koi aurat apni kisi padausan ke liye kisi bhi cheez ko (hadiya mein) dene ke liye haqeer na samjhey chahe bakri ka paaya (پایہ) hi kyon na ho.''"
"6018","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo koi Allah aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhta ho wo apne padosi ko takleef na pahunchaaey aur jo koi Allah aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhta ho wo apne mehman ki izzat karey aur jo koi Allah aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhta ho wo achi baat zaban se nikaley warna khamosh rahe.''"
"6019","mere kanon ne suna aur meri aankhon ne dekha jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) guftgu farma rahe they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo shakhs Allah aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhta ho wo apne padosi ka ikraam karey aur jo shakhs Allah aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhta ho wo apne mehman ki dastoor ke muwafiq har tarah se izzat kare. puchha : ya Rasulullah ! dastoor ke muwafiq Kab tak hai. farmaya aik din aur aik raat aur mezbaanii teen din ki hai aur jo iske baad ho wo uske liye sadqa hai aur jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhta ho wo behtar baat kahey ya khamosh rahe."
"6020","maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! meri padausanein hain (agar hadiya aik ho to) mein unmein se kis ke paas hadiya bhejoon ? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' jiska darwaza tum se ( tumharey darwazey se) zyada qareeb ho.''"
"6021","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''har nek kaam sadqa hai.''"
"6022","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''har musalman par sadqa karna zaroori hai.'' sahaba kiram (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya agar koi cheez kisi ko (sadqe ke liye) jo muyassar na ho. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir apne hath se kaam karey aur us se khud ko bhi fayda pahunchaaey aur sadqa bhi kare. sahaba kiram (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha agar usmein uski taqat na ho ya kaha ke na kar sakey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir kisi haajat mand pareshan haal ki madad kare. sahaba kiram (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya agar wo ye bhi na kar sakey. farmaya ke phir bhalai ki taraf logon ko dilchasbi  dilaaey ya Amr bil-ma'aroof ka karna arz kya (bhalaaii ka hukm de) aur agar ye bhi na kar sakey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir burai se ruka rahe ke ye bhi uske liye sadqa hai."
"6023","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jahannam ka zikr kya aur us se panah mangi aur chehrey se bachney w na-gawari ka izhar kya. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jahannam ka zikr kya aur us se panah mangi aur chehrey se bachney w na-gawari ka izhar kya, Shoba ne bayan kya ke do martaba Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke jahannam se panah maangney ke silsiley mein mujhey koi shak nahi hai. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jahannam se bacho . chahe aadhi khajoor hi (kisi ko) sadqa karke ho sakey aur agar kisi ko ye bhi muyassar na ho to achi baat karke hii."
"6024","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak bevi Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke kuchh Yahudi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey aur kaha (السام عليكم‏) (tumhein maut aaey) Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke main iska mafhoom samajh gaee aur maine unka jawab diya ke (وعليكم السام واللعنة‏) (yani tumhen maut aaey aur laanat ho) bayan kya ke is par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, thehro , aey Aaisha ! Allah Taala tamam maamlaat mein narmii aur mulaaimiyat ko pasand karta hai. maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! kya aap ne suna nahi unhon-ne kya kaha tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke maine iska jawab de diya tha ke (وعليكم) (aur tumhen bhi)."
"6025","aik dehati ne masjid mein peshab kar diya tha. sahaba kiram uski taraf daudey lekin Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke iske peshab ko mat roko . phir aap ne pani ka dol mangwaya aur wo peshab ki jagah par baha diya gaya."
"6027","aur aisa hua ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt baithey huey they ke aik sahib ne aa kar sawal kya ya koi zarurat poori karaanii chaahi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamari taraf mutwajjeh huey aur farmaya ke tum khamosh kyon baithey rahtey ho balke uski sifarish karo taake tumhen bhi ajr miley aur Allah jo chaahega apne Nabi ki zaban par jari karega (tum apna sawab kyon kho'o)."
"6028","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas jab koi maangney wala ya zarurat mand aata to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey ke logo! tum sifarish karo taake tumhen bhi sawab miley aur Allah apne Nabi ki zaban par jo chaahega faisla karaaeyga."
"6029","jab Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath Abdullah-bin-Amr-bin-Aas Kufa tashrif laey to ham unki khidmat mein hazir huey. unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka zikr kya aur batlaya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) badgo nahiin they aur na aap bad-zabaan they aur unhon-ne ye bhi bayan kya ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum mein sabse behtar wo aadmi hai, jiske akhlaq sabse achchhey hon."
"6030","kuchh Yahudi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke yahan aaey aur kaha ( Assamualaikum . Mina ( (tum par maut aaey ( is par Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ( عليكم , Mina ولعنكم الله , Mina وغضب الله عليكم‏ . Mina (ke tum par bhi maut aaey aur Allah ki tum par laanat ho aur iska ghazab tum par nazil ho. lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, ( thehro ( Aaisha ! tumhen narm khooi ikhtiyar karne chahiye sakhti aur bad zabani se bachna chahiye . Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! aap ne unki baat nahi suni , Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum ne unhein mera jawab nahi suna, maine unki baat unhiin par lota di aur unke haq mein meri baddua qabool ho jaeygi. lekin mere haq mein unki baddua qabool hi na hogi."
"6031","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) na gali detey they na buri baat kahnewaaley they na bad-khoo (kisi ka bura chaahney waaley) they aur na laanat malaamat kartey they. agar ham mein se kisi par naraz hotey itna farmatey usey kya ho gaya hai, uski peshani mein khaak lagey."
"6032","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aik shakhs ne andar aaney ki ijazat chahi . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey dekh kar farmaya ke bura hai falan qabeele ka bhaaii. ya (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya (ke bura hai falan qabeele ka betaa. phir jab wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aa betha to aap iske sath bahut achchey akhlaq ke sath pesh aaey. wo shakhs jab chala gaya to Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne aap se arz kya : ya Rasulullah! jab aap ne usey dekha tha to iske mutaalliq ye kalimaat farmaai they, jab aap us se miley to bahut hi khanda peshani se miley. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aey Aaisha ! tum ne mujhey bad-go Kab paya. Allah ke yahan qiyamat ke din wo log badtareen hongey jinke shar ke dar se log us se milnaa chhod dein."
"6033","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sabse zyada khoobsoorat, sabse zyada data aur sabse zyada bahaadur they. aik raat Madina waley (shahar ke bahar shor sun kar) ghabraa gaey. (ke shayad dushman ne hamla kya hai) sab log us shor ki taraf badhey. lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) awaz ki taraf badhney walon mein sabse aagey they aur farmatey jatey they ke koi dar ki baat nahi, koi dar ki baat nahi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt abu-Talha ke) mandoob naamii) ghodey ki nangii peeth par Sawar they, is par koi zeen nahi thi aur galey mein talwaar latak rahi thi. aap ne farmaya ke maine us ghodey ko samandar paya ya farmaya ke ye tez daudney mein samandar ki tarah tha."
"6034","kabhi aisa nahi hua ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kisi ne koi cheez mangi ho aur aap ne iske deney se inkar kya ho."
"6035","ham Abdullah-bin-Amr ke paas baithey huey they, wo ham se baatein kar rahe they usi doran unhon-ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) na bad-go they na bad zabani kartey they (ke munh se gaaliyaan nikaalein) balke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmaya kartey they ke tum mein sabse zyada behtar wo hai jiske akhlaq sabse achchhey hon."
"6036","aik khatun Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein ''burda'' lekar aaein phir Sehal ne maujood logon se kaha tumhen malum hai, ke burda kya cheez hai? logon ne kaha ke burda shamla ko kehtey hain. Sehal (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke haan, lungii jis mein haashiya bana hua hota hai to us khatun ne arz kya ke ya Rasulullah! main ye lungii aap ke pahnney ke liye laai hun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wo lungii unse qabool kar li. us waqt aapko uski zarurat bhi thi phir aap ne pahan liya. sahaba mein se aik sahabi Abdur-Rehman-bin-Auf (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke badan par wo lungii dekhii to arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! ye badi umda lungii hai, aap mujhey usko inayat farma dijiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ley lo, jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wahan se uth kar tashrif le gaey to andar ja kar wo lungii badal kar teh karke Abdur-Rehman ko bhej di to logon ne un sahib ko malaamat se kaha ke tum ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se lungii maang kar achchha nahi kya, tum ne dekh liya tha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey is tarah qabool kya tha maano aapko uski zarurat thi. iske bawajud tum ne lungii nabii Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se maangii, halanke tumhen malum hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se jab bhi koi cheez mangi jati hai to aap inkar nahi kartey. us sahabi ne arz kya ke main to sirf uski barkat ka ummeedwaar hun ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usey pahan chukey they meri gharaz ye thi ke main us lungii mein kafan diya jaaunga."
"6037","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' zamana jaldi jaldii guzrega aur Deen ka ilm duniya mein kam ho jaeyga aur dilon mein kanjoosii samaa jaeygi aur ladai badh jaaeygii.'' sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya ( هرج ( kya hota hai? farmaya qatl khoon-rezii ."
"6038","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki das saal tak khidmat ki lekin aap ne kabhi mujhey uff tak nahi kaha aur na kabhi ye kaha ke falan kaam kyon kya aur falan kaam kyon nahi kya."
"6039","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne ghar mein kya kartey they? farmaya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne ghar ke kaam kaaj kartey aur jab Namaz ka waqt ho jata to Namaz ke liye masjid tashrif ley jatey they."
"6040","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' jab Allah kisi bande se mohabbat karta hai to Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ko awaz deta hai ke Allah falan bandey se mohabbat karta hai tum bhi us se mohabbat karo. Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) bhi us se mohabbat karne lagtey hain, phir wo tamam aasman walon mein awaz detey hain ke Allah falan bandey se mohabbat karta hai. tum bhi us se mohabbat karo. phir tamam aasman waley us se mohabbat karne lagtey hain. iske baad wo zameen mein bhi (Allah ke bandon ka ( maqbool aur mahboob bin jata hai."
"6041","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''koii shakhs eman ki halaawat ( mithas (us waqt tak nahi pa sakta jab tak wo kisi shakhs se mohabbat karey to sirf Allah ke liye karey aur usko aag mein daala jana achchha lagey lekin eman ke baad kufr mein jana usey pasand na ho, aur jab tak Allah aur uske rasool se usey unke siwa dusri tamam chizon ke muqaabley mein zyada mohabbat na ho."
"6042","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kisi ki reeh khaarij honey par hansney se mana farmaya aur aap ne ye bhi farmaya ke tum mein se kis tarah aik shakhs apni biwi ko zor se maarta hai jaisey oont , halanke uski poori ummeed hai ke Sham mein usey wo galey lagaaeyga aur sory, Wuhaib aur abu-Muawia ne Hisham se bayan kya ke) janwar ki tarah) ke bajaey lafz ghulam ki tarah ka istemal kya."
"6043","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (hijjatul-wadaa (ke mauqe par Mina mein farmaya tum jantey ho ye kon sa din hai? sahaba boley Allah aur uske rasool ko zyada ilm hai. farmaya ye hurmat wala din hai) phir farmaya ( tum jantey ho ye kon sa Shahar hai? sahaba boley Allah aur us rasool ko zyada ilm hai, farmaya ye hurmat wala Shahar hai. ( phir farmaya ( tum jantey ho ye kon sa mahina hai? sahaba boley Allah aur uske rasool ko zyada ilm hai, farmaya yahi hurmat wala mahina hai. phir farmaya bila shubah Allah ne tum par tumhara (eik doosrey ka ( khoon, maal aur izzat isi tarah haram kya hai jaisey is din ko us ne tumharey us maheene mein aur tumharey is Shahar mein hurmat wala banaya hai."
"6044","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''muslmaan ko gali dena gunah hai aur usko qatl karna kufr hai.'' ghandar ne Shoba se riwayat karne mein Sulaiman ki mutabiat (pairavi) ki hai."
"6045","unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar koi shakhs kisi shakhs ko kaafir ya fasiq kahey aur wo dar-haqiqat kaafir ya fasiq na ho to khud kehney wala fasiq aur kaafir ho jaeyga"
"6046","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) fahash bhale hi nahi they, na aap laanat malaamat karne waley they aur na gali detey they, aapko bahut ghussa aata to sirf itna keh detey, usey kya ho gaya hai, uski peshani pe khaak lagey."
"6047","Sabit bin Suhak (Raziallahu anhu) Ashaabe-shajar (baite-rizwan karne waalon) mein se they, unhon-ne unse bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo Islam ke siwa kisi aur mazhab par qism khaaey (ke agar maine falan kaam kya to main nasrani hun, Yahudi hun) to wo aisa ho jaeyga jaisey ke usne kaha aur kisi insan par un chizon ki nazar sahi nahi hoti jo iske ikhtiyar mein na hon aur jisne duniya mein kisi cheez se khudkushii kar li usey usi cheez se aakhirat mein azab hoga aur jisne kisi musalman par laanat bheji to ye iske khoon karne ke barabar hai aur jo shakhs kisi musalman ko kaafir kahey to wo aisa hai jaisey uska khoon kya."
"6048","maine Sulaiman bin-Surad se suna wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahabi hain, unhon-ne kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney 2 aadmiyon ne aapas mein gali galoch ki aik sahib ko ghussa aa gaya aur bahut zyada aaya, unka chehra phool gaya aur rang badal diya gaya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us waqt farmaya ke mujhey aik kalima malum hai ke agar (ghussa karne wala shakhs) usey keh ley to uska ghussa door ho jaeyga chunanche aik sahib ne ja kar ghussa hone-waale ko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka irshad sunaya aur kaha shaitan se Allah ki panah maang wo kehney laga kya tum mujh ko bimar samajhtey ho ya deewaanaa ? ja apna rasta ley."
"6049","mujh se Ubada-bin-Samit (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) logon ko lailatul-Qadr ki bashaarat dene ke liye hujrey se bahar tashrif laaey, lekin musalmanon ke 2 aadmi us waqt aapas mein kisi baat par ladney lagey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main tumhen ( lailatul-Qadr ke mutaalliq ( bataaney ke liye nikla tha lekin falan-falan aapas mein ladney lagey aur) mere ilm se) wo utha li gaee. mumkin hai ke yahi tumharey liye achchha ho. ab tum usey 29 Ramazan aur 27 Ramazan aur 25 Ramazan ki raaton mein talash karo."
"6050","maine Abu-Zar (Raziallahu anhu) ke jism par aik chadar dekhi aur unke ghulam ke jism par bhi aik waisii hi chadar thi, maine arz kya : agar apne ghulam ki chadar ley lein aur usey bhi pahan lein to aik rang ka joda ho jaey ghulam ko doosra kapda de dein. Abu-Zar (Raziallahu anhu) ne is par kaha ke mujh main aur aik sahib ( Bilal (Raziallahu anhu)) mein takraar ho gaee thi to unki maan ajamii thin, maine is barey mein unko ta'na de diya unhon-ne ja kar ye baat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se keh di. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se malum farmaya kya tum ne us se jhagdaa kya hai? maine arz kya ji haan. malum kya tum ne usey uski maa ki wjah se ta'na diya hai? maine arz kya ji haan. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tumharey andar abhi jahiliyat ki bo baqi hai. maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah! is budhapey mein bhi? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan, yad rakho ye ( ghulam bhi) tumharey bhai hain, Allah Taala ne unhein tumhari ma-tehti mein diya hai, to Allah Taala jiski ma-tehti mein bhi iske bhai ko rakhey usey chahiye ke jo wo khaaey usey bhi khilaey aur jo wo pahney usey bhi pehnaey aur usey aisa kaam karne ke liye na kahey, jo uske bas mein na ho agar usey koi aisa kaam karne ke liye kehna hi padey to us kaam mein uski madad kare."
"6051","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein Zohar ki Namaz 2 rakaat padhai aur salam pher diya iske baad aap masjid ke aagey ke hisse yani daalaan mein aik lakdi par sahara lekar khadey ho gaey aur is par apna hath rakha , haaziriin mein Abu-Bakar aur umr (Raziallahu anhu) bhi maujood they magar aap ke dabdabey ki wjah se kuchh bol na sakey aur jald baaz log masjid se bahar nikal gaey aapas mein sahaba ne kaha ke shayad Namaz mein rakaat kam ho gain hain isi liye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Zohar ki Namaz char ke bajaey sirf 2 hi rakaat padhaaein hain. haaziriin mein aik sahabi they jinhein aap zul-yadain ( lambey hathon wala ( keh kar mukhaatab farmaya kartey they, unhon-ne arz kya : aey Allah ke Nabi ! Namaz ki rakaat kam ho gain hain ya aap bhool gaey hain? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke na main bhula hun aur na Namaz ki rakaat kam huin hain. sahaba ne arz kya : nahi ya Rasulullah! aap bhool gaey hain, chunanche aap ne yad karke farmaya ke zul-yadain ne sahi kaha hai. phir aap khadey huey aur 2 rakaat aur padhaaein phir salam phera aur takbeer keh kar sajda (sajda sahw) mein gaey, Namaz ke sajde ki tarah balke us se bhi zyada lamba sajda kya phir sar uthaya aur takbeer keh kar phir sajde mein gaey pahley sajde ki tarah ya us se bhi lambaa, phir sar uthaya aur takbeer kahi."
"6052","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) 2 qabron ke paas se guzrey aur farmaya ke un donon mardon ko azab ho raha hai aur ye kisi badey gunah ki wjah se azab mein giraftaar nahi hain balke ye (eik qabr ka murda) apne peshab ki chheenton se nahi bachta tha (ya peshab kartey waqt parda nahi karta tha) aur ye (doosri qabr wala murda) chughal khor tha, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik harii shaakh mangaaii aur usey 2 tukdon mein tod kar donon qabron par gaad diya iske baad farmaya ke jab tak ye shakhein sookh na jayen us waqt tak shayad un donon ka azab halka rahe."
"6053","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''qabeela Ansar mein sabse behtar gharaana banu-Najjaar ka gharaana hai.''"
"6054","aik shakhs ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se andar aaney ki ijazat chahi to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey ijazat de do, falan qabila ka ye bura aadmi hai jab wo shakhs andar aaya to aap ne iske sath badi narmii se guftgu ki. maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! aapko iske mutaalliq jo kuchh kehna tha wo irshad farmaya aur phir iske sath narm guftgu ki. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, Aaisha ! wo badtareen aadmi hai jisey uski bad-kalaamii ke dar se log (usey) chhod dein."
"6055","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina Munawra ke kisi baagh se tashrif laey to aap ne 2 ( murda ( insanon ki awaz suni jinhein unki qabron mein azab diya ja raha tha. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke unhein azab ho raha hai aur kisi badey gunah ki wjah se unhein azab nahi ho raha hai. unmein se aik shakhs peshab ki chheenton se nahi bachta tha aur doosra chughal khor tha. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khajoor ki aik harii shaakh mangwai aur usey 2 hisson mein todaa aur aik tukda aik ki qabr par aur doosra doosrey ki qabr par gaad diya. phir farmaya shayad ke unke azab mein us waqt tak ke liye kami kar di jaey, jab tak ye sookh na jaaein."
"6056","ham Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas maujood they, unse kaha gaya ke aik shakhs aisa hai jo yahan ki baatein Usman se ja lagata hai. is par Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne batlaya ke jannat mein chughal khor nahi jaeyga"
"6057","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo shakhs ( roze ki haalat mein) jhoot baat karna aur faraib karna aur jahaalat ki baton ko na chhodey to Allah ko iski koi zarurat nahi ke wo apna khana peenaa chhodey . Ahmed bin Yunus ne kaha ye hadis maine suni to thi magar main iski sanad bhool gaya tha jo mujh ko aik shakhs ( ibne-abi-Ze-ib ( ne batla di."
"6058","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum qiyamat ke din Allah ke yahan us shakhs ko sabse badtar paogey jo kuchh logon ke samney aik rukh se aata hai aur dusron ke samney doosrey rukh se jata hai."
"6059","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kuchh maal taqseem kya to Ansar mein se aik shakhs ne kaha ke Allah ki qism ! Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko us taqseem se Allah ki raza maqsud na thi. maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar us shakhs ki ye baat aapko sunai to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke chehrey ka rang badal gaya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Musa (Alaihissalam) par raham karey, unhein is se bhi zyada eiizaa di gaee, lekin unhon-ne sabr kya."
"6060","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne suna ke aik shakhs doosrey shakhs ki tareef kar raha hai aur tareef mein bahut mubaalghe se kaam ley raha tha (yaani bahut badha-chadhaakar tareef kar raha tha) to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum ne usey halaak kar diya ya (ye farmaya ke) tum ne us shakhs ki kamar ko tod diya."
"6061","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki majlis mein aik shakhs ka zikr aaya to aik doosrey shakhs ne unki bahut zyada tareef ki to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke afsos tum ne apne sathi ki gardan tod di. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye jumla kai baar farmaya, agar tumharey liye kisi ki tareef karni zaroori ho to ye kehna chahiye ke main iske mutaalliq aisa khayal karta hun, baqi ilm Allah ko hai wo aisa hai. agar usko ye malum ho ke wo aisa hi hai aur yun na kahey ke wo Allah ke nazdeek achchha hi hai. aur Wuhaib ne isi sanad ke sath Khalid se yun riwayat ki arey teri kharabi tu ney uski gardan kaat dali yani lafz ( ويحك (ke bajaey lafz ( ويلك ( bayan kya."
"6062","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko izaar latkaaney ke barey mein jo kuchh farmana tha jab aap ne farmaya to Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya ke ya Rasulullah ! mera tahmad aik taraf se latakney lagta hai, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum un takabbur karne walon mein se nahi ho."
"6063","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) itney itney dinon tak is haal mein rahe ke aapko khayal hota tha ke jaisey aap apni biwi ke paas ja rahe hain halanke aisa nahi tha. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se aik din farmaya, Aaisha! maine Allah Taala se aik maamle mein sawal kya tha aur us ne wo baat mujhey batla di, 2 Farishtey mere paas aaey, aik mere paon ke paas baith gaya aur doosra sar ke paas baith gaya. us ne us se kaha ke jo mere sar ke paas tha un sahib (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam)) ka kya haal hai? doosrey ne jawab diya ke un par jaadoo kar diya gaya hai. poochha, kis ne un par jaadoo kya hai? jawab diya ke Labid bin A'sam ne. poochha, kis cheez mein kya hai. jawab diya ke nar khajoor ke khosha ke ghilaaf mein, iske andar kanghi hai aur kataan ke taar hain. aur ye doran ke kuwein mein aik chattaan ke nichey daba diya hai. iske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif le gaey aur farmaya ke yahi wo kunwaan hai jo mujhey khuwab mein dikhlaaya gaya tha. iske baagh ke darakhton ke pattey saanpon ke phan jaisey daraawney malum hotey hain aur uska pani mahndii ke nichodey huey pani ki tarah surkh tha. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hukm se wo jaadoo nikala gaya. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah! phir kyon nahi, unki murad ye thi ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us waqia ko shohrat kyon na di. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mujhey Allah ne shifa de di hai aur main un logon mein khah-m-khah burai ke phailaaney ko pasand nahi karta. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke Labid bin A'sam yahood ke haleef bani zuraiq se talluq rakhta tha."
"6064","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' bad-gumaanii se bachtey raho kyonke bad-gumaanii ki baatein aksar jhooti hoti hain, logon ke uyoob talash karne ke peechhey na pado, aapas mein hasad na karo, kisi ki peeth peechhey burai na karo, bughz na rakho, balke sab Allah ke bandey aapas mein bhai bhai bin kar raho.''"
"6065","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' aapas mein bughz na rakho, hasad na karo, peeth peechhey kisi ki burai na karo, balke Allah ke bandey aapas mein bhai bhai bin kar raho aur kisi musalman ke liye jaaiz nahi ke aik bhai kisi bhai se teen din se zyada salam kalam chhod kar rahe.''"
"6066","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''bad-gumaanii se bachtey raho, bad-gumaanii aksar tahqeeq ke baad jhooti baat Sabit hoti hai aur kisi ke uyoob dhoondney ke peechhey na pado , kisi ka aib khah-m-khah mat tatolo aur kisi ke bhaaw par bhaaw na badhaao aur hasad na karo, bughz na rakho, kisi ki peeth peechhey burai na karo balke sab Allah ke bandey aapas mein bhai bhai bin kar raho.''"
"6067","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''main guman karta hun ke falan aur falan hamarey Deen ki koi baat nahi jantey hain.'' Lais-bin-Sad ne bayan kya ke ye donon aadmi munafiq they."
"6068","aik din Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere yahan tashrif laey aur farmaya Aaisha mein guman karta hun ke falan-falan log ham jis Deen par hain usko nahi pehchantey ."
"6069","maine Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne bayan kya ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke meri tamam ummat ko maaf kya jaeyga siwa gunahon ko khullam-khullaa karne walon ke aur gunahon ko khullam-khullaa karne mein ye bhi shamil hai ke aik shakhs raat ko koi (gunaah ka ( kaam karey aur iske bawajud ke Allah ne uske gunah ko chipa diya hai magar subah honey par wo kehney lagey ke aey fulaan! maine kal raat falan-falan bura kaam kya tha. raat guzar gaee thi aur uske rab ne uska gunah chhipaaey rakhaa, lekin jab subah hui to wo khud Allah ke pardey ko kholney laga."
"6070","aik shakhs ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha tum ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaanaa-phoosii ke barey mein kya suna hai? (yani sargoshi ke barey mein) unhon-ne kaha Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey they (qiyamat ke din tum muslmaanon) mein se aik shakhs (jo gunahgaar hoga) apne parwardigar se nazdeek ho jaeyga parwardigar apna bazu is par rakh dega aur farmaeyga tu ney (fulaan din duniya mein) ye-ye burey kaam kiye they, wo arz karega. beshak (parwardigaar mujh se khataein hui hain par to ghafoor-raheem hai) gharaz ( sarey gunahon ka (us se (pahley) iqrar kara lega phir farmaeyga dekh maine duniya mein terey gunah chhipaaey rakhey to aaj main un gunahon ko bakhsh deta hun."
"6071","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : kya main tumhen jannat walon ki khabar na dun. har kamzor w tawaazeh karne wala agar wo (Allah ka naam lekar) qism kha ley to Allah uski qism poori kar de. kya main tumhen dozakh walon ki khabar na dun har tund khoo, akad kar chalney wala aur mutakabbir."
"6072","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke akhlaq faazila ka ye haal tha ke aik londi Madina ki laundiyon mein se aap ka hath pakad leti aur apne kisi bhi kaam ke liye jahan chahti aapko ley jati thi."
"6075","wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak bevi Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke maadrii bhatijey they, unhon-ne kaha ke Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne koi cheez bheji ya khairat ki to Abdullah-bin-Zubair jo unke bhaanjey they kehney lagey ke Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ko aisey muaamlon se baaz rehna chahiye nahi to Allah ki qism main unke liye hijr ka hukm jari kar doonga . Ummul-Momenin ne kaha kya usne ye alfaz kahey hain? logon ne bataya ke ji haan. farmaya phir main Allah se nazar karti hun ke ibne-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) se ab kabhi nahi boloongii. iske baad jab unke qata' ta'lluqii par arsa guzar gaya. to Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) ke liye unse sifarish ki gaee (ke unhein maaf farma dein ( Ummul-Momenin ne kaha hargiz nahi, Allah ki qasam! uske barey mein koi sifarish nahi maanoongii aur apni nazar nahi todoongii. jab ye qatae talluq Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) ke liye bahut takleef deh ho gaee to unhon-ne Miswar-bin-Makhrama aur Abdur-Rehmaan-bin-Aswad bin abd Yaghoos (Raziallahu anhu) se is silsiley mein baat ki wo donon bani zohra se talluq rakhtey they. unhon-ne unse kaha ke main tumhen Allah ka waasta deta hun kisi tarah tum log mujhey Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke hujre mein dakhil kara 2 kyonke unke liye ye jaaiz nahi ke mere sath sila rehmii ko todney ki qism khaaein chunanche Miswar aur Abdur-Rehman donon apni chaadaron mein liptey huey Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) ko usmein sath lekar aaey aur Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se andar aaney ki ijazat chahi aur kaha Assalaamu alaikum warahmatullahi wabarkaatuh , kya ham andar aa saktey hain? Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha aa jao . unhon-ne arz kya ham sab ? kaha haan , sab aa jao . Ummul-Momenin ko iska ilm nahi tha ke Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) bhi unke sath hain. jab ye andar gaey to Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) parda hata kar andar chaley gaey aur Ummul-Momenin (Raziallahu anhu) se lipat kar Allah ka waasta dene lagey aur roney lagey (ke maaf kar dein, ye Ummul-Momenin ke bhaanjey they) Miswar aur Abdur-Rehman bhi Ummul-Momenin ko Allah ka waasta dene lagey ke Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) se bolein aur unhein maaf kar dein un hazraat ne ye bhi arz kya ke jaisa ke tum ko malum hai Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne talluq todney se mana kya hai ke kisi musalman ke liye jaaiz nahi ke kisi apne bhai se teen din se zyada wali hadis yad dilaane lagey aur ye ke usmein nuqsan hai to Ummul-Momenin bhi unhein yad dilaane lagiin aur roney lagiin aur farmaney lagiin ke maine to qism kha li hai? aur qism ka mamla sakht hai lekin ye buzurg log barabar koshish kartey rahe, yahan tak ke Ummul-Momenin ne Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) se baat kar li aur apni qism ( todney ( ki wjah se chalis (40) ghulam aazad kiye. iske baad jab bhi aap ye qism yad kartin to roney lagtiin aur aap ka dupatta aansuon se tar ho jaataa."
"6076","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' aapas mein bughz na rakho aur aik doosrey se hasad na karo, peeth peechhey kisi ki burai na karo, balke Allah ke bandey aur aapas mein bhaaii-bhaaii bin kar raho aur kisi musalman ke liye jaaiz nahi ke kisi bhai se teen din se zyada tak baat cheet band kare. ''"
"6077","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''kisi shakhs ke liye jaaiz nahi ke apne kisi bhai se teen din se zyada ke liye mulaqat chhodey, Is tarah ke jab donon ka saamnaa ho jaey to ye bhi munh pher ley aur wo bhi munh pher ley aur un donon mein behtar wo hai jo salam mein pahal kare.''"
"6078","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''main tumhari narazagi aur khushi ko khub pehchanta hun. Ummul-Momenin ne bayan kya ke maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah! aap kis tarah se pehchantey hain? farmaya ke jab tum khush hoti ho kehti ho, haan Muhammad ke rab ki qasam! aur jab naraz hoti ho to kehti ho nahi, Ibrahim ke rab ki qasam! bayan kya ke maine arz kya : ji haan, aap ka farmana bilkul sahi hai main sirf aap ka naam lena chhodtii hun."
"6079","jab maine hosh sanbhaalaa to apne waalidain ko Deen Islam ka pairo paya aur koi din aisa nahi guzarta tha ke jis main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unke paas subah w Sham tashrif na latey hon, aik din Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu)) walid maajid ( ghar mein bhari do-pahar mein baithey huey they ke aik shakhs ne kaha ye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif la rahe hain, ye aisa waqt tha ke us waqt hamarey yahan Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke aaney ka mamool (routine) nahi tha, Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) boley ke Is waqt Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka tashrif lana kisi khas wjah hi se ho sakta hai, phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mujhey Makka chhodney ki ijazat mil gaee hai."
"6080","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) qabila Ansar ke gharaanE mein mulaqat ke liye tashrif le gaey aur unhIin ke yahan khana khaayaa, jab aap wapas tashrif laney lagey to aap ke hukm se aik chatai par pani chhidkaa gaya aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par Namaz padhi aur ghar walon ke liye dua ki."
"6081","mujh se Salim bin-Abdullah ne puchha ke) إستبرق ( kya cheez hai? maine kaha ke deebaa se bana hua mota aur khurdaraa kapdaa, phir unhon-ne bayan kya ke maine Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne bayan kya ke umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne aik shakhs ko istibraq ka joda pahney huey dekha to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein usey lekar hazir huey aur arz kya ke ya Rasulullah! usey aap khareed lein aur wafad jab aap se mulaqat ke liye aaein to unki mulaqat ke waqt usey pahan liya karein. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke resham to wahi pahan sakta hai jiska (aakhirat mein) koi hissey na ho khair is baat par aik muddat guzar gaee phir aisa hua ke aik din Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khud unhein aik joda bheja to wo usey lekar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur arz kya aap ne ye joda mere liye bheja hai, halanke iske barey mein aap us se pahley aisa irshad farma chukey hain? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye maine tumharey paas isliye bheja hai taake tum iske zariey (bech kar) maal hasil karo. chunanche ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) isi hadis ki wjah se kapdey main (resham ke) beil-booton ko bhi makruh jantey they."
"6082","jab Abdur-Rehman-bin-Auf hamarey yahan aaey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unmein aur Sad-bin-Rabee mein bhaaii-chaargii karaai to phir (jab Abdur-Rehman-bin-Auf ne nikah kya to) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ab walima kar chahe aik bakri ka ho."
"6083","ham se Muhammad-bin Sabaah ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Ismail bin Zakariya ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Aasim bin Sulaiman ahwal ne bayan kya, kaha ke maine Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se poochha, kya tum ko ye baat malum hai ke Islaam mein muaahide (half) ki koi asl nahi? Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khud quraish aur Ansar ke darmyan mere ghar mein half karaai thii."
"6084","Rifaa Qarzi ne apni biwi ko talaaq de di aur talaaq rajaii nahi di. iske baad unse Abdur-Rehman bin Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ne nikah kar liya, lekin wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huin aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah! main Rifaa (Raziallahu anhu) ke nikah mein thi lekin unhon-ne mujhey teen talaaqein de dein. phir mujh se Abdur-Rehman bin Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ne nikah kar liya, lekin Allah ki qism unke paas to pallu ki tarah ke siwa aur kuchh nahi. ( murad ye ke wo naa-mard hain) aur unhon-ne apne chadar ka pallu pakad kar bataya ( rawi ne bayan kya ke) Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas baithey huey they aur Saeed-bin-al-Aas ke ladkey Khalid hujre ke darwazey par they aur andar dakhil honey ki ijazat ke intezar mein they. Khalid-bin Saeed is par Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ko awaz de kar kehney lagey ke aap us aurat ko daant'tey nahi ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney kis tarah ki baat kehti hai aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tabassum ke siwa aur kuchh nahi farmaya, phir farmaya, ghaaliban tum Rifaa ke paas dobara jana chahti ho lekin ye us waqt tak mumkin nahi hai jab tak tum unka (Abdur-Rehmaan (Raziallahu anhu) ka ( mazaa na chakh lo aur wo tumhara maza na chakh lein."
"6085","umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir honey ki ijazat chahi . us waqt Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aap ki kai beeviyan jo Quraish se talluq rakhti thin aap se kharch dene ke liye taqaza kar rahi thin aur unchi awaz mein baatein kar rahi thin. jab umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne ijazat chahi to wo jaldi se bhag kar pardey ke peechhey chali gain . phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unko ijazat di aur wo dakhil huey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt hans rahe they, umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : Allah aapko khush rakhey , ya Rasulullah ! mere maan-baap aap par qurbaan hun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke un par mujhey hairat hui, jo abhi mere paas taqaza kar rahi thin, jab unhon-ne tumhari awaz suni to fauran bhag kar pardey ke peechhey chali gain . umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne is par arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! aap iske zyada mustahiq hain ke aap se dara jaey, phir aurton ko mukhaatab karke unhon-ne kaha, apni jaanon ki dushman ! mujh se to tum dartii ho aur Allah ke rasool se nahi darteen . unhon-ne arz kya : aap Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se zyada sakht hain. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : haan aey ibne-khattaab ! us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai, agar shaitan bhi tumhen rastey par aata hua dekhega to tumhara rasta chhod kar doosrey rastey par chala jaeyga"
"6086","jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Taaif mein they (fatah Makka ke baad) to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar Allah ne chaha to ham yahan se kal wapas hongey. aap ke kuchh sahaba ne kaha ke ham us waqt tak nahi jaeinge jab tak usey fateh na kar lein. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar yahi baat hai to kal subah ladai karo. bayan kya ke doosrey din subah ko sahaba ne ghamasaan ki ladai ladii aur kasrat se sahaba zakhmi huey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke inshaAllah ham kal wapas hongey. bayan kya ke ab sab log khamosh rahe. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hans padey. Humaidii ne bayan kya ke ham se Sufiyan ne poori sanad (khabar) ke lafz ke sath bayan ki."
"6087","aik sahib Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur arz kya : main to tabah ho gaya apni biwi ke sath Ramazan mein (roze ki haalat mein) ham-bistarii kar li. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir aik ghulam aazad kar. unhon-ne arz kya : mere paas koi ghulam nahi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir do mahiney ke rozey rakh. unhon-ne arz kya : uski mujh mein taqat nahi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya phir sath (60) miskinon ko khana khilaa . unhon-ne arz kya ke itna bhi mere paas nahi hai. bayan kya ke phir khajoor ka aik tokraa laya gaya. Ibrahim ne bayan kya ke (arq) aik tarah ka (nau (9) kilogram ka ( aik paimaana tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke poochhney wala kahan hai? lo usey sadqa kar dena. unhon-ne arz kya mujh se, jo zyada mohtaaj ho usey dun? Allah ki qism ! Madina ke donon maidaanon ke darmyan koi gharaana bhi ham se zyada mohtaaj nahi hai. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hans diye aur aap ke samney ke dandaaney Mubarak khul gaey. iske baad farmaya ke achchha phir to tum miyan biwi hi usey kha lo."
"6088","main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath chal raha tha. aap ke jism par aik najraanii chadar thi, jiska haashiya mota tha. itney mein aik dehati Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur us ne aap ki chadar badey zor se khinchi . Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke shaaney ko dekha ke zor se kheenchney ki wjah se, is par nishan pad gaey. phir usne kaha : aey Muhammad ! Allah ka jo maal aap ke paas hai is mein se mujhey diye janey ka hukm farmaiye . us waqt maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko mud kar dekha to aap muskuraa diye phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey diye janey ka hukm farmaayaa."
"6090","main ghodey par jam kar nahi baith paata to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna hath mere seeney par maara aur dua ki (اللهم ثبته واجعله هاديا مهديا ( ''aey Allah ! isey mazbooti farma, isey hidayat karne wala aur khud hidayat paya hua banaa.''"
"6091","Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! Allah haq se nahi sharmaataa , kya aurat ko jab ehtilam ho to is par ghusl wajib hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan, jab aurat pani dekhey (to is par ghusl wajib hai) is par Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) hanseiin aur arz kya, kya aurat ko bhi ehtilam hota hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir bachchey ki sura maan se kyon miltii hai?"
"6092","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko is tarah khul kar kabhi hanstey nahi dekha ke aap ke halaq ka kowa nazar aaney lagta ho, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sirf muskuratey they."
"6093","aik sahib Juma ke din Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt Madina mein Juma ka khutba de rahe they. unhon-ne arz kya barish ka qahat (sukhaa) pad gaya hai. aap apne rab se barish ki dua keejiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aasman ki taraf dekha kahin hamein badal nazar nahi aa raha tha. phir aap ne barish ki dua ki. itney mein badal utha aur kuchh tukdey kuchh ki taraf badhey aur barish honey lagi yahan tak ke Madina ke naley bahney lagey. agley Juma tak isi tarah barish hoti rahi silsila tut'taa (ٹوٹتا) hi na tha chunanche wahi sahib ya koi doosrey (agley Juma ko) khadey huey, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khutba de rahe they aur unhon-ne arz kya : ham doob gaey, apne rab se dua karein ke ab barish band kar de. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, aey Allah ! hamarey charon taraf barish ho, ham par na ho. do ya teen martaba Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye farmaya. chunanche Madina Munawra se badal chhatney lagey. baain aur daain , hamarey charon taraf doosrey maqamat par barish honey lagi aur hamarey yahan barish yakdam band ho gaee. ye Allah ne logon ko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka moa'jza aur apne paighambar (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki karaamat aur dua ki qabooliyat batlaaii."
"6094","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''bila shubah sach aadmi ko neki ki taraf bulata hai aur neki jannat ki taraf ley jati hai aur aik shakhs sach boltaa rehta hai yahan tak ke wo siddeeq ka laqab aur martaba hasil kar leta hai aur bila shubah jhoot burai ki taraf ley jata hai aur burai jahannam ki taraf aur aik shakhs jhoot boltaa rehta hai, yahan tak ke wo Allah ke yahan bahut jhoota likh diya jata hai.''"
"6095","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''munaafiq ki teen nishaniyan hain, jab boltaa hai jhoot boltaa hai, jab wada karta hai khilaf karta hai aur jab usey ameen banaya jata hai to khayanat karta hai.''"
"6096","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''mere paas pichhli raat khuwab mein 2 aadmi aaey unhon-ne kaha ke jisey aap ne dekha ke iska jabdaa chira ja raha tha wo bada hi jhoota tha, jo aik baat ko leta aur saari duniya mein phaila deta tha, qiyamat tak usko yahi saza miltii rahegii.''"
"6097","bila shubah sab logon se apni chaal-dhaal aur waza' aur seerat main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se sabse zyada mushabeh (similar) Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) hain. jab wo apne ghar se bahar nikaltey aur uske baad dobara apne ghar wapas aaney tak unka yahi haal rehta hai lekin jab wo akeley ghar mein rahtey to malum nahi kya kartey rahtey hain."
"6098","Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha bila shubah sabse achchha kalam Allah ki kitab hai aur sabse achchha tariqa ( chaal chalan ( Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka tariqa hai."
"6099","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''koii shakhs bhi ya koi cheez bhi takleef bardasht karne waali, jo usey kisi cheez ko sun kar hui ho, Allah se zyada (sabr karne wala) nahi hai. log uske liye aulad thehratey hain aur wo unhein tandurustii deta hai balke unhein rozii bhi deta hai.''"
"6100","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (jange-Hunain) mein kuchh maal taqseem kya jaisa ke aap hamesha taqseem kya kartey they. is par qabila Ansar ke aik shakhs ne kaha ke Allah ki qism ! us taqseem se Allah ki raza mandi hasil karna maqsud nahi tha. maine kaha ke ye baat main zaroor Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kahoonga. chunanche main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne sahaba ke sath tashrif rakhtey they, maine chupkey se ye baat Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kahi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko uski ye baat badi na-gawar guzri aur aap ke chehrey ka rang badal gaya aur aap ghussa ho gaey yahan tak ke mere dil mein ye khahish paida hui ke kash! maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko is baat ki khabar na di hoti phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya Musa (Alaihissalam) ko is se bhi zyada takleef pahunchai gaee thi lekin unhon-ne sabr kya."
"6101","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik kaam kya aur logon ko bhi uski ijazat de di lekin kuchh logon ne iska na karna achchha jaanaa. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko uski itlaa hui to aap ne khutba diya aur Allah ki hamd ke baad farmaya ke un logon ko kya ho gaya hai jo us kaam se parhez kartey hain, jo main karta hun, Allah ki qism mein Allah ko un sabse zyada janta hun aur un sabse zyada Allah se darney wala hun."
"6102","Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kunwari ladkiyon se bhi zyada sharmeeley they, jab aap koi aisi cheez dekhtey jo aapko na-gawar hoti to ham aap ke chehrey Mubarak se samajh jatey they."
"6103","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jab koi shakhs apne kisi bhai ko kehta hai ke aey kaafir! to un donon mein se aik kaafir ho gaya aur Ikrima bin Ammar ne Yahya se bayan kya ke unse Abdullaah-bin-Yazeed ne kaha, unhon-ne abu-Salma se suna aur unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se suna unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se."
"6104","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jis shakhs ne bhi apne kisi bhai ko kaha ke aey kaafir ! to un donon mein se aik kaafir ho gaya. ''"
"6105","jisne Islam ke siwa kisi aur mazhab ki jhoot-moot qism khaaii to wo waisaa hi ho jata hai, jiski us ne qism khaaii hai aur jisne kisi cheez se khudkushii kar li to usey jahannam mein usi se azab diya jaeyga aur momin par laanat bhejna usey qatl karne ke barabar hai aur jisne kisi momin par kufr ki tohmat lagai to ye iske qatl ke barabar hai."
"6106","Muaz-bin-Jabal (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Namaz padhtey, phir apni qaum mein aatey aur unhein Namaz padhatey . unhon-ne (eik martaba ( Namaz mein sura al-Baqara padhi. is par aik sahib jamat se alag ho gaey aur halki Namaz padhi. jab iske mutaalliq Muaz ko malum hua to kaha wo munafiq hai. Muaz ki ye baat jab unko malum hui to wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! ham log mehnat ka kaam kartey hain aur apni oontniyon ko khud pani pilaatey hain Muaz ne kal raat hamein Namaz padhai aur sura al-Baqara padhni shuru kar di. isliye main Namaz tod kar alag ho gaya, is par wo kehtey hain ke main munafiq hun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''aey Muaaz! tum logon ko fitne mein mubtala kartey ho, teen martaba Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye farmaya (jab imam ho to) sura (iqraa) , Mina ( والشمس وضحاها‏ (aur ( سبح اسم ربك الأعلى‏ ( jaisi soortein padha karo."
"6107","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum mein se jisne laat, uzzaa ki (ya doosrey buton ki) qism khaaii to usey ( لا إله إلا الله) padhna chahiye aur jisne apne sathi se kaha ke aao juwa khelein to usey bataur kaffara sadqa dena chaahiye.''"
"6108","wo umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas pahunchey jo chand sawaaron ke sath they, us waqt umr (Raziallahu anhu) apne walid ki qism kha rahe they. is par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein pukar kar kaha, khabardaar! yaqinan Allah paak tumhen mana karta hai ke tum apne bap daadon ki qism khaao, to agar kisi ko qism hi khaani hai to Allah ki qism khaaey, warna chup rahe."
"6109","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) andar tashrif laey aur ghar mein aik parda latkaa hua tha jis par tasweerein thin. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke chehrey ka rang badal gaya. phir aap ne parda pakda aur usey phaad diya. Ummul-Momenin ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''qiyaamat ke din un logon par sabse zyada azab hoga, jo ye sooratein banatey hain.''"
"6110","aik shakhs Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur arz kya main subah ki Namaz jamat se falan imam ki wjah se nahi padhta kyonke wo bahut lambi Namaz padhatey hain. unhon-ne kaha ke us din un imam sahib ko nasihat karne main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko maine jitna ghusse mein dekha aisa maine aapko kabhi nahi dekha tha, phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aey logo ! tum mein se kuchh log (namaz ba-jamaat padhney se) logon ko door karne waley hain, to jo shakhs bhi logon ko Namaz padhaaey mukhtasar padhaaey, kyonke namaziyon mein koi bimar hota hai koi boodha koi kaam kaaj wala."
"6111","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Namaz padh rahe they ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne masjid mein qible ki taraf munh ka thook dekha. phir aap ne usey apne hath se saaf kya aur ghussa huey phir farmaya jab tum mein se koi shakhs Namaz mein hota hai Allah Taala iske samney hota hai. isliye koi shakhs Namaz main apne samney na thookey."
"6112","aik sahib ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se khoi hui cheez (raaste mein giri padi cheez jisey kisi ne utha liya ho) ke mutaalliq puchha to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya saal bhar logon se poochhtey raho phir iska sar bandhan aur zarf (ظرف) pehchan ke rakh aur kharch kar daal . phir agar iske baad iska Malik aa jaey to wo cheez usey wapas kar de. puchha : ya Rasulullah ! bhuli bhatakii bakri ke mutaalliq kya hukm hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey pakad la kyonke wo tumharey bhai ki hai ya phir bhediye ki hogi. puchha : ya Rasulullah ! aur khoya hua oont ? bayan kya ke is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) naraz ho gaey aur aap ke donon rukhsar surkh ho gaey. ya rawi ne yun kaha ke aap ka chehra surkh ho gaya, phir aap ne farmaya ke tumhen us oont se kya gharaz hai uske sath to uske paon hain aur uska pani hai wo kabhi na kabhi apne Malik ko pa lega."
"6113","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khajoor ki shakhon ya boriyen (بوریئے) se aik makan chhotey se hujrey ki tarah bana liya tha. wahan aa kar aap tahajjud ki Namaz padha kartey they, chand log bhi wahan aagey aur unhon-ne aap ki iqtida (pairvi) mein Namaz padhi phir sab log dusri raat bhi aagey aur thahrey rahe lekin aap ghar hi mein rahe aur bahar unke paas tashrif nahi laey. log awaz buland karne lagey aur darwazey par kankariyaan maareiin to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghussey ki haalat mein bahar tashrif laey aur farmaya tum chahtey ho ke hamesha ye Namaz padhtey raho taake tum par farz ho jaey (us waqt mushkil ho) dekho tum nafl namazein apne gharon mein hi padha karo. kyonke farz namazon ke siwa aadmi ki behtreen nafl Namaz wo hai jo ghar mein padhi jaey."
"6114","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''pahlwaan wo nahi hai jo kushtii ladney mein ghalib ho jaey balke aslii pahlwaan to wo hai jo ghussey ki haalat main apne aap par qaabu paaey be qaabu na ho jaaey.''"
"6115","2 aadmiyon ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki maujoodgii mein jhagdaa kya, ham bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein baithey huey they. aik shakhs doosrey ko ghusse ki haalat mein gali de raha tha aur iska chehra surkh tha, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main aik aisa kalima janta hun ke agar ye shakhs usey keh ley to uska ghussa door ho jaey. agar ye أعوذ بالله من الشيطان الرجيم keh ley. sahaba ne us se kaha ke suntey nahi, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kya farma rahe hain? usne kaha ke kya main deewaanaa hoon?"
"6116","aik shakhs ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se arz kya ke mujhey aap koi nasihat farma dijiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ghussa na hua kar. unhon-ne kai martaba ye sawal kya aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ghussa na hua kar."
"6117","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''hayaa se hamesha bhalai paida hoti hai. is par Bashir-bin-kab ne kaha ke hikmat ki kitaabon mein likha hai ke haya se waqaar hasil hota hai"
"6118","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka guzar aik shakhs par se hua jo apne bhai par haya ki wjah se naraz ho raha tha aur keh raha tha ke tum bahut sharmaate (شرماتے) ho, maano wo keh raha tha ke tum uski wjah se apna nuqsan kar letey ho. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke usey chhod do ke haya eman mein se hai."
"6119","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) parda mein rehney wali kunwari ladki se bhi zyada haya waley they."
"6120","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' agley paighambaron ka kalam jo logon ko mila usmein ye bhi hai ke jab sharm hi na rahi to phir jo ji chahey wo kare.''"
"6121","Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huin aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah! Allah haq baat se haya nahi karta kya aurat ko jab ehtilam ho to is par ghusl wajib hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan, agar aurat mani ki tarii dekhey to is par bhi ghusl wajib hai."
"6122","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' momin ki misal us sar-sabz darakht ki hai, jiske patey nahi jhadtey. sahaba ne kaha ke ye falan darakht hai, ye falan darakht hai. mere dil mein aaya ke kahun ke ye khajoor ka darakht hai lekin chunkey mein naujawaan tha, isliye mujh ko boltey huey haya aai. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wo khajoor ka darakht hai. aur isi sanad se Shoba se riwayat hai ke kaha ham se Khubaib bin Abdur-Rehman ne, unse Hafs bin Aasim ne aur unse ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne isi tarah bayan kya aur ye izafa kya ke phir maine iska zikr umr (Raziallahu anhu) se kya to unhon-ne kaha agar tum ne keh diya hota to mujhey itna itnaa maal milney se bhi zyada khushi hasil hoti."
"6123","aik khatun Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huin aur apne aapko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke nikah ke liye pesh kya aur arz kya : kya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko mujh se nikah ki zarurat hai? is par Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ki sahibzadi boliin, wo kitni be-haya thi. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke wo tum se to achi thin unhon-ne apne aapko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke nikah ke liye pesh kya."
"6124","jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein (abu-Moosa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) (aur Muaz-bin-Jabal ko (Yaman) bheja to unse farmaya ke (logon ke liye) aasaaniyaan paida karnaa, tangi mein na daalnaa, unhein khushkhabri sanaanaa, Deen se nafrat na dilaanaa aur tum donon aapas mein ittifaq se kaam karnaa, abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah! ham aisi sar zameen mein ja rahe hain jahan shehad se sharab banai jati hai aur usey (bitaa') kaha jata hai aur jau se sharab banai jati hai aur usey ( مزر‏ ( kaha jata hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke har nasha laney wali cheez haram hai."
"6125","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''aasaanii paida karo, tangi na paida karo, logon ko tasalli aur tashaffii do nafrat na dilaao.''"
"6126","jab bhi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko 2 chizon mein se aik ko ikhtiyar karne ka ikhtiyar diya gaya to aap ne hamesha unmein aasan chizon ko ikhtiyar farmaya, basharte ke usmein gunah ka koi pahlu na hota. agar usmein gunah ka koi pahlu hota to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us se sabse zyada door rahtey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni zaat ke liye kisi se badla nahi liya, albatta agar koi shakhs Allah ki hurmat w had ko todtaa to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unse to mahz Allah ki raza mandi ke liye badla letey."
"6127","Ahwaaz naam ke Iraanii Shahar mein ham aik nehar ke kinarey they jo khushk padi thi, phir abu-Barza Aslami sahabi ghodey par tashrif laey aur Namaz padhi aur ghoda chhod diya. ghoda bhaagney laga to aap ne Namaz tod di aur uska peechhaa kya, aakhir uske qareeb pahunchey aur usey pakad liya. phir wapas aa kar Namaz qaza ki, wahan aik shakhs khaarijii tha, wo kehney laga ke us boodhey ko dekho us ne ghodey ke liye Namaz tod daalii. abu-Barza Aslami (Raziallahu anhu) Namaz se farigh ho kar aaey aur kaha jab se main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se juda hua hun, kisi ne mujh ko malaamat nahi ki aur unhon-ne kaha ke mera ghar yahan se door hai, agar main Namaz padhta rehta aur ghodey ko bhaagney deta to apne ghar raat tak bhi na pahunch paata aur unhon-ne bayan kya ke wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sohbat mein rahe hain aur maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aasan Suraton ko ikhtiyar kartey dekha hai."
"6128","aik dehati ne masjid mein peshab kar diya, log uski taraf maarney ko badhey, lekin Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey chhod do aur jahan us ne peshab kya hai us jagah par pani ka aik dol bharaa hua baha do, kyonke tum aasani karne waley bana kar bhejey gaey ho tangi karne waley bana kar nahi bhejey gaey."
"6129","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ham bachchon se bhi dil lagi kartey, yahan tak ke mere chhotey bhai abu-Umair naam ke se ( mazaaq) farmaatey يا أبا عمير ما amal النغير ''aey abu Umer ! teri nughair naam ke chidiyaa to b-khair hai? ''"
"6130","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke yahan ladkiyon ke sath kheltii thi, meri bahut si saheliyaan thin jo mere sath khelaa karti thin, jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) andar tashrif latey to wo chhup jaatiin phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unhein mere paas bhejtey aur wo mere sath kheltiin."
"6131","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aik shakhs ne andar aaney ki ijazat chahi to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey andar bula lo, ye apni qaum ka bahut hi bura aadmi hai. jab wo shakhs andar aa gaya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uske sath narmii ke sath guftgu farmai. maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah! aap ne abhi iske mutaalliq kya farmaya tha aur phir itni narmii ke sath guftgu farmai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, Aaisha Allah ke nazdeek martabe ke eitibaar se wo shakhs sabse bura hai jisey log uski bd-khulqi ki wjah se chhod dein."
"6132","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas hadiye mein deebaa ki chand qubaaein aaein, unmein soney ke batan lagey huey they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wo qubaaein apne sahaba mein taqseem kar diin aur Makhrima ke liye baqi rakhii, jab Makhrima aaya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye maine tumharey liye chipa rakhi thi. Ayub ne kaha yani apne kapdey mein chipa rakhi thi aap Makhrima ko khush karne ke liye uske takmey ya ghundii ko dikhla rahe they kyonke wo zara sakht mizaaj aadmi they. is hadis ko Hammad-bin-Zaid ne bhi Ayub ke waaste se riwayat kya Mursalaat main aur Hatim bin wardaan ne kaha ham se Ayub ne bayan kya, unse abi Muleka ne aur unse Miswar-bin-Makhrama (Raziallahu anhu) ne ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas chand qubaaein tohfe mein aaiin phir aisi hi hadis bayan ki."
"6133","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''momin ko aik suraakh se dobara dank nahi lag saktaa.''"
"6134","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere paas tashrif laey aur farmaya, kya ye meri khabar sahi hai ke tum raat bhar ibadat kartey rahtey ho aur din mein rozey rakhtey ho? maine kaha ke ji haan ye sahi hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aisa na karo, ibadat bhi karo aur so bhi, rozey bhi rakho aur bila rozey bhi raho, kyonke tumharey jism ka bhi tum par haq hai, tumhari aankhon ka bhi tum par haq hai, tum se mulaqat ke liye aaney walon ka bhi tum par haq hai, tumhari biwi ka bhi tum par haq hai, ummeed hai ke tumhari umr lambi hogi, tumharey liye yahi kafi hai ke har maheene mein teen rozey rakho, kyonke har neki ka badla das guna milta hai, is tarah zindagi bhar ka roza hoga. unhon-ne bayan kya ke maine sakhti chahi to aap ne mere uper sakhti kar di. maine arz kya ke main is se zyada ki taqat rakhta hun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir har haftey teen roza rakha kar, bayan kya ke maine aur sakhti chahi aur aap ne mere uper sakhti kar di. maine arz kya ke main us se bhi zyada ki taqat rakhta hun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir Allah ke Nabi Dawud (Alaihissalam) jaisa roza rakh. maine poochha, Allah ke Nabi Dawud (Alaihissalam) ka roza kaisa tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aik din roza aik din iftaar maano aadhi umr ke rozey ."
"6135","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo shakhs Allah aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhta ho usey apne mehman ki izzat karni chahiye . uski khaatir daari bas aik din aur raat ki hai mehmani teen din aur raaton ki, iske baad jo ho wo sadqa hai aur mehman ke liye jaaiz nahi ke wo apne mezbaan (میزبان) ke paas itney din thahar jaey ke usey tang kar daaley.''"
"6136","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo shakhs Allah aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhta ho, is par lazim hai ke apne padosi ko takleef na de, jo shakhs Allah aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhta ho, is par lazim hai ke apne mehman ki izzat karey aur jo shakhs Allah aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhta ho, is par lazim hai ke bhalii baat kahey warna chup rahe.''"
"6137","ham ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! aap hamein ( tableegh waghaira ke liye) bhejtey hain aur rastey mein ham kuchh qabeelon ke gaaun mein qiyam kartey hain lekin wo hamari mehmani nahi kartey, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka is silsiley mein kya irshad hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par ham se farmaya ke jab tum aisey logon ke paas ja kar utro aur wo jaisa dastoor hai mehmani ke taur par tum ko kuchh dein to usey manzoor kar lo agar na dein to mehmani ka haq qaayde ke muwafiq unse wsool kar lo."
"6138","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo shakhs Allah par aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhta ho usey apne mehman ki izzat karni chahiye aur jo shakhs Allah aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhta ho usey chahiye ke wo sila rehmii karey, jo shakhs Allah aur aakhirat ke din par eman rakhta ho, usey chahiye ke achi baat zaban se nikaley warna chup rahe.''"
"6139","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Salman Farsi aur abu-Darda (Raziallahu anhu) ko bhaai-bhaai bana diya. aik martaba Salman , abu-Darda (Raziallahu anhu) ki mulaqat ke liye tashrif laey aur umme-Dardaa (Raziallahu anhu) ko badi khasta haalat mein dekha aur poochaa kya haal hai? wo boliin tumharey bhaai abu-Darda ko duniya se koi sarokaar nahi. phir abu-Darda tashrif laey to Salman (Raziallahu anhu) ne unke samney khana pesh kya. unhon-ne kaha ke aap khaaiye , main rozey se hun. Salman Farsi (Raziallahu anhu) boley ke main us waqt tak nahi khaaun ga . jab tak aap bhi na khaaein . chunanche abu-Darda ne bhi khaya raat hui to abu-Darda (Raziallahu anhu) Namaz padhney ki taiyaarii karne lagey. Salman ne kaha ke so jaaiye , phir jab aakhir raat hui to abu-Darda ne kaha ab uthiye , bayan kya ke phir donon ne Namaz padhi. iske baad Salman (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke bila shubah tumharey rab ka tum par haq hai aur tumhari jaan ka bhi tum par haq hai, tumhari biwi ka bhi tum par haq hai, isliyen sarey haq daaron ke huquq ada karo. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur aap se iska zikr kya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Salman ne sach kaha hai. abu-Juhaifa ka naam Wahab al-Sawaaii hai, jisey Wahab al-Khair bhi kehtey hain."
"6140","Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kuchh logon ki mezbaanii ki aur Abdur-Rehman se kaha ke mahmaanon ka poori tarah khayal rakhna kyonke main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas jaunga, mere aaney se pahley unhein khana khilaa dena. chunanche Abdur-Rehman khana mahmaanon ke paas laey aur kaha ke khana khaaiye. unhon-ne puchha ke hamarey ghar ke Malik kahan hain? unhon-ne arz kya ke aap log khana kha lein. mahmaanon ne kaha ke jab tak hamarey mezbaan (میزبان) na aa jayen ham khana nahi khaaengey. Abdur-Rehman (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya ke hamari darkhaast qabool kar lijiye kyonke Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke aaney tak agar aap log khaney se farigh nahi ho gaey to hamein unki narazgi ka saamnaa hoga. unhon-ne is par bhi inkar kya. main janta tha ke Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) mujh par naraz hongey. isliye jab wo aaey mein unse bachney laga. unhon-ne puchha : tum logon ne kya kya? ghar walon ne unhein bataya to unhon-ne Abdur-Rehman (Raziallahu anhu) ko pukara ! main khamosh raha. phir unhon-ne pukara ! Abdur-Rehman ! main us martaba bhi khamosh raha. phir unhon-ne kaha arey paa-jii main tujh ko qism deta hun ke agar to meri awaz sun raha hai to bahar aa ja , main bahar nikla aur arz kya ke aap apne mahmaanon se poochh lein. mahmaanon ne bhi kaha Abdur-Rehman sach keh raha hai. wo khana hamarey paas laey they. aakhir walid (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke tum logon ne mera intizar kya, Allah ki qism ! main aaj raat khana nahi khaaun-ga . mahmaanon ne bhi qism kha li Allah ki qism jab tak aap na khaaein ham bhi na khaaengey Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha bhai maine aisi kharaab baat kabhi nahi dekhi . mehmaano ! tum log hamari mezbaanii se kyon inkar kartey ho. khair Abdur-Rehman khana la , wo khana laey to aap ne is par apna hath rakh kar kaha, Allah ke naam se shuru karta hun, pehli haalat (khaanaa na khaney ki qasam) shaitan ki taraf se thi. chunanche unhon-ne khana khaya aur unke sath mehmaanon ne bhi khaayaa."
"6141","Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) apna aik mehman ya kai mehman lekar ghar aaey. phir aap Sham (Syria) hi se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas chaley gaey, jab wo lot kar aaey to meri walida ne kaha ke aaj apne mahmaanon ko chhod kar aap kahan reh gaey they Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne poochaa kya tum ne unko khana nahi khilaaya . unhon-ne kaha ke ham ne to khana unke samney pesh kya lekin unhon-ne inkar kya. ye sun kar Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ko ghussa aaya aur unhon-ne (ghar walon ki) sar-zanish ki aur dukh ka izhar kya aur qism kha li ke main khana nahi khaaun ga . Abdur-Rehman kehtey hain ke main to dar ke maarey chhup gaya to aap ne pukara ke aey paa-jii ! kidhar hai to idhar aa . meri walida ne bhi qism kha li ke agar wo khana nahi khaaengey to wo bhi nahi khaaein gii . iske baad mahmaanon ne bhi qism kha li ke agar Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) nahi khaaengey to wo bhi nahi khaaengey. aakhir Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ye ghussa karna shaitaanii kaam tha, phir aap ne khana mangwaya aur khud bhi mahmaanon ke sath khaya (is khaney mein ye barkat hui) jab ye log aik luqma uthatey to nichey se khana aur bhi badh jata tha. Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : aey bani faraas ki behan ! ye kya ho raha hai, khana to aur badh gaya. unhon-ne kaha ke meri aankhon ki thandak ! ab ye us se bhi zyada ho gaya. jab ham ne khana khaya bhi nahi tha. phir sab ne khaya aur is mein se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein bheja , kehtey hain ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bhi us khaney mein se khaayaa."
"6143","Abdullah-bin Sehal aur muahaiisa bin Masood khaibar se aaey aur khajoor ke baagh mein aik doosrey se juda ho gaey. Abdullah-bin Sehal wahin qatl kar diye gaey. phir Abdur-Rehman bin Sehal aur Masood ke donon betey huwesa aur muahaiisa Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey apne maqtool sathi ( Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu)) ke muqaddima mein guftagu ki. pahley Abdur-Rehman ne bolnaa chaha jo sabse chhotey they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke badey ki badaai karo. (ibne Saeed ne iska maqsad ye) bayan kya ke jo bada hai wo guftagu karey, phir unhon-ne apne sathi ke muqaddima mein guftgu ki. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar tum mein se pachaas (50) aadmi qism kha lein ke Abdullah ko yahudiyon ne maara hai to tum diyat ke mustahiq ho jaogey . unhon-ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! ham ne khud to usey dekha nahi tha (phir iske mutaalliq qism kaisey kha saktey hain?) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir yahood apne pachaas (50) aadmiyon se qism khilwaa kar tum se chhutkara pa lengey. unhon-ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! ye kaafir log hain (unki qism ka kya bharosa) chunanche Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abdullah-bin Sehal ke waarison ko diyat khud apni taraf se ada kar di. Sehal (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke un oonton mein se (jo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein diyat mein diye they) aik ontni ko maine pakda wo thaan mein ghus gaee, us ne aik laat mujh ko lagai aur Leis ne kaha mujh se Yahya ne bayan kya, unse Bashir ne aur unse Sehal ne, Yahya ne yahan bayan kya ke main samajhta hun ke Bashir ne (saath mein 'Raafe'-bin-Khadeej) ke alfaz kahey they. aur Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne bayan kya, unse Yahya ne bayan kya, unse Bashir ne aur unhon-ne sirf Sehal se riwayat ki."
"6144","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mujhey us darakht ka naam bataao , jiski misal musalman ki si hai. wo hamesha apne rab ke hukm se phal deta hai aur uske pat'tey nahi jhadaa kartey. mere dil mein aaya ke keh dun ke wo khajoor ka darakht hai lekin maine keh-naa pasand nahi kya. kyonke majlis mein hazraat Abu-Bakar aur umr (Raziallahu anhu) jaisey akaabir bhi maujood they. phir jab un donon buzurgon ne kuchh nahi kaha to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye khajoor ka darakht hai. jab main apne walid ke sath nikla to maine arz kya ke mere dil mein aaya ke keh dun ye khajoor ka darakht hai, unhon-ne kaha phir tum ne kaha kyon nahi? agar tum ne keh diya hota mere liye itna maal aur asbaab milney se bhi zyada khushi hoti. ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke (maine arz kya) sirf is wjah se maine nahi kaha ke jab maine aapko aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) jaisey buzurgon ko khamosh dekha to maine aap buzurgon ke samney baat karna bura jaanaa."
"6145","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''kuchh she'ron mein daanaaii hoti hai.''"
"6146","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chal rahe they ke aapko patthar se thokar lagi aur aap gir padey, us se aap ki ungli se khoon bahney laga, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye sher padhaa ''tu too aik ungli hai aur kya hai jo zakhmi ho gaee. . . kya hua agar raahe-maulaa main to zakhmi ho gaii.''"
"6147","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ki Shoaraa ke kalam mein se sachcha kalima Labid ka misra'a hai jo ye hai ke Allah ke siwa jo kuchh hai sab ma'doom w fana honey wala hai. Umayya bin abi Salat shaair to qareeb tha ke musalman ho jaey."
"6148","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath jang khaibar mein gaey aur ham ne raat main safar kya, itney mein musalmanon ke aadmi ne Aamir bin Akwaa (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha ke apne kuchh sher ashaar sunao. rawi ne bayan kya ke Aamir shaair they. wo logon ko apni hudi sunaney lagey. ''aey Allah ! agar to na hota to ham hidayat na patey na ham sadqa de saktey aur na Namaz padh saktey. ham tujh par fidaa hon, ham ne jo kuchh pahley gunah kiye unko to maaf kar de aur jab (dushman se) hamara saamnaa ho to hamein Sabit qadam rakh aur ham par sukoon nazil farmaa. jab hamein jang ke liye bulaya jata hai, to ham maujood ho jatey hain aur dushman ne bhi pukar kar ham se nijat chahi hai.'' Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye kon oonton ko haank raha hai jo hudi (oonton ko hankaaney ke liye gaaya janey wala geet) ga raha hai? sahaba ne arz kya ke Aamir bin Akwaa hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah paak is par raham kare. aik sahabi yani umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : ya Rasulullah ! ab to Aamir Shahid huey. kash! aur chand roz aap ham ko Aamir se fayda uthaney detey. rawi ne bayan kya ke phir ham khaibar aaey aur usko gher liya us ghiraao mein ham shadeed faaqon mein mubtala huey, phir Allah Taala ne khaibar walon par ham ko fateh ata farmai jis din un par fateh hui uski Sham ko logon ne jagah-jagah aag jalaaii. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha ke ye aag kaisi hai, kis kaam ke liye tum logon ne ye aag jalaaii hai? sahaba ne arz kya ke gosht pakaaney ke liye. is par aap ne malum farmaya kis cheez ke gosht ke liye? sahaba ne kaha ke basti ke paaltu gadhon ka gosht pakaaney ke liye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke gosht ko bartanon mein se phenk do aur bartanon ko tod do. aik sahabi ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah! ham gosht to phenk dein, magar bartan todney ke bajaey agar dho lein? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya achchha yun hi kar lo. jab logon ne jang ki saf bandi kar li to Aamir ( ibne- Akwaa shaair ( ne apni talwaar se aik Yahudi par waar kya, unki talwaar chhoti thi uski nauk palat kar khud unke ghutnon par lagi aur uski wjah se unki shahadat ho gaee. jab log wapas aaney lagey to Salma ( Aamir ke bhai ( ne bayan kya ke mujhey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dekha ke mere chehrey ka rang badla hua hai. malum farmaya ke kya baat hai? maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! par mere maan aur bap fidaa hon, log keh rahe hain ke Aamir ke aamaal barbad ho gaey. (kyonke unki maut khud unki talwaar se hui hai) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ye kis ne kahaa? maine arz kya : fulaan, fulaan, falan aur Usaid-bin-Huzair Ansari ne. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jisne ye baat kahi us ne jhoot kaha hai unhein to dohra ajr milega. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni 2 ungliyon ko mila kar ishara kya ke wo aabid bhi tha aur Mujahid bhi (to ibadat aur jihad donon ka sawab us ne paya ( Aamir ki tarah to bahut kam bahaadur Arab mein paida huey hain (wo aisa bahaadur aur nek aadmi tha) ."
"6149","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (eik safar ke mauqe par) apni aurton ke paas aaey jo oonton par Sawar ja rahi thin, unke sath Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) Anas ki walida bhi thin. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke afsos , anjasha ! sheeshon ko aahisatagi se ley chal . abu-Qilaba ne kaha ke Nabi Karim ne aurton se mutaalliq aisey alfaz ka istemal farmaya ke agar tum mein koi shakhs istemal karey to tum is par aib joii karo. yani Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka ye irshad ke sheeshon ko narmii se ley chal."
"6150","Hassaan-bin-Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) ne mushrekeen ki hijo karne ki ijazat chahi to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke unka aur mera khandan to aik hi hai (phir to main bhi us hijo mein Sharik ho jaaunga). Hassan (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main hijo se aapko is tarah saaf nikal doonga jis tarah gundhey huey aatey se baal nikal liya jata hai. aur Hisham-bin-Urwa se riwayat hai, unse unke walid ne bayan kya ke main Hassaan-bin-Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) ko Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki majlis mein bura kehney laga to unhon-ne kaha ke Hassan ko bura bhala na kaho, wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf se mushrikon ko jawab deta tha."
"6151","unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se suna wo halaat aur qisson ke tehet Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka tazkira kar rahe they. ke aik baar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tumharey aik bhai ne koi buri baat nahi kahi . aap ka ishara ibne- Rawaha ki taraf tha (apne ashaar mein) unhon-ne yun kaha tha ''aur ham mein Allah ke rasool hain jo uski kitab ki tilawat kartey hain, us waqt jab fajr ki roshni phoot kar phail jati hai. hamein unhon-ne gumrahi ke baad hidayat ka rasta dikhaayaa. to hamarey dil is baat par yaqin rakhtey hain ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jo kuchh farmaya wo zaroor waaqe hoga. aap raat is tarah guzaarey hain ke unka pahlu bistar se juda rehta hai (yani jaag kar) jabke kaafiron ke bojh se unki khuwab gaahein bojhal hui rehti hain.'' Yunus ke sath us hadis ko Aqeel ne bhi Zohri se riwayat kya aur Muhammad-bin Waleed Zubaidi ne Zohri se, unhon-ne Saeed-bin-Musaiyab se aur Abdur-Rehman Aaraj se unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se us hadis ko riwayat kya."
"6152","aey abu-Huraira! mein aapko Allah ki qism de kar poochhta hun, kya aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aey Hassan! Allah ke rasool ki taraf se mushrikon ko jawab do, aey Allaah! roohul-qudus ke zariey unki madad kar. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke haan."
"6153","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hassan (Raziallahu anhu) se farmaya unki hijo karo (yani mushrekeen Quraish ki). ya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( هاجهم (ke alfaz farmaai ( Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) terey sath hain."
"6154","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''agar tum mein se koi shakhs apna pet peep se bharey to ye us se behtar hai ke wo usey sher se bharey.''"
"6155","maine Abu-Saleh se suna aur unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se farmaya ''agar tum mein se koi shakhs apna pet peep se bhar ley to ye us se behtar hai ke wo she'ron se bhar jaaey.''"
"6156","abu-Qaees ke bhai Aflah (mere dudh-sharik chacha ne) mujh se parde ka hukm nazil honey ke baad andar aaney ki ijazat chaahii, maine kaha ke Allah ki qism jab tak Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ijazat na dengey mein andar aaney ki ijazat nahi doongii. kyonke abu-Qaees ke bhai ne mujhey doodh nahi pilaya balke abu-Qaees ki biwi ne doodh pilaya hai. phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey to maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! mard ne to mujhey doodh nahi pilaya tha, doodh to unki biwi ne pilaya tha, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke unhein andar aaney ki ijazat de do, kyonke wo tumharey chacha hain, tumharey hath mein mitti lagey. Urwa ne kaha ke usi wjah se Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) kehti thin ke jitney rishtey khoon ki wjah se haram hotey hain wo doodh pilaaney se bhi haram hi samjho ."
"6157","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( Haj se) waapsii ka irada kya to dekha ke Safiya (Raziallahu anhu) apne khemey ke darwaza par ranjeeda khadi hain kyonke wo haaiza ho gaee thin. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ( عقرى حلقى ( (ye Quraish ka muhaawara hai) ab tum hamein rokogii! phir malum farmaya kya tum ne qurbani ke din tawaaf ifaaza kar liya tha? unhon-ne kaha ke ji haan, farmaya ke phir chalo."
"6158","fateh Makka ke mauqe par main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hui. maine dekha ke aap ghusl kar rahe hain aur aap ki sahibzadi Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ne parda kar diya hai. maine salam kya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum kya ke ye kon hain? maine kaha ke Umme-Hani binte-abi-Talib hun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, Umme-Hani ! marhaba ho. jab aap ghusl kar chukey to khadey ho kar aath (8) rakaat padhin. aap us waqt aik kapdey mein jism Mubarak ko lapetey huey they. jab Namaz se farigh ho gaey to maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! mere bhai ( Ali-bin abi-Talib (Raziallahu anhu)) ka khayal hai ke wo aik aisey shakhs ko qatl karengey jisey maine aman de rakhi hai. yani falan bin Hubaira ko . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Umme-Hani jisey tum ne aman di usey ham ne bhi aman di. Umme-Hani ne bayan kya ke ye Namaz chasht ki thi."
"6159","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik shakhs ko dekha ke qurbani ke liye aik ontni haankey liye ja raha hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke is par Sawar ho kar jaa, unhon-ne kaha ke ye to qurbani ka janwar hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Sawar ho jaa, afsos ( ويلك (dusri ya teesri martaba ye farmaayaa."
"6160","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik shakhs ko dekha ke qurbani ka oont hankaaey ja raha hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se kaha ke to is par Sawar ho jaa. us ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah! ye to qurbani ka oont hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dusri baar ya teesri baar farmaya ke teri kharabi ho, to Sawar ho jaa."
"6161","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik safar mein they aur aap ke sath aap ka aik habshi ghulam tha. unka naam anjasha tha wo hudi (oonton ko tez chalaney ka geet) padh raha tha (jiski wjah se sawari tez chalney lagii). Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''afsos ( ويحك (aey anjasha ! sheeshon ke sath ahista-ahista chal."""
"6162","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney aik shakhs ne doosrey shakhs ki tareef ki. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya afsos ( ويلك ( tum ne apne bhai ki gardan kaat di, teen martaba (ye farmaya ( agar tumhen kisi ki tareef hi karni pad jaey to ye kaho ke falan ke mutaalliq mera ye khayal hai. agar wo baat iske mutaalliq janta ho aur Allah iska nigraan hai main to Allah ke muqaabley mein kisi ko nek nahi keh sakta yani yun nahi keh sakta ke wo Allah ke ilm mein bhi nek hai."
"6163","aik din Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kuchh taqseem kar rahe they. bani Tameem ke aik shakhs zul-khuwesraa ne kaha : ya Rasulullah ! insaf se kaam lijiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, afsos ! agar main hi insaf nahi karunga to phir kon karega . umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : ya Rasulullah ! mujhey ijazat dein to main uski gardan mar dun. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi. iske kuchh ( qabeele waale) aisey log paida hongey ke tum unki Namaz ke muqable main apni Namaz ko maamooli samjhogey aur unke rozon ke muqable main apne rozey ko maamooli samjhogey lekin wo Deen se is tarah nikal chukey hongey jis tarah teer shikar se nikal jata hai. teer ke phal mein dekha jaey to is par bhi koi nishan nahi milega. uski lakdi par dekha jaey to is par bhi koi nishan nahi milega. phir uske dandaanon mein dekha jaey aur is mein bhi kuchh nahi milega phir uske par main dekha jaey to usmein bhi kuchh nahi milega. (yani shikar ke jism ko paar karne ka koi nishaan) teer leed aur khoon ko paar karke nikal chuka hoga. ye log us waqt paida hongey jab logon mein phoot pad jaeygi. (eik khaleefa par muttafiq na hongey) unki nishani unka aik mard (sardaar lashakr) hoga. jiska aik hath aurat ke pistaan ki tarah hoga ya (farmaayaa) gosht ke lothdey ki tarah thul-thul hil raha hoga. abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke main gawahi deta hun ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ye hadis suni aur main gawahi deta hun ke main Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath tha. jab unhon-ne un khaarijiyon se ( naharwaan mein) jang ki thi. maqtooleen mein talash ki gaee to aik shakhs unhiin sifaat ka laya gaya jo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bayan ki thin. iska aik hath pistaan ki tarah ka tha."
"6164","aik sahabi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah! main to tabah ho gaya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, afsos (kya baat huii?) unhon-ne kaha ke maine Ramazan main apni biwi se sohbat kar li. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir aik ghulam aazad kar. unhon-ne arz kya ke mere paas ghulam hai hi nahi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir 2 mahiney mutwaatir rozey rakh. usne kaha ke uski mujh mein taqat nahi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir sath miskinon ko khana khilaa. kaha ke itna bhi main apne paas nahi paata . iske baad khajoor ka aik tokraa aaya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey ley aur sadqa kar de. unhon-ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! kya apne ghar walon ke siwa kisi aur ko? us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai ! sarey Madeene ke donon tanaabon yani donon kinaron mein mujh se zyada koi mohtaaj nahi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) is par itna hans diye ke aap ke aagey ke daant dikhai dene lagey. farmaya ke jao tum hi ley lo. Auzaaee ke sath is hadis ko Yunus ne bhi Zohri se riwayat kya aur Abdur-Rehman bin Khalid ne Zohri se is hadis mein bajaey lafz ( ويحك (ke lafz ( ويلك‏ . Mina ( riwayat kya hai) mana donon ke aik hi hain) ."
"6165","aik dehati ne kaha : ya Rasulullah ! hijrat ke barey mein mujhey kuchh bataiye (uskii niyat hijrat ki thi). Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tujh par afsos! hijrat ko to ney kya samjha hai ye bahut mushkil hai. tumharey paas kuchh oont hain. unhon-ne arz kya ke ji haan, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya kya tum unki zakat ada kartey ho? unhon-ne arz kya ke ji haan, farmaya ke phir saat (7) samandar paar amal kartey raho. Allah tumharey kisi amal ke sawab ko zaaye na karega."
"6166","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, afsos ( ويلكم (ya ( ويحكم ( Shoba ne bayan kya ke shak unke Shekh (Waaqid bin-Muhammad ko) tha. mere baad tum kaafir na ho jana ke aik doosrey ki gardan maarney lago aur nazar ne Shoba se bayan kya ( ويحكم (aur Umar-bin Muhammad ne apne walid se ( ويلكم (ya ( ويحكم (ke lafz naql kiye hain."
"6167","aik badwi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur puchha : ya Rasulullah ! qiyamat Kab aaeygi? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, afsos ( ويلك ( tum ne us qiyamat ke liye kya taiyaarii kar li hai? unhon-ne arz kya maine uske liye to koi taiyaarii nahi ki hai albatta main Allah aur uske rasool se mohabbat rakhta hun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir tum qiyamat ke din unke sath ho, jis se tum mohabbat rakhtey ho. ham ne arz kya aur hamarey sath bhi yahi mamla hoga? farmaya ke haan. ham us din bahut zyada khush huey, phir Mughira ke aik ghulam wahan se guzrey wo mere ham-umr they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar ye bachcha zinda raha to iska budhapa aaney se pahley qiyamat qaaim ho jaeygi."
"6168","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' insan uske sath hai jis se wo mohabbat rakhta hai.''"
"6169","aik shakhs Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! aap ka us shakhs ke barey mein kya irshad hai jo aik jamat se mohabbat rakhta hai lekin unse mail nahi ho saka hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke insan uske sath hai jis se wo mohabbat rakhta hai. is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Jareer-bin-Haazim, Sulaimaan-bin-Qarm aur abu-Awana ne Aamash se ki, unse abu-Waeil ne, unse Abdullah-bin-Masood ne aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne."
"6170","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se arz kya gaya aik shakhs aik jamat se mohabbat rakhta hai lekin us se mil nahi saka hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke insan uske sath hai jis se wo mohabbat rakhta hai. Sufiyan ke sath is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) abu-Muawia aur Muhammad-bin Ubaid ne ki hai."
"6171","aik shakhs ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha : ya Rasulullah ! qiyamat Kab qaaim hogii? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke tum ne uske liye kya taiyaarii ki hai? unhon-ne arz kya ke maine uske liye bahut saari namaazein, rozey aur sadqey nahi taiyaar kar rakhey hain, lekin main Allah aur uske rasool se mohabbat rakhta hun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum uske sath ho jis se tum mohabbat rakhtey ho."
"6172","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ibne-Sayyaad se farmaya ''maine us waqt apne dil mein aik baat chipa rakhi hai, wo kya hai? ''wo bola ( الدخ‏ . Mina ( Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya chal door ho jaa."""
"6175","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) logon ke majma' mein khadey huey aur Allah ki uski shaan ke mutabiq tareef karne ke baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dajjal ka zikr kya aur farmaya ke main tumhen us se daraataa hun. koi Nabi aisa nahi guzra jisne apni qaum ko us se na daraayaa ho. Nuh (Alaihissalam) ne apni qaum ko us se daraayaa lekin main uski tumhen aik aisi nishani bataunga jo kisi Nabi ne apni qaum ko nahi batai tum jantey ho ke wo kaana hoga aur Allah kaana nahi hai."
"6176","jab qabila abdul-Qais ka wafad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke marhaba un logon ko jo aan pahunchey to na wo zaleel huey, na sharminda (khushii se musalman ho gaey warna maarey jatey sharminda hotey ( unhon-ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah! ham qabila Rabe ki shaakh se talluq rakhtey hain aur chunkey hamarey aur aap ke darmyan qabila muzar ke kaafir log rukawat hain isliye ham aap ki khidmat mein sirf hurmat waley mahinon hi mein hazir ho saktey hain (jin mein loot-khasot nahi hoti (aap kuchh aisi jachii-tulii baat bata dein jis par amal karne se ham jannat mein dakhil ho jayen aur jo log nahi aa sakey hain unhein bhi uski dawat pahunchaaein . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke char chaar cheezein hain. Namaz qaaim karo, zakat do, Ramazan ke rozey rakho aur ghaneemat ka panchwan hissey ( baitul-maal ko) ada karo aur dabbaa, hantam, naqeer aur muzaffat mein na piyo."
"6177","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' ahad todney waley ke liye qiyamat mein aik jhanda uthaya jaeyga aur pukar diya jaeyga ke ye falan bin falan ki daghaa bazi ka nishan hai.''"
"6178","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' ahad todney waley ke liye qiyamat mein aik jhanda uthaya jaeyga aur pukara jaeyga ke ye falan bin falan ki daghaa bazi ka nishan hai.''"
"6179","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum mein koi shakhs ye na kahey ke mera nafs paleed ho gaya hai balke ye kahey ke mera dil kharaab ya pareshan ho gaya. ''"
"6180","wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum mein se koi hargiz yun na kahey ke mera nafs paleed ho gaya lekin yun keh sakta hai ke mera dil kharaab ya pareshan ho gaya. ''is hadis ko Aqeel ne bhi ibne-Shahab se riwayat kya hai."""
"6181","Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala farmata hai ke insan zamana ko gali deta hai halanke main hi zamana hun, mere hi hath mein raat aur din hain.''"
"6182","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''angoor (inab) ko (karam) na kaho aur ye na kaho ke haaye zamana ki naamuraadii. kyonke zamana to Allah hi ke ikhtiyar mein hai.''"
"6183","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''log (angoor ko) ( karam ( kehtey hain, ( karam ( to momin ka dil hai.''"
"6184","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kisi ke liye apne aapko qurbaan karne ka lafz kehtey nahi suna, siwa Sad-bin-abi-Waqas ke. maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farma rahe they. teer mar , aey Sad ! mere maan-baap tum par qurbaan hon, mera khayal hai ke ye Uhud ki jang ke mauqe par farmaya,"
"6185","wo aur abu-Talha Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath (Madina Munawra ke liye) rawaana huey. Ummul-Momenin Safiya (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sawari par aap ke peechhey thin, raaste mein kisi jagah ontni ka paon phisal gaya aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Ummul-Momenin gir gaey. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke mera khayal hai abu-Talha ne apni sawari se fauran apne ko gira diya aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein pahunch gaey aur arz kya : ya Nabi Allah ! Allah aap par mujhey qurbaan karey kya aapko koi chot aai ? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi, albatta aurat ko dekho . chunanche abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne kapda apne chehrey par daal liya, phir Ummul-Momenin ki taraf badhey aur apna kapda unke uper daal diya. iske baad wo khadi ho gain aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Ummul-Momenin ke liye abu-Talha ne paalaan mazbut baandhaa. ab aap ne Sawar ho kar phir safar shuru kya, jab Madina Munawra ke qareeb pahunchey (ya yun kaha ke Madina dikhai dene laga ( to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''ham lotney waley hain tauba kartey huey apne rab ki ibadat kartey huey aur uski hamd bayan kartey huey.'' Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usey barabar kehtey rahe yahan tak ke Madina mein dakhil ho gaey."
"6186","ham mein se aik sahib ke yahan bachcha paida hua to unhon-ne iska naam Qasim rakha. ham ne unse kaha ke ham tum ko abul-Qaasim keh kar nahi pukaarengey (kyonke abul-Qaasim Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki kunniyat thi) aur na ham tumhari izzat ke liye aisa karengey. un sahib ne uski khabar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko di, to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke apne betey ka naam Abdur-Rehman rakh ley."
"6187","ham mein se aik shakhs ke yahan bachcha paida hua to unhon-ne iska naam Qasim rakha. sahaba ne unse kaha ke jab tak ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se na poochh lein. ham us naam par tumhari kunniyat nahi honey dengey. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mere naam par naam rakho lekin meri kunniyat na ikhtiyar karo."
"6188","abul-Qaasim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' mere naam par naam rakho lekin meri kunniyat na rakho .''"
"6189","ham mein se aik aadmi ke yahan bachcha paida hua to unhon-ne uska naam Qasim rakha. sahaba ne kaha ke ham tumhari kunniyat abul-Qaasim nahi rakhengey aur na teri aankh us kunniyat se pukar kar thandii karengey. wo shakhs Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur aap se iska zikr kya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke apne ladkey ka naam Abdur-Rehman rakh lo."
"6190","unke walid (huzn bin abi wahab) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke tumhara naam kya hai? unhon-ne bataya ke) huzn ( ) ba-maanaa sakhti ( . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum ( سهل ( ) ba-maanaa narmii ( ho, phir unhon-ne kaha ke mera naam mere walid rakh gaey hain usey mein nahi badloon ga . ibne-Musaiyab (Rahmatullahi-alaih) bayan kartey they ke chunanche hamarey khandan mein baad tak hamesha sakhti aur museebat ka daur raha."
"6191","munzir bin abi Usaid (Raziallahu anhu) ki wilaadat hui to unhein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas laya gaya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bachcha ko apni raan par rakh liya. abu-Usaid (Raziallahu anhu) baithey huey they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kisi cheez mein jo samney thi masroof ho gaey (aur bachcha ki taraf tawajjoh hat gai) . abu-Usaid (Raziallahu anhu) ne bachcha ke mutaalliq hukm diya aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki raan se utha liya gaya. phir jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mutwajjeh huey to farmaya ke bachcha kahan hai? abu-Usaid (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! ham ne usey ghar bhej diya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha : iska naam kya hai? arz kya ke fulaan. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, balke iska naam munzir hai. chunanche isi din Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unka yahi naam munzir rakha."
"6192","Ummul-Momenin Zenab (Raziallahu anha) ka naam barra tha, kaha janey laga ke wo apni paakii zahir karti hain. chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unka naam Zenab rakha."
"6193","main Saeed-bin-Musaiyab ke paas betha hua tha to unhon-ne mujh se bayan kya ke unke dada huzn Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke tumhara naam kya hai? unhon-ne kaha ke mera naam huzn hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum Sehal ho, unhon-ne kaha ke main to apne bap ka rakha hua naam nahi badloonga. Saeed-bin-Musaiyab ne kaha iske baad se ab tak hamarey khandan mein sakhti aur museebat hi rahi. ( حزونة ( se suoobat murad hai."
"6194","maine ibne-abii-Aufii se poochha. tum ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahibzadey Ibrahim ko dekha tha? bayan kya ke unki wafat bachpan hi mein ho gaee thi aur agar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baad kisi Nabi ki aamad hoti to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahibzadey zinda rahtey lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baad koi Nabi nahi aayega ."
"6195","jab aap ke farzand Ibrahim ka intiqal hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' uske liye jannat mein aik doodh pilaaney wali daaya muqarrar ho gaee hai.''"
"6196","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' mere naam par naam rakho, lekin meri kunniyat na ikhtiyar karo kyonke main Qasim ( taqseem karne wala ( hun aur tumharey darmyan (deen ke ilm ko) taqseem karta hoon.'' aur is riwayat ko Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se naql kya."
"6197","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum mere naam par naam rakho lekin tum meri kunniyat na ikhtiyar karo aur jisne mujhey khuwab mein dekha to usne mujhey hi dekha kyonke shaitan meri sura mein nahi aa sakta aur jisne qasdan meri taraf koi jhooti baat mansub ki us ne apna thikana jahannam mein bana liyaa.''"
"6198","mere yahan aik bachcha paida hua to main usey lekar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne iska naam Ibrahim rakha aur aik khajoor apne munh mein narm karke iske munh mein dali aur uske liye barkat ki dua ki phir usey mujhey de diya. ye abu-Musa ki badi aulad thi."
"6199","jis din Ibrahim (Raziallahu anhu) ki wafat hui us din suraj girahan hua tha. usko Abu-Bakra ne bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat kya hai."
"6200","jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sar Mubarak rukoo se uthaya to ye dua ki اللهم أنج الوليد بن الوليد وسلمة بن هشام ، Mina وعياش بن أبي ربيعة ، Mina والمستضعفين بمكة ''aey Allah ! Waleed bin Waleed, Salma bin Hishaam, Ayash bin abi Rabee aur Makka mein doosrey maujood kamzor musalmanon ko nijat de-dey. '' اللهم اشدد وطأتك على مضر ، Mina اللهم اجعلها عليهم سنين كسني يوسف ''aey Allah ! qabila Muzar ke kaafiron ko sakht pakad, aey Allah ! un par Yusuf (Alaihissalam) ke zamane jaisa qahat nazil farmaa. ''"
"6201","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''aey Aaisha! ye Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) hain aur tumhen salam kehtey hain.'' maine kaha aur un par bhi salam aur Allah ki rehmat ho. bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wo cheezein dekhtey they jo ham nahi dekhtey they."
"6202","Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) musaafiron ke saman ke sath thin aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ghulam anjasha aurton ke oont ko haank rahe they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''anjash! zara is tarah aahisatagi se ley chal jaisey sheeshon ko lekar jata hai.''"
"6203","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) husne-akhlaaq mein sab logon se badh kar they, mera aik bhai abu-umair naam ke tha. bayan kya ke mera khayal hai ke bachche ka doodh chhoot chuka tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab tashrif latey to us se mazaaq mein farmatey aey Umer tumhaara nughair naami parinda kahan hai?"" aksar aisa hota ke Namaz ka waqt ho jata aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey ghar mein hotey . aap us bistar ko bichhaaney ka hukm detey jis par aap baithey huey hotey "
"6204","Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ko unki kunniyat abu-Turaab sabse zyada pyari thi aur is kunniyat se unhein pukara jata to bahut khush hotey they kyonke ye kunniyat abu-Turaab khud Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne rakhi thi. aik din Fatima (Raziallahu anha) se khafa ho kar wo bahar chaley aaey aur masjid ki diwar ke paas let gaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unke peechhey aaey aur farmaya ke ye to diwar ke paas letey huey hain. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey to Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ki peeth mitti se bhar chuki thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unki peeth se mitti jhaadtey huey ( piyaar se) farmaney lagey abu-Turaab uth jao ."
"6205","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''qiyaamat ke din Allah ke nazdeek sabse badtareen naam uska hoga jo apna naam shahanshaah rakhey.''"
"6206","Allah ke nazdeek sabse badtareen naam aur kabhi Sufiyan ne aik se zyada martaba ye riwayat is tarah bayan ki ke Allah ke nazdeek sabse badtareen naamon (jama ke seeghey ke saath) mein uska naam hoga jo ''shahanshaah'' apna naam rakhega. Sufiyan ne bayan kya ke abu-Zinaad ke ghair ne kaha ke iska mafhoom hai'' shaahaan Shah '' ."
"6207","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik gadhey par Sawar huey jis par fidak ka bana hua aik kapda bichhaa hua tha, Usama aap ke peechhey sawar they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bani Haris bin khazraj mein Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) ki iyaadat ke liye tashrif ley ja rahe they, ye waqia jange-badr se pahley ka hai ye donon rawaana huey aur rastey mein aik majlis se guzrey jis mein Abdullah-bin-Ubai ibne-Salool bhi tha. Abdullah ne abhi tak apne Islam ka elaan nahi kya tha. us majlis mein kuchh musalman bhi they. buton ki parastish karne waley kuchh mushrekeen bhi they aur kuchh Yahudi bhi they. musalman shurakaa mein Abdullaah-bin-Rawaaha bhi they. jab majlis par (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki) sawari ka ghubaar ud kar padaa to Abdullah-bin-Ubai ne apni chadar naak par rakh li aur kehney laga ke ham par ghubaar na udaao, iske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (qareeb pahunchne ke baad) unhein salam kya aur khadey ho gaey. phir sawari se utar kar unhein Allah ki taraf bulaya aur Quran Majeed ki aayatein unhein padh kar sunaiin. is par Abdullah-bin-Ubai ibne-Salool ne kaha ke bhaley aadmi jo kalam tum ne padha us se behtar kalam nahi ho sakta. agarche waqei ye haq hai magar hamari majlison mein aa kar uski wjah se hamein takleef na diya karo. jo tumharey paas jaey bas usko ye qissey suna diya karo. Abdullaah-bin-Rawaaha (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : zaroor, ya Rasulullah ! aap hamari majlison mein bhi tashrif laya karein kyonke ham usey pasand kartey hain. us maamle par muslmaanon, mushrikon aur yahudiyon ka jhagdaa ho gaya aur qareeb tha ke aik doosrey ke khilaf hath utha dein. lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unhein khamosh kartey rahe aakhir jab sab log khamosh ho gaey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni sawari par baithey aur rawaana huey. jab Sad-bin-Ubada ke yahan pahunchey to unse farmaya ke aey Sad! tum ne nahi suna aaj abu-Hubaab ne kis tarah baatein ki hain. aap ka ishara Abdullah-bin-Ubai ki taraf tha ke usne ye baatein kahi hain Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) boley, mera bap aap par qurbaan ho, ya Rasulullah! aap usey maaf farma dein aur us se darguzar farmaaein, us zaat ki qism jisne aap par kitab nazil ki hai Allah ne aapko sachcha kalam de kar yahan bheja jo aap par utara . aap ke tashrif laney se pahley us Shahar (Madina munawwara) ke baashindey is par muttafiq ho gaey they ke usey (Abdullaah-bin-Ubaii ko) shahi taaj pehna dein aur shahi amama baandh dein lekin Allah ne sachcha kalam de kar aapko yahan bhej diya aur ye tajwiz moquf rahi to wo uski wjah se chid gaya aur jo kuchh aap ne aaj mulaahaza kya, wo usi jalan ki wjah se hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abdullah-bin-Ubai ko maaf kar diya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur aap ke sahaaba, mushrekeen aur ahle-kitab se jaisa ke unhein Allah Taala ne hukm diya tha. darguzar kya kartey they aur unki taraf se pahunchne wali takleefon par sabr kya kartey they. Allah Taala ne bhi irshad farmaya hai ke ''tum un logon se jinhein kitab di gaee hai (azeeyat deh baatein) sunogey.'' doosrey mauqe par irshad farmaya ''bahut se ahle-kitab khahish rakhtey hain.'' chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unhein maaf karne ke liye Allah ke hukm ke mutabiq taujeeh kya kartey they. bil-aakhir aapko ( jang ki) ijazat di gaee. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jange-badr kya aur Allah ke hukm se usmein kuffaar ke badey badey bahaadur aur Quraish ke sardaar qatl kiye gaey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne sahaba ke sath fateh mand aur ghaneemat ka maal liye huey wapas huey, unke sath kuffaare-Quraish ke kitney hi bahaadur sardaar qaid bhi karke laey to us waqt Abdullaah-bin-Ubaii-bin-salool aur uske but-parast mushrik sathi kehney lagey ke ab unka kaam jam gaya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bait kar lo, us waqt unhon-ne Islam par bait ki aur bazahir musalman ho gaey (magar dil mein nifaq rahaa)."
"6208","unhon-ne arz kya ke ya Rasulullah! aap ne janab abu-Taalib ko unki wafat ke baad koi fayda pahunchaayaa, wo aap ki hifazat kya kartey they aur aap ke liye logon par ghussa hua kartey they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan, wo dozakh mein us jagah par hain jahan takhnon tak aag hai agar main na hota to wo dozakh ke nichey ke tabqey mein rehtey."
"6209","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik safar mein they, raaste mein hudi (padhneywaaley ne) hudi padhi to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''aey anjasha! sheeshon ko ahista-ahista lekar chal, tujh par afsos.''"
"6210","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik safar mein they, anjasha naam ke ghulam aurton ki sawaariyon ko qurbani ka janwar padhta lekar chal raha tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ''anjasha! sheeshon ko aahista ley chal.'' abu-Qilaba ne bayan kya ke murad auratein thin."
"6211","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke aik hudi padhney waaley they anjasha naam ke unki awaz badi achi thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ''anjasha! aahista chaal ikhtiyar kar, un sheeshon ko mat tod.'' Qatada ne bayan kya ke murad kamzor auratein thin (ke sawari se gir na jaaein)."
"6212","Madina Munawra par (eik raat naa-maaloom awaz ki wjah se) dar taarii ho gaya. chunanche Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) abu-Talha ke aik ghodey par Sawar huey. phir (waapas aa kar) farmaya ''hamein to koi ( khof ki) cheez nazar na aaii, albatta ye ghoda to maano dariya tha.''"
"6213","kuchh logon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaahinon ke barey mein poochha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke unki (pesheen goiyon ki) koi haisiyat nahi. sahaba ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah! lekin wo kabhi-kabhi aisi baatein kartey hain jo sahi Sabit hoti hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wo baat, sachchii baat hoti hai jisey jin farishton se sun kar uda leta hai aur phir usey apne wali (kaahin) ke kaan mein murgh ki awaz ki tarah daalta hai. iske baad kaahin us (eik sachchii baat) mein so se zyada jhoot mila detey hain."
"6214","mujhey Jabir-bin-Abdullah ne khabar di, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir mere paas wahi aaney ka silsile band ho gaya. aik din mein chal raha tha ke maine aasman ki taraf se aik awaz suni, maine aasman ki taraf nazar uthai to maine phir us farishta ko dekha jo mere paas ghare-hira mein aaya tha, wo aasman w zameen ke darmyan kursi par betha hua tha."
"6215","maine aik raat Memuna (Raziallahu anha) (khaala) ke ghar guzaarii, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi us raat wahin thahrey huey they. jab raat ka aakhiri tehai hissey hua ya uska kuchh hissey reh gaya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uth baithey aur aasman ki taraf dekha phir is aayat ki tilawat ki إن في خلق السموات والأرض واختلاف الليل والنهار لآيات لأولي الألباب‏ ''bila shubah aasman ki aur zameen ki paidaaish main aur din raat ke badaltey rehney mein aql walon ke liye nishaniyan hain.''"
"6216","wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Madina ke baaghon mein se aik baagh mein they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hath mein aik lakdi thi, aap usko pani aur keechad mein mar rahe they. us doran mein aik sahib ne baagh ka darwaza khulwaanaa chaha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya ke uske liye darwaza khol de aur unhein jannat ki khushkhabri suna de. main gaya to wahan Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) maujood they, maine unke liye darwaza khola aur unhein jannat ki khushkhabri sunai phir aik aur sahib ne darwaza khulwaayaa. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke darwaza khol de aur unhein jannat ki khushkhabri suna de is martaba umr (Raziallahu anhu) they. maine unke liye bhi darwaza khola aur unhein bhi jannat ki khushkhabri suna di. phir aik teesrey sahib ne darwaza khulwaayaa. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt tek lagaey huey they ab seedhey baith gaey. phir farmaya darwaza khol de aur jannat ki khushkhabri suna de, un aazmaaishon ke sath jis se (duniyaa mein) unhein do-chaar hona padega. main gaya to wahan Usman (Raziallahu anhu) they. unke liye bhi maine darwaza khola aur unhein jannat ki khushkhabri sunai aur wo baat bhi bata di jo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmai thi. Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha khair Allah madadgaar hai."
"6217","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aik janaaza mein Sharik they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hath mein aik chhadi thi usko aap zameen par mar rahe they phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum mein koi aisa nahi hai jiska jannat ya dozakh ka thikana tay na ho chuka ho. sahaba ne arz kya : phir kyon na ham is par bharosa kar lein. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke amal kartey raho kyonke har shakhs jis thikaaney ke liye paida kya gaya hai usko waisii hi taufeeq di jaeygi. jaisa ke Quran sharif ke sura واللیل mein hai) فأما من أعطى واتقى‏ ( ''jisne Allah ki raah mein khairat ki aur Allah Taala se daraa'' aakhir tak."
"6218","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (raat mein) bedaar huey aur farmaya '' Subhan-Allah ! Allah ki rehmat ke kitney khazaaney aaj nazil kiye gaey hain aur kis tarah ke fitney bhi utaarey gaey hain. kon hai! jo un hujre waaliyon ko jagaaey.'' Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki murad paak beeviyon se thi taake wo Namaz padh lein kyonke bahut si duniya mein kapdey pahnney waaliyaan aakhirat mein nangii hongi aur ibne-abii-saur ne bayan kya, unse Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne aur unse umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha, kya aap ne paak beeviyon ko talaaq de di hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi. maine kaha Allaahu-akbar."
"6219","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak bevi Safiya-bint-Huyi (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein khabar di ke wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas milney aaein. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt masjid mein Ramazan ke aakhiri Ashrey mein aetikaf kiye huey they. isha ke waqt thodi der unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se baatein kiin aur wapas lotney ke liye uthein to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi unhein chhod aaney ke liye khadey ho gaey. jab wo masjid ke us darwaza ke paas pahunchein jahan Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak bevi Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ka hujra tha, to idhar se 2 Ansari sahabi guzrey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko salam kya aur aagey badh gaey. lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke thodi der ke liye thahar jao. ye Safiya-bint-Huyi meri biwi hain. un donon sahaba ne arz kya : sub'haan-Allaah, ya rasoolullaah. un par bada sakht guzraa. lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke shaitan insan ke andar khoon ki tarah daudta rehta hai, isliye mujhey khof hua ke kahin wo tumharey dil mein koi shuba na daal de."
"6220","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kankari phainkney se mana kya tha aur farmaya tha ke wo na shikar mar sakti hai aur na dushman ko koi nuqsan pahuncha sakti hai, albatta aankh phod sakti hai aur daant tod sakti hai."
"6221","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas 2 ashaab chheenkey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik ka jawaab یرحمک اللہ ( Allah tum par raham karey) se diya aur doosrey ka nahi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se uski wjah poochhi gaee to farmaya ke usne الحمدللہ kaha tha (is liye iska jawab diyaa) aur doosrey ne الحمدللہ nahi kaha tha. chheenkney waley ko الحمدللہ zaroor kehna chahiye aur sunney walon ko یرحمک Allaah."
"6222","hamein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne saat (7) baton ka hukm diya tha aur saat (7) kaamon se rokaa tha, hamein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bimar ki mizaaj pursi karne, janaaze ke peechhey chalney, chheenkney waley ke jawab dene, dawat karne waley ki dawat qabool karne, salam ka jawab dene, mazloom ki madad karne aur qism kha leney waley ki qism poori karne mein madad dene ka hukm diya tha aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein saat (7) kaamon se rokaa tha, soney ki anguthi se, ya bayan kya ke soney ke chhalley se, resham aur deebaa aur sundus (deebaa se baareek reshamii kapdaa) pahnney se aur reshamii zeen se."
"6223","aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( farmaya ke) Allah Taala chheenk ko pasand karta hai aur jamaaii ko na-pasand karta hai. isliye jab tum mein se koi shakhs chheenkey aur الحمدللہ kahey to har musalman par jo usey suney , haq hai ke iska jawaab یرحمک اللہ se de. lekin jamaaii shaitan ki taraf se hoti hai isliye jahan tak ho sakey usey rokey kyonke jab wo munh khol kar ha-ha-ha kehta hai to shaitan is par hanstaa hai."
"6224","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jab tum mein se koi chheenkey to (alhamdulillah) kahey aur iska bhai ya iska sathi ( rawi ko shuba tha) ( يرحمك الله ( kahey. jab sathi ( يرحمك الله ( kahey to uske jawab mein chheenkney wala ( يهديكم الله ويصلح بالكم ( .''"
"6225","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki maujoodgii mein 2 aadmiyon ne chheenkaa. lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unmein se aik ki chheenk par یرحمک اللہ kaha aur doosrey ki chheenk par nahi kaha, is par doosra shakhs bola ke ya Rasulullah ! aap ne unki chheenk par یرحمک اللہ farmaya, lekin meri chheenk par nahi farmaayaa? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke unhon-ne الحمدللہ kaha tha aur tum ne nahi kaha tha."
"6226","Allah Taala chheenk ko pasand karta hai kyonke wo kuchh baar sihat ki alamat hai aur jamaaii ko na-pasand karta hai. isliye jab tum mein se koi shakhs chheenkein to wo الحمدللہ kahey lekin jamaaii lena shaitan ki taraf se hota hai. isliye jab tum mein se kisi ko jamaaii aaey to wo apni quwwat w taqat ke mutabiq usey rokey. isliye ke jab tum mein se koi jamaaii leta hai to shaitan hanstaa hai."